<activity rdf:resource="1.1.1.221#SIP8789ECB1C5AFCD15"/>
<rdfs:comment>Oxidizes vomifoliol to dehydrovomifoliol; involved in the metabolism of abscisic acid in Corynebacterium sp.</rdfs:comment>
