<activity rdf:resource="1.1.1.329#SIP7F68EDBD44EA2414"/>
<rdfs:comment>Involved in the biosynthetic pathways of several clinically important aminocyclitol antibiotics, including kanamycin, neomycin and ribostamycin. cf. EC 1.1.99.38.</rdfs:comment>
