<activity rdf:resource="1.1.1.346#SIP47121160BF42371C"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme is involved in ketogluconate metabolism, and catalyzes the reaction in vivo in the reverse direction to that shown.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It is used in the commercial microbial production of ascorbate. cf. EC 1.1.1.274.</rdfs:comment>
