<activity rdf:resource="1.1.1.363#SIP9B76BD57084D8A84"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme catalyzes a step of the pentose phosphate pathway.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme from the Gram-positive bacterium Leuconostoc mesenteroides prefers NADP(+) while the enzyme from the Gram-negative bacterium Gluconacetobacter xylinus prefers NAD(+). cf. EC 1.1.1.49 and EC 1.1.1.388.</rdfs:comment>
