<skos:altLabel>D-glucose 6-dehydrogenase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.1.1.432#SIP5DF4DF431E7C72EE"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, characterized from alphaproteobacteria, is involved in a D-sulfoquinovose degradation pathway.</rdfs:comment>
