<rdfs:comment>Does not use NAD(P)(+) as acceptor.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Contains pyrroloquinoline-quinone. cf. EC 1.1.1.24, EC 1.1.1.1.25, and EC 1.1.1.282.</rdfs:comment>
