<activity rdf:resource="1.1.98.3#SIPCF8AF0BCBDA4C287"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, isolated from the bacterium Mycobacterium smegmatis, is involved, along with EC 1.1.1.333 in the epimerization of trans,octacis-decaprenylphospho-beta-D-ribofuranose to trans,octacis-decaprenylphospho-beta-D-arabinofuranose, the arabinosyl donor for the biosynthesis of mycobacterial cell wall arabinan polymers.</rdfs:comment>
