<activity rdf:resource="1.1.99.7#SIP79CCE3B5F904C8CF"/>
<rdfs:comment>Catalyzes hydrogen transfer from C3 or C4 (S)-2-hydroxy acids to 2-oxo acids.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Contains tightly bound nicotinamide nucleotide in its active center.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>This cofactor cannot be removed without denaturation of the protein.</rdfs:comment>
