<skos:altLabel>D-glucoside 3-dehydrogenase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.1.99.13#SIP588197A0BFBA525E"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzymes from members of the Rhizobiaceae family (such as Agrobacterium tumefaciens) act on disaccharides that contain a glucose moiety at the non-reducing end, such as sucrose, trehalose, leucrose, palatinose, trehalulose, and maltitol, forming the respective 3'-keto derivatives. cf. EC 1.1.2.11.</rdfs:comment>
