<skos:altLabel>p-hydroxybenzaldehyde dehydrogenase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.2.1.64#SIP64148C755DD119CD"/>
<rdfs:comment>The bacterial enzyme (characterized from an unidentified denitrifying bacterium) is involved in an anaerobic toluene degradation pathway.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The plant enzyme is involved in formation of 4-hydroxybenzoate, a cell wall-bound phenolic acid that plays a major role in plant defense against pathogens. cf. EC 1.2.1.96.</rdfs:comment>
