<rdfs:label>3-oxo-5,6-dehydrosuberyl-CoA semialdehyde + H2O + NADP(+) = 3-oxo-5,6-didehydrosuberyl-CoA + 2 H(+) + NADPH.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
