<skos:prefLabel>aldehyde dehydrogenase (quinone)</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>aldehyde dehydrogenase (acceptor)</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.2.5.2#SIPB182446EFD0BF037"/>
<rdfs:comment>Wide specificity; acts on straight-chain aldehydes up to C10, aromatic aldehydes, glyoxylate and glyceraldehyde.</rdfs:comment>
