<rdfs:label>2-oxoglutarate + CoA + 2 oxidized [2Fe-2S]-[ferredoxin] = CO2 + H(+) + 2 reduced [2Fe-2S]-[ferredoxin] + succinyl-CoA.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
