<activity rdf:resource="1.3.1.34#SIPD740F72A92859E16"/>
<rdfs:comment>This bacterial enzyme catalyzes the reduction of either (2E,4E)-2,4-dienoyl-CoA or (2E,4Z)-2,4-dienoyl-CoA to (2E)-2-enoyl-CoA.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme from Escherichia coli contains FAD, FMN, and an [4Fe-4S] iron sulfur cluster. cf. EC 1.3.1.124.</rdfs:comment>
