<skos:altLabel>pretyrosine dehydrogenase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.3.1.43#SIP4C7C2C3C74780D75"/>
<rdfs:comment>Arogenate dehydrogenases may utilize NAD(+) (EC 1.3.1.43), NADP(+) (EC 1.3.1.78), or both (EC 1.3.1.79).</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>NAD(+)-specific enzymes have been reported from some bacteria and plants.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Some enzymes also possess the activity of EC 1.3.1.12.</rdfs:comment>
