<activity rdf:resource="1.3.1.48#SIP360D06E58C459BF4"/>
<activity rdf:resource="1.3.1.48#SIPD0106584EBF84EB5"/>
<rdfs:comment>Reduces 15-oxoprostaglandins to 13,14-dihydro derivatives.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme from placenta is specific for NAD(+).</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/6290839"/>
