<skos:altLabel>geranylgeranyl reductase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.3.1.83#SIP92C68C366BB8DD1D"/>
<rdfs:comment>This enzyme also acts on geranylgeranyl-chlorophyll a.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The reaction occurs in three steps.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Which order the three double bonds are reduced is not known.</rdfs:comment>
