<skos:altLabel>unsaturated acyl coenzyme A reductase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.3.1.86#SIP3F17AC45E21A3CD0"/>
<rdfs:comment>Catalyzes the reaction in the reverse direction.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>This enzyme from Streptomyces collinus is specific for (E)-but-2-enoyl-CoA, and is proposed to provide butanoyl-CoA as a starter unit for straight-chain fatty acid biosynthesis.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/8521864"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="1.3.1.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="1.3.1.-"/>
