<activity rdf:resource="1.3.1.97#SIP7E2AFCC17702888B"/>
<rdfs:comment>Isolated from the green alga Botryococcus braunii BOT22.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Acts in the reverse direction.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Involved in the production of botryococcenes, which are triterpenoid hydrocarbons of isoprenoid origin produced in large amount by this alga.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/21746901"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="1.3.1.-"/>
