<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.3.1.113">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>(4-alkanoyl-5-oxo-2,5-dihydrofuran-3-yl)methyl phosphate reductase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.3.1.113#SIP1E2BFC5B74F3DE1B"/>
<activity rdf:resource="1.3.1.113#SIP2C323E30E54BC18D"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, characterized from the bacteria Streptomyces griseus and Streptomyces coelicolor, is involved in the biosynthesis of gamma-butyrolactone autoregulators that control secondary metabolism and morphological development in Streptomyces bacteria.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/17277085"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="1.3.1.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="1.3.1.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.3.1.113#SIP1E2BFC5B74F3DE1B">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>a [(3S,4R)-4-alkanoyl-5-oxooxolan-3-yl]methyl phosphate + NADP(+) = a (4-alkanoyl-5-oxo-2,5-dihydrofuran-3-yl)methyl phosphate + H(+) + NADPH.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.3.1.113#SIP2C323E30E54BC18D">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>[(3S,4R)-4-(6-methylheptanoyl)-5-oxooxolan-3-yl]methyl phosphate + NADP(+) = [4-(6-methylheptanoyl)-5-oxo-2H-furan-3-yl]methyl phosphate + H(+) + NADPH.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/17277085">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Citation"/>
<skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/pubmed/17277085"/>
<foaf:primaryTopicOf rdf:resource="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/17277085"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.3.1.114">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>3-dehydro-bile acid Delta(4,6)-reductase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.3.1.114#SIP88D7AB30ADC8CD97"/>
<activity rdf:resource="1.3.1.114#SIP3E25097A4C5E0698"/>
<activity rdf:resource="1.3.1.114#SIP5BCDADDDA6FB9A41"/>
<activity rdf:resource="1.3.1.114#SIP4A06192E85445E5F"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, characterized from the bacterium Clostridium scindens, participates in the bile acid 7alpha-dehydroxylation pathway.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme catalyzes two subsequent reductions of the double bonds within the bile acid A/B rings, following 7alpha-dehydration.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/29217478"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="1.3.1.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="1.3.1.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.3.1.114#SIP88D7AB30ADC8CD97">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>3-oxocholan-24-oyl-CoA + NAD(+) = 3-oxochol-4-en-24-oyl-CoA + H(+) + NADH.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.3.1.114#SIP3E25097A4C5E0698">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>3-oxochol-4-en-24-oyl-CoA + NAD(+) = 3-oxochol-4,6-dien-24-oyl-CoA + H(+) + NADH.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.3.1.114#SIP5BCDADDDA6FB9A41">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>12alpha-hydroxy-3-oxocholan-24-oyl-CoA + NAD(+) = 12alpha-hydroxy-3-oxochol-4-en-24-oyl-CoA + H(+) + NADH.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.3.1.114#SIP4A06192E85445E5F">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>12alpha-hydroxy-3-oxochol-4-en-24-oyl-CoA + NAD(+) = 12alpha-hydroxy-3-oxochola-4,6-dien-24-oyl-CoA + H(+) + NADH.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/29217478">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Citation"/>
<skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/pubmed/29217478"/>
