<skos:prefLabel>7beta-hydroxy-3-oxochol-24-oyl-CoA 4-desaturase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.3.1.116#SIP38D591DE27F39DB2"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, characterized from the bacterium Clostridium scindens, participates in the bile acid 7alpha-dehydroxylation pathway.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme catalyzes the stereo-specific oxidation of its substrate and has no activity with the 7alpha anomer. cf. EC 1.3.1.115.</rdfs:comment>
