<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.3.1.123">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>7-epi-iridoid synthase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.3.1.123#SIPB74583821349D7C0"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, characterized from the plant Antirrhinum majus (snapdragon), is involved in biosynthesis of 7-epi-iridoids such as antirrhinoside.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme catalyzes the stereospecific reduction of 8-oxogeranial, forming an unstable product that in the absence of additional cylases undergoes spontaneous cyclization to (-)-cis,trans-nepetalactol. cf. EC 1.3.1.122.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/28701463"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/30664302"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="1.3.1.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="1.3.1.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.3.1.123#SIPB74583821349D7C0">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>(R)-8-oxocitronellyl enol + NADP(+) = (6E)-8-oxogeranial + H(+) + NADPH.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
