<skos:prefLabel>pyrroloquinoline-quinone synthase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.3.3.11#SIPEED2DA48F825EB24"/>
<rdfs:comment>So far only a single turnover of the enzyme has been observed, and the pyrroloquinoline quinone remains bound to it; it is not yet known what releases the product in the bacterium.</rdfs:comment>
