<rdfs:label>6-(2-amino-2-carboxyethyl)-7,8-dioxo-1,2,3,4,7,8-hexahydroquinoline-2,4-dicarboxylate + 3 O2 = H(+) + 2 H2O + 2 H2O2 + pyrroloquinoline quinone.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
