<activity rdf:resource="1.3.3.13#SIP88BA37B28674D8F5"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme can also oxidize several other cyclo dipeptides, the best being cyclo(L-tryptophyl-L-tryptophyl) and cyclo(L-phenylalanyl-L-phenylalanyl).</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/11248691"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/12498889"/>
