<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.3.3.15">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>coproporphyrinogen III oxidase (coproporphyrin-forming)</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.3.3.15#SIP41A9566FC9C8C2D7"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, present in Gram-positive bacteria, participates in heme biosynthesis.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It can also catalyze the reaction of EC 1.3.3.4 at a lower level.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/7928957"/>
