<activity rdf:resource="1.3.3.17#SIPD54C0D8FDEF651A2"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, characterized from the bacterium Aromatoleum aromaticum, is involved in degradation of (indol-3-yl)acetate, where it is believed to function on (2-aminobenzyl)malonyl-CoA.</rdfs:comment>
