<rdfs:comment>The enzyme participates in heme b biosynthesis.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>In the bacterium Escherichia coli it interacts with either ubiquinone or menaquinone, depending on whether the organism grows aerobically or anaerobically.</rdfs:comment>
