<rdfs:comment>The enzyme from Synechococcus can also use NAD(+) and NADP(+) as electron acceptor under anaerobic conditions.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme from Gentiana lutea shows no activity with NAD(+) or NADP(+).</rdfs:comment>
