<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.3.7.1">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>6-hydroxynicotinate reductase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>6-hydroxynicotinic reductase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>6-oxotetrahydro-nicotinate dehydrogenase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>HNA reductase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.3.7.1#SIPCB11D5F8148E3E40"/>
<rdfs:comment>Forms part of the nicotinate-fermentation catabolism pathway in Eubacterium barkeri.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Other enzymes involved in this pathway are EC 1.17.5.1, EC 3.5.2.18, EC 1.1.1.291, EC 5.4.99.4, EC 5.3.3.6, EC 4.2.1.85 and EC 4.1.3.32.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/5767303"/>
