<rdfs:label>1,4,5,6-tetrahydro-6-oxonicotinate + oxidized 2[4Fe-4S]-[ferredoxin] = 6-hydroxynicotinate + 2 H(+) + reduced 2[4Fe-4S]-[ferredoxin].</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
