<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.3.8.2">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>4,4'-diapophytoene desaturase (4,4'-diapolycopene-forming)</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>4,4'-diapophytoene desaturase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>dehydrosqualene desaturase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.3.8.2#SIPED17151EB1AE2BBF"/>
<activity rdf:resource="1.3.8.2#SIP1AB18756E49CC6C7"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme catalyzes four successive dehydrogenations, resulting in production of 4,4'-diapolycopene.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>While the enzyme from Staphylococcus aureus was only shown to produce 4,4'-diaponeurosporene in vivo, it is able to catalyze the last reaction in vitro.</rdfs:comment>
