<rdfs:label>2-methylbutanoyl-CoA + H(+) + oxidized [electron-transfer flavoprotein] = (2E)-2-methylbut-2-enoyl-CoA + reduced [electron-transfer flavoprotein].</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
