<rdfs:label>glutaryl-CoA + 2 H(+) + oxidized [electron-transfer flavoprotein] = (2E)-butenoyl-CoA + CO2 + reduced [electron-transfer flavoprotein].</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
