<activity rdf:resource="1.3.8.13#SIP950E1A788605A7BF"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme has been purified from the bacterium Escherichia coli O44 K74, in which it forms a complex with EC 2.8.3.21.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The electron donor is believed to be an electron-transfer flavoprotein (ETF) encoded by the fixA and fixB genes.</rdfs:comment>
