<skos:prefLabel>2-amino-4-deoxychorismate dehydrogenase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>2-amino-2-deoxyisochorismate dehydrogenase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>ADIC dehydrogenase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.3.8.16#SIP0ECD93C9C9D4CFB7"/>
<rdfs:comment>The sequential action of EC 2.6.1.86 and this enzyme leads to the formation of the benzoxazolinate moiety of the enediyne antitumor antibiotic C-1027.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/18182490"/>
