<skos:prefLabel>carvone reductase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.3.99.25#SIP65B508028FB05729"/>
<activity rdf:resource="1.3.99.25#SIPC5CD68515633E7DF"/>
<rdfs:comment>Participates in the carveol and dihydrocarveol degradation pathway of the Gram-positive bacterium Rhodococcus erythropolis DCL14.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Has not been purified, and requires an unknown cofactor, which is different from NAD(+), NADP(+) or a flavin.</rdfs:comment>
