<skos:prefLabel>phytoene desaturase (zeta-carotene-forming)</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>2-step phytoene desaturase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.3.99.29#SIPCC47A085C7204327"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme is involved in carotenoid biosynthesis and catalyzes up to two desaturation steps (cf. EC 1.3.99.28, EC 1.3.99.30 and EC 1.3.99.31).</rdfs:comment>
