<activity rdf:resource="1.4.1.12#SIPB45FCA20A5AB2225"/>
<activity rdf:resource="1.4.1.12#SIP63A64E0ECDBC05B4"/>
<rdfs:comment>Also acts, more slowly, on 2,5-diaminohexanoate forming 2-amino-5-oxohexanoate, which then cyclizes non-enzymically to 1-pyrroline-2-methyl-5-carboxylate.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It has equal activity with NAD(+) and NADP(+) (cf. EC 1.4.1.26).</rdfs:comment>
