<activity rdf:resource="1.4.2.3#SIP83972DEA4EDD040C"/>
<rdfs:comment>Contains one non-covalently bound FAD molecule per dimer.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>This enzyme, characterized from the soil bacteria Pseudomonas sp. HZN6, and Pseudomonas putida S16, is involved in nicotine degradation.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/22267672"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/35835223"/>
