<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.4.3.26">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>pre-mycofactocin synthase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.4.3.26#SIP63F9797469B36D9D"/>
<rdfs:comment>A flavoprotein (FMN).</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme participates in the biosynthesis of the enzyme cofactor mycofactocin.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme uses oxygen as an electron source to oxidize a C-N bond, followed by spontaneous exchange with water to form an alpha-keto moiety on the resulting molecule.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/31381312"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="1.4.3.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="1.4.3.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.4.3.26#SIP63F9797469B36D9D">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>3-amino-5-[(4-hydroxyphenyl)methyl]-4,4-dimethyl-2-pyrrolidin-2-one + H2O + O2 = H2O2 + NH4(+) + pre-mycofactocin.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/31381312">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Citation"/>
<skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/pubmed/31381312"/>
<foaf:primaryTopicOf rdf:resource="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/31381312"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.4.3.27">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>homospermidine oxidase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.4.3.27#SIPC92D9E1455D168AF"/>
<rdfs:comment>The copper-containing enzyme has been isolated from the plant Heliotropium indicum.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It is involved in the biosynthesis of the pyrrolizidine alkaloid (-)-trachelanthamidine which acts as a secondary metabolite for the defense against herbivores.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The oxidation of sym-homospermidine proceeds in three steps and results in a cyclization.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/35212762"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="1.4.3.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="1.4.3.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.4.3.27#SIPC92D9E1455D168AF">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>H2O + 2 O2 + sym-homospermidine = 1-formylpyrrolizidine + 2 H2O2 + 2 NH4(+).</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/35212762">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Citation"/>
