<skos:prefLabel>glycine dehydrogenase (cyanide-forming)</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>HCN synthase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>hydrogen cyanide synthase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.4.99.5#SIP584706C6A282166D"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme is membrane-bound, and the 2-electron acceptor is a component of the respiratory chain.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme can act with various artificial electron acceptors, including phenazine methosulfate.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/233722"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/234422"/>
