<skos:altLabel>MSOX</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>sarcosine oxidasee</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.5.3.1#SIP0B0876FCAF352A9E"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, reported from bacteria and fungi, catalyzes the oxidative demethylation of sarcosine.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It contains a FAD cofactor bound to an L-cysteine residue. cf. EC 1.5.3.24.</rdfs:comment>
