<skos:prefLabel>N(8)-acetylspermidine oxidase (propane-1,3-diamine-forming)</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.5.3.15#SIPBBBDAA037320E3F0"/>
<rdfs:comment>Also active with N(1)-acetylspermine, weak activity with N(1),N(12)-diacetylspermine.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>No activity with diaminopropane, putrescine, cadaverine, diaminohexane, norspermidine, spermine and spermidine.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Absence of monoamine oxidase (EC 1.4.3.4) activity.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Differs in specificity from EC 1.5.3.13, EC 1.5.3.14, EC 1.5.3.16 and EC 1.5.3.17.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/1565141"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="1.5.3.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="1.5.3.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
