<skos:altLabel>N-carboxymethylalkylamine:oxygen oxidoreductase (decarboxymethylating)</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.5.3.20#SIPBBDB7CD35AB144DA"/>
<rdfs:comment>Isolated from the mold Cladosporium sp. G-10.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Acts on N(6)-(carboxymethyl)lysine, 6-[(carboxymethy)amino]hexanoic acid, sarcosine and N-ethylglycine.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It has negligible action on glycine (cf. EC 1.4.3.19).</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/9989229"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="1.5.3.-"/>
