<rdfs:label>5-methyl-5,6,7,8-tetrahydromethanopterin + H(+) + oxidized coenzyme F420-(gamma-L-Glu)(n) = 5,10-methylenetetrahydromethanopterin + reduced coenzyme F420-(gamma-L-Glu)(n).</rdfs:label>
