<activity rdf:resource="1.6.3.2#SIP918F0CC19566FB38"/>
<activity rdf:resource="1.6.3.2#SIPE4263BE9EF2EAA16"/>
<rdfs:comment>NADPH is a better substrate than NADH.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>By removal of oxygen the enzyme is involved in aerobic tolerance in the thermophilic anaerobic archaeon Thermococcus profundus and in Giardia intestinalis, a microaerophilic single-celled parasite of the order Diplomonadida.</rdfs:comment>
