<skos:altLabel>H2O2-forming NADH oxidase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.6.3.3#SIPE1DEE085E7BCEF06"/>
<rdfs:comment>The bacterium Streptococcus mutans contains two distinct NADH oxidases, a H2O2-forming enzyme and a H2O-forming enzyme (cf. EC 1.6.3.4).</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzymes from the anaerobic archaea Methanocaldococcus jannaschii and Pyrococcus furiosus also produce low amounts of H2O.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Unlike EC 1.6.3.1 it has no activity toward NADPH.</rdfs:comment>
