<activity rdf:resource="1.6.5.2#SIPB25D778C807C636F"/>
<activity rdf:resource="1.6.5.2#SIPF182BFBDFF0FC27F"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme catalyzes a two-electron reduction and has a preference for short-chain acceptor quinones, such as ubiquinone, benzoquinone, juglone and duroquinone.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The animal, but not the plant, form of the enzyme is inhibited by dicoumarol.</rdfs:comment>
