<skos:altLabel>hydroxybenzoquinone reductase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.6.5.7#SIPF227084F46B68C09"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme differs in substrate speificity from other quinone reductases.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme in Burkholderia cepacia is inducible by 2,4,5-trichlorophenoxyacetate.</rdfs:comment>
