<activity rdf:resource="1.6.5.9#SIPB25D778C807C636F"/>
<rdfs:comment>A flavoprotein (FAD or FMN).</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Occurs in mitochondria of yeast and plants, and in aerobic bacteria.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Has low activity with NADPH.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Unlike EC 7.1.1.2, this enzyme does not pump proteons of sodium ions across the membrane.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It is also not sensitive to rotenone.</rdfs:comment>
