<skos:altLabel>NADH-nitrite oxidoreductase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>nitrite reductase (reduced nicotinamide adenine dinucleotide)</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.7.1.15#SIP88A0136B5BBCAF0F"/>
<rdfs:comment>This prokaryotic enzyme is specific for NADH.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>In addition to catalyzing the 6-electron reduction of nitrite to ammonia, the enzyme from Escherichia coli can also catalyze the 2-electron reduction of hydroxylamine to ammonia. cf. EC 1.7.1.4.</rdfs:comment>
