<skos:altLabel>multiheme nitrite reductase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.7.2.2#SIPDEAFC8339F70F84C"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme also reduces nitric oxide and hydroxylamine to ammonia, and sulfite to sulfide.</rdfs:comment>
