<activity rdf:resource="1.7.2.3#SIPA7720001629ACDA8"/>
<activity rdf:resource="1.7.2.3#SIP83F5DB167FFD3F13"/>
<rdfs:comment>Contains bis(molybdopterin guanine dinucleotide)molybdenum cofactor.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The reductant is a membrane-bound multiheme cytochrome c.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Also reduces dimethyl sulfoxide to dimethyl sulfide.</rdfs:comment>
