<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.7.2.4">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<replaces rdf:resource="1.7.99.6"/>
<skos:prefLabel>nitrous-oxide reductase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.7.2.4#SIP7A2FCACFCD071D97"/>
<rdfs:comment>The reaction is observed only in the direction of nitrous oxide reduction.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Contains the mixed-valent dinuclear CuA species at the electron entry site of the enzyme, and the tetranuclear Cu-Z center in the active site.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>In Paracoccus pantotrophus, the electron donor is cytochrome c552.</rdfs:comment>
