<activity rdf:resource="1.7.2.5#SIP781F0367B6054136"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme from Pseudomonas aeruginosa contains a dinuclear center comprising a non-heme iron center and heme b3, plus heme c, heme b and calcium; the acceptor is cytochrome c551.</rdfs:comment>
