</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.7.3.1">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>nitroalkane oxidase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>NAO</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>nitroethane oxidase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>nitroethane reductase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.7.3.1#SIP3B2C1904F0E1BEF6"/>
<activity rdf:resource="1.7.3.1#SIP0021B4331D8093EE"/>
<activity rdf:resource="1.7.3.1#SIP030294EEEF4F7326"/>
<rdfs:comment>While nitroethane may be the physiological substrate, the enzyme also acts on several other nitroalkanes, including 1-nitropropane, 2-nitropropane, 1-nitrobutane, 1-nitropentane, 1-nitrohexane, nitrocyclohexane and some nitroalkanols.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Differs from EC 1.13.12.16 in that the preferred substrates are neutral nitroalkanes rather than anionic nitronates.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/22538"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/11867731"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/14907722"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/15581574"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/15713081"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="1.7.3.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="1.7.3.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.7.3.1#SIP3B2C1904F0E1BEF6">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>a primary nitroalkane + H2O + O2 = an aldehyde + H(+) + H2O2 + nitrite.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.7.3.1#SIP0021B4331D8093EE">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>a secondary nitroalkane + H2O + O2 = a ketone + H(+) + H2O2 + nitrite.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.7.3.1#SIP030294EEEF4F7326">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>H2O + nitroethane + O2 = acetaldehyde + H(+) + H2O2 + nitrite.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
