<skos:prefLabel>3-aci-nitropropanoate oxidase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.7.3.5#SIPEABFD1231E6F92DB"/>
<rdfs:comment>The primary products of the enzymatic reaction are probably the nitropropanoate free radical and superoxide.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Also acts, more slowly, on 4-aci-nitrobutanoate.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/3667582"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="1.7.3.-"/>
