<skos:prefLabel>assimilatory sulfite reductase (NADPH)</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>sulfite reductase (NADPH)</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.8.1.2#SIP6B2ABBD085E09A15"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, which catalyzes the six-electron reduction of sulfite to sulfide, is involved in sulfate assimilation in bacteria and yeast.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Different from EC 1.8.99.5, which is involved in prokaryotic sulfur-based energy metabolism.</rdfs:comment>
