<rdfs:label>[thioredoxin]-disulfide + adenosine 3',5'-bisphosphate + 2 H(+) + sulfite = 3'-phosphoadenylyl sulfate + [thioredoxin]-dithiol.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
