<skos:prefLabel>adenylyl-sulfate reductase (thioredoxin)</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>thioredoxin-dependent 5'-adenylylsulfate reductase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.8.4.10#SIPF05D7EB9B91557C9"/>
<rdfs:comment>Uses adenylyl sulfate, not phosphoadenylyl sulfate, distinguishing this enzyme from EC 1.8.4.8.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Uses thioredoxin as electron donor, not glutathione or other donors, distinguishing it from EC 1.8.4.9 and EC 1.8.99.2.</rdfs:comment>
