<activity rdf:resource="1.8.4.13#SIP546B1F9C676759AF"/>
<rdfs:comment>The reaction occurs in the opposite direction to that given above.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Dithiothreitol can replace reduced thioredoxin.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>L-Methionine (R)-S-oxide is not a substrate (see EC 1.8.4.14).</rdfs:comment>
