<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.8.5.5">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>thiosulfate reductase (quinone)</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.8.5.5#SIPF86B907C8E94ED10"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, characterized from the bacterium Salmonella enterica, is similar to EC 1.17.5.3.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The reaction occurs in vivo in the direction of thiosulfate disproportionation, which is highly endergonic.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It is driven by the proton motive force that occurs across the cytoplasmic membrane.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/3108233"/>
