<rdfs:label>3 H2O + hydrogen sulfide + 6 oxidized [2Fe-2S]-[ferredoxin] = 7 H(+) + 6 reduced [2Fe-2S]-[ferredoxin] + sulfite.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
