<rdfs:label>1-(4-hydroxy-3-methoxyphenyl)-2-(2-methoxyphenoxy)propane-1,3-diol + H2O2 = glycolaldehyde + guaiacol + H2O + vanillin.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
