<activity rdf:resource="1.11.1.23#SIP97E0A165F6F313F5"/>
<rdfs:comment>This is the last enzyme in the biosynthetic pathway of fosfomycin, a broad-spectrum antibiotic produced by certain Streptomyces species.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Contains non heme iron that forms a iron(IV)-oxo (ferryl) complex with hydrogen peroxide, which functions as a proton abstractor from the substrate.</rdfs:comment>
