<activity rdf:resource="1.12.1.4#SIP90E1ADA075A7C4E7"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme from Thermotoga maritima contains a [FeFe] cluster (H-cluster) and iron-sulfur clusters.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It works in the direction evolving hydrogen as a means of eliminating excess reducing equivalents.</rdfs:comment>
