<rdfs:comment>A common plant lipoxygenase that oxidizes linoleate and alpha-linolenate, the two most common polyunsaturated fatty acids in plants, by inserting molecular oxygen at the C13 position with (S)-configuration.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>This enzyme produces precursors for several important compounds, including the plant hormone jasmonic acid.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>EC 1.13.11.58 catalyzes a similar reaction at the second available position of these fatty acids.</rdfs:comment>
