<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.13.11.59">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>torulene dioxygenase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.13.11.59#SIP61656B7771F01495"/>
<rdfs:comment>It is assumed that 3-methylbut-2-enal is formed.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme cannot cleave the saturated 3',4'-bond of gamma-carotene which implies that a 3',4'-double bond is neccessary for this reaction.</rdfs:comment>
