<activity rdf:resource="1.13.11.74#SIPCBDE0A3CBFBBB921"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, is an extradiol-type dioxygenase that utilizes a non-heme ferrous iron to cleave the aromatic ring at the meta position (relative to the hydroxyl substituent).</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme also has some activity with 2-amino-5-methylphenol and 2-amino-4-methylphenol.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme from the bacterium Comamonas testosteroni CNB-1 also has the activity of EC 1.13.11.76.</rdfs:comment>
