<activity rdf:resource="1.13.11.76#SIP99A5B3E2F4C14ACC"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, a member of the nonheme-iron(II)-dependent dioxygenase family, is an extradiol-type dioxygenase that utilizes a non-heme ferrous iron to cleave the aromatic ring at the meta position (relative to the hydroxyl substituent).</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme from the bacterium Comamonas testosteroni CNB-1 also has the activity of EC 1.3.1.74.</rdfs:comment>
