<skos:altLabel>3-sulfanylpropanoate dioxygenase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.13.11.91#SIP2657D55E1139F16F"/>
<rdfs:comment>This bacterial enzyme contains an iron(2+) atom coordinated by three protein-derived histidines and a Ser-His-Tyr motif.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It is similar to EC 1.13.11.20 and can act on L-cysteine, but has a much higher activity with its native substrate, 3-sulfanylpropanoate.</rdfs:comment>
