<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.13.12.18">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>dinoflagellate luciferase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.13.12.18#SIP06E9C14E4B867D4B"/>
<rdfs:comment>A luciferase from dinoflagelates such as Gonyaulax polyhedra, Lingulodinium polyedrum, Noctiluca scintillans, and Pyrocystis lunula.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It is a single protein with three luciferase domains.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The luciferin is strongly bound by a luciferin binding protein above a pH of 7.</rdfs:comment>
