<skos:prefLabel>4-hydroxy-3-prenylbenzoate synthase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.13.12.23#SIPA4C3A656EA082256"/>
<rdfs:comment>Isolated from the bacterium Streptomyces roseochromogenes DS 12976.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>A bifunctional enzyme involved in clorobiocin biosynthesis that also catalyzes the activity of EC 1.13.11.83.</rdfs:comment>
