<skos:altLabel>naringenin 3-dioxygenase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>naringenin 3-hydroxylase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.11.9#SIP0C06017C6230F5A2"/>
<rdfs:comment>This plant enzyme catalyzes an early step in the flavonoid biosynthesis pathway, leading to the production of flavanols and anthocyanins.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Substrates include (2S)-naringenin, (2S)-eriodictyol, (2S)-dihydrotricetin and (2S)-pinocembrin.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Some enzymes are bifuctional and also catalyze EC 1.14.20.6.</rdfs:comment>
