<skos:prefLabel>clavaminate synthase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>clavaminic acid synthase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.11.21#SIPC580871F9BC5FBC5"/>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.11.21#SIP302DC351A8DEBC67"/>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.11.21#SIP5471FF320C1FC503"/>
<rdfs:comment>Catalyzes three separate oxidative reactions in the pathway for the biosythesis of the beta-lactamase inhibitor clavulanate in Streptomyces clavuligerus.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The first step (hydroxylation) is separated from the latter two (oxidative cyclization and desaturation) by the action of EC 3.5.3.22.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The three reactions are all catalyzed at the same nonheme iron site.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/1998687"/>
