<skos:altLabel>3'-methylcephem hydroxylase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>DACS</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>DAOC hydroxylase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>deacetoxycephalosporin C hydroxylase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>deacetylcephalosporin C synthase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.11.26#SIP6172788078994B30"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme can also use 3-exomethylenecephalosporin C as a substrate to form deacetoxycephalosporin C, although more slowly.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>In Acremonium chrysogenum, the enzyme forms part of a bifunctional protein along with EC 1.14.20.1.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It is a separate enzyme in Streptomyces clavuligerus.</rdfs:comment>
