<replaces rdf:resource="1.14.11.n1"/>
<skos:prefLabel>L-asparagine oxygenase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>L-asparagine 3-hydroxylase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.11.39#SIP8C4C9D3F1EBF55AC"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme is only able to hydroxylate free L-asparagine.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It is not active toward D-asparagine.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The beta-hydroxylated asparagine produced is incorporated at position 9 of the calcium-dependent antibiotic (CDA), an 11-residue non-ribosomally synthesized acidic lipopeptide lactone.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/17373765"/>
