<rdfs:comment>The enzyme is involved in biosynthesis of the nonproteinogenic amino acid beta-hydroxyenduracididine, a component of the mannopeptimycins (cyclic glycopeptide antibiotic), produced by Streptomyces hygroscopicus NRRL 30439.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/16298295"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/16723579"/>
