<activity rdf:resource="1.14.11.47#SIPC90A63E41DCFFCAC"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, characterized from the bacterium Escherichia coli, hydroxylates an arginine residue on the 50S ribosomal protein L16, and is involved in regulation of bacterial ribosome assembly.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/23103944"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/24530688"/>
