<rdfs:label>2-oxoglutarate + L-arginyl-[ribosomal protein uL16] + O2 = (3R)-3-hydroxy-L-arginyl-[ribosomal protein uL16] + CO2 + succinate.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
