<activity rdf:resource="1.14.11.58#SIP61895A279FA66328"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, characterized from the bacterium Rhizobium tropici, catalyzes the hydroxylation of C-2 of the fatty acyl group that is ester-linked to the 3-hydroxy position of the amide-linked fatty acid.</rdfs:comment>
