<activity rdf:resource="1.14.11.59#SIP3113A16CE5EBBF22"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme is involved in the biosynthesis of protective and allelophatic benzoxazinoids in some plants, most commonly from the family of Poacea (grasses).</rdfs:comment>
