<activity rdf:resource="1.14.11.60#SIP5A288AD7CA465CCD"/>
<rdfs:comment>Requires iron(II) and ascorbate.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>A protein involved in biosynthesis of iron(III)-chelating coumarins in higher plants.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/29361149"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/29581584"/>
