<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.14.11.61">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>feruloyl-CoA 6-hydroxylase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.11.61#SIP2DCF176EB8AB8E1C"/>
<rdfs:comment>Requires iron(II) and ascorbate.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The product spontaneously undergoes trans-cis isomerization and lactonization to form scopoletin, liberating CoA in the process.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzymes from the plants Ruta graveolens and Ipomoea batatas also act on trans-4-coumaroyl-CoA. cf. EC 1.14.11.62.</rdfs:comment>
