<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.14.11.70">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>7-deoxycylindrospermopsin hydroxylase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.11.70#SIP67AA20B3E0416A6F"/>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.11.70#SIP5BDACA9E4E739284"/>
<rdfs:comment>Requires Fe(II).</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, found in some cyanobacterial species, catalyzes the last step in the biosynthesis of the toxins cylindrospermopsin and 7-epi-cylindrospermopsin.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The ratio of the two products differs among different strains.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/21404419"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/29653078"/>
