<activity rdf:resource="1.14.11.81#SIP5DECC213E8CDB0C4"/>
<rdfs:comment>This fungal enzyme is involved in the biosynthesis of quinolone compounds.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>it catalyzes two oxidation reactions: the first reaction results in a desaturation; the second reaction is a monooxygenation of the double bond, forming an epoxide.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme is also active with 4'-methoxycyclopeptine.</rdfs:comment>
