<skos:altLabel>vanillate demethylase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.13.82#SIPEEA34B5EB6580D94"/>
<rdfs:comment>Forms part of the vanillin degradation pathway in Arthrobacter sp.</rdfs:comment>
