<activity rdf:resource="1.14.13.170#SIP61B77EBD6FA8F321"/>
<rdfs:comment>Isolated from the bacteria Streptomyces exfoliatus and Streptomyces arenae.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The ketone undergoes a biological Baeyer-Villiger reaction.</rdfs:comment>
