</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.14.13.224">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>violacein synthase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>proviolaceinate monooxygenase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.13.224#SIP0706FA42847C9CF6"/>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.13.224#SIP2BA3782628AD6255"/>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.13.224#SIPC5129D7E84B7FF14"/>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.13.224#SIP521CB4039262D77B"/>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.13.224#SIPDD6E19B5EE43A3B8"/>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.13.224#SIPFB6B2078AFB987B0"/>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.13.224#SIP3DC5505E7F71B0B6"/>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.13.224#SIP3D74216992B39DB7"/>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.13.224#SIP2FC08A3A20F3E45B"/>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.13.224#SIP62F8AB69AECB2B16"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, characterized from the bacterium Chromobacterium violaceum, participates in the biosynthesis of the violet pigment violacein.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The immediate products, violaceinate and deoxyviolaceinate, undergo non-enzymic autooxidation into violacein and deoxyviolacein, respectively.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/17176066"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/17925955"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="1.14.13.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="1.14.13.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.14.13.224#SIP0706FA42847C9CF6">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>H(+) + NADH + O2 + protoviolaceinate = H2O + NAD(+) + violaceinate.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.14.13.224#SIP2BA3782628AD6255">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>H(+) + NADPH + O2 + protoviolaceinate = H2O + NADP(+) + violaceinate.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.14.13.224#SIPC5129D7E84B7FF14">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>H(+) + NADPH + O2 + protodeoxyviolaceinate = deoxyviolaceinate + H2O + NADP(+).</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.14.13.224#SIP521CB4039262D77B">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>H(+) + NADH + O2 + protodeoxyviolaceinate = deoxyviolaceinate + H2O + NAD(+).</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.14.13.224#SIPDD6E19B5EE43A3B8">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>2 H(+) + NADH + 2 O2 + protoviolaceinate = CO2 + 2 H2O + NAD(+) + violacein.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.14.13.224#SIPFB6B2078AFB987B0">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>H(+) + O2 + violaceinate = CO2 + H2O + violacein.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.14.13.224#SIP3DC5505E7F71B0B6">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>2 H(+) + NADPH + 2 O2 + protoviolaceinate = CO2 + 2 H2O + NADP(+) + violacein.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.14.13.224#SIP3D74216992B39DB7">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>2 H(+) + NADPH + 2 O2 + protodeoxyviolaceinate = CO2 + deoxyviolacein + 2 H2O + NADP(+).</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.14.13.224#SIP2FC08A3A20F3E45B">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>2 H(+) + NADH + 2 O2 + protodeoxyviolaceinate = CO2 + deoxyviolacein + 2 H2O + NAD(+).</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.14.13.224#SIP62F8AB69AECB2B16">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>deoxyviolaceinate + H(+) + O2 = CO2 + deoxyviolacein + H2O.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/17176066">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Citation"/>
<skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/pubmed/17176066"/>
<foaf:primaryTopicOf rdf:resource="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/17176066"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/17925955">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Citation"/>
<skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/pubmed/17925955"/>
<foaf:primaryTopicOf rdf:resource="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/17925955"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.14.13.225">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>F-actin monooxygenase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.13.225#SIPD5444C4668BD2E12"/>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.13.225#SIP1830E2102619767C"/>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.13.225#SIPBFBEE38841A715F4"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, characterized from the fruit fly Drosophila melanogaster, is a multi-domain oxidoreductase that acts as an F-actin disassembly factor.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme selectively reduces two L-Met residues of F-actin, causing fragmentation of the filaments and preventing repolymerization.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Free methionine is not a substrate.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The reaction is stereospecific and generates the (R)-sulfoxide.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/20148037"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/22116028"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/24212093"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="1.14.13.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="1.14.13.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.14.13.225#SIPD5444C4668BD2E12">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>H(+) + L-methionyl-[F-actin] + NADPH + O2 = H2O + L-methionyl-(R)-S-oxide-[F-actin] + NADP(+).</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.14.13.225#SIP1830E2102619767C">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>H(+) + L-methionyl(44)-[F-actin] + NADPH + O2 = H2O + L-methionyl(44)-(R)-S-oxide-[F-actin] + NADP(+).</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.14.13.225#SIPBFBEE38841A715F4">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>H(+) + L-methionyl(47)-[F-actin] + NADPH + O2 = H2O + L-methionyl(47)-(R)-S-oxide-[F-actin] + NADP(+).</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
