</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.14.13.236">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>toluene 4-monooxygenase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>TMO</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.13.236#SIPC95480C179A24F95"/>
<rdfs:comment>This bacterial enzyme belongs to a family of soluble diiron hydroxylases that includes toluene-, benzene-, xylene- and methane monooxygenases, phenol hydroxylases, and alkene epoxidases.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme comprises a four-component complex that includes a hydroxylase, NADH-ferredoxin oxidoreductase, a Rieske-type [2Fe-2S] ferredoxin, and an effector protein.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/2019563"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/11297417"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/18479085"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/22264099"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/24798294"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="1.14.13.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="1.14.13.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.14.13.236#SIPC95480C179A24F95">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>H(+) + NADH + O2 + toluene = 4-methylphenol + H2O + NAD(+).</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
