<activity rdf:resource="1.14.13.249#SIP2B721C348FADD7A2"/>
<rdfs:comment>Requires FAD.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The CreL enzyme from the bacterium Streptomyces cremeus participates in the biosynthesis of cremeomycin.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The PrmB3 and PtnB3 enzymes from Streptomyces platensis are involved in the biosynthesis of platensimycin and platencin, respectively.</rdfs:comment>
