<skos:altLabel>squalene hydroxylase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.14.17#SIP5B2F6B4F8AF33E13"/>
<rdfs:comment>This enzyme, together with EC 5.4.99.7, was formerly known as squalene oxidocyclase.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The electron donor, NADPH, is coupled via EC 1.6.2.4.</rdfs:comment>
