<skos:altLabel>CYP7A1</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.14.23#SIP93B573ED3382902C"/>
<rdfs:comment>Catalyzes the first step in the biosynthesis of bile acids.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The direct electron donor to the enzyme is EC 1.6.2.4.</rdfs:comment>
