<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.14.14.33">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>ethylenediaminetetraacetate monooxygenase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.14.33#SIPE4D583AA9718A413"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme is part of a two component system that also includes EC 1.5.1.42 which provides reduced flavin mononucleotide for this enzyme.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>While the enzyme has a substrate overlap with EC 1.14.14.10, it has a much wider substrate range, which includes nitrilotriacetate (NTA) and diethylenetriaminepentaacetate (DTPA) in addition to EDTA.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/9371437"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/9683478"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/11157232"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="1.14.14.-"/>
