<skos:altLabel>tyrosine N-hydroxylase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.14.36#SIP39106A6CB6ADF81B"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme from Sorghum is involved in the biosynthesis of the cyanogenic glucoside dhurrin.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>In Sinapis alba (white mustard) the enzyme is involved in the biosynthesis of the glucosinolate sinalbin.</rdfs:comment>
