<rdfs:label>L-tyrosine + 2 O2 + 2 reduced [NADPH--hemoprotein reductase] = (E)-4-hydroxyphenylacetaldehyde oxime + CO2 + 2 H(+) + 3 H2O + 2 oxidized [NADPH--hemoprotein reductase].</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
