<replaces rdf:resource="1.14.13.68"/>
<skos:prefLabel>4-hydroxyphenylacetaldehyde oxime monooxygenase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>4-hydroxybenzeneacetaldehyde oxime monooxygenase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>CYP71E1</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>cytochrome P450II-dependent monooxygenase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.14.37#SIP737625B7822AB97D"/>
<rdfs:comment>Involved in the biosynthesis of the cyanogenic glucoside dhurrin in sorghum.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It catalyzes three different activities - isomerization of the (E) isomer to the (Z) isomer, dehydration, and C-hydroxylation.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/193443"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/237909"/>
