<rdfs:label>(E)-4-hydroxyphenylacetaldehyde oxime + O2 + reduced [NADPH--hemoprotein reductase] = (S)-4-hydroxymandelonitrile + H(+) + 2 H2O + oxidized [NADPH--hemoprotein reductase].</rdfs:label>
