<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.14.14.48">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>jasmonoyl-L-amino acid 12-hydroxylase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>CYP94B1</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>CYP94B3</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.14.48#SIP4A76956FA097D3E1"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, found in plants, acts on jasmonoyl-L-amino conjugates, catalyzing the hydroxylation of the C-12 position of the jasmonic acid chain.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>While the best studied substrate is (+)-7-epi-jasmonoyl-L-isoleucine, the enzyme was shown to be active with jasmonoyl-L-valine and jasmonoyl-L-phenylalanine, and is likely to be active with other jasmonoyl-amino acid conjugates.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/21576464"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/21849397"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/22215670"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/24467969"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/25210037"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/26164240"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="1.14.14.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="1.14.14.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.14.14.48#SIP4A76956FA097D3E1">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>a jasmonyl-L-amino acid + O2 + reduced [NADPH--hemoprotein reductase] = a 12-hydroxyjasmonyl-L-alpha-amino acid + H(+) + H2O + oxidized [NADPH--hemoprotein reductase].</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
