<activity rdf:resource="1.14.14.57#SIP7140A2981BD67D5E"/>
<rdfs:comment>Requires cytochrome b5 for maximal activity.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Acts on taurochenodeoxycholate, taurodeoxycholate and less readily on lithocholate and chenodeoxycholate.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>In adult pig (Sus scrofa), hyocholic acid replaces cholic acid as a primary bile acid.</rdfs:comment>
