<skos:altLabel>DMNT/TMTT homoterpene synthase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.14.58#SIP56DF3F5AF4C240F2"/>
<rdfs:comment>Isolated from the plants Arabidopsis thaliana (thale cress) and Zea mays (maize).</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It forms this C16 homoterpene in response to herbivore attack.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>In vitro some variants of the enzyme also convert (3S,6E)-nerolidol to (3E)-4,8-dimethylnona-1,3,7-triene (see EC 1.14.14.59).</rdfs:comment>
