<skos:altLabel>CYP701A</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.14.70#SIP3EB8AB57172ED5A7"/>
<rdfs:comment>A cytochrome P450 (heme-thiolate) protein isolated from Oryza sativa (rice).</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Participates in the pathway for the biosynthesis of oryzalexins, a group of related phytoalexins produced by rice.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Can also use 9beta-pimara-7,15-diene as substrate (cf. EC 1.14.14.68, syn-pimaradiene 3-monooxygenase).</rdfs:comment>
