<rdfs:label>O2 + phenylacetonitrile + reduced [NADPH--hemoprotein reductase] = (R)-mandelonitrile + H(+) + H2O + oxidized [NADPH--hemoprotein reductase].</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
