<skos:prefLabel>phylloquinone omega-hydroxylase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>CYP4F11</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>CYP4F2</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.14.78#SIP5AA1BF6EBB340AE4"/>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.14.78#SIP27FED5AA90293031"/>
<rdfs:comment>A cytochrome P450 (heme-thiolate) protein isolated from human tissue.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme will also act on menaquinone-4.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Prolonged action of CYP4F2, but not CYP4F11, on the omega hydroxyl group oxidizes it to the corresponding carboxylic acid.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>CYP4F2 also oxidizes leukotriene B4; see EC 1.14.13.30.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/9799565"/>
