<rdfs:label>O2 + phylloquinone + reduced [NADPH--hemoprotein reductase] = H(+) + H2O + omega-hydroxyphylloquinone + oxidized [NADPH--hemoprotein reductase].</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
