<rdfs:label>O2 + octadecanoate + reduced [NADPH--hemoprotein reductase] = 18-hydroxyoctadecanoate + H(+) + H2O + oxidized [NADPH--hemoprotein reductase].</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
