<skos:prefLabel>geraniol 8-hydroxylase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>CYP76B10</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>CYP76B6</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>G10H</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.14.83#SIP9BB75307EBE3962C"/>
<rdfs:comment>A cytochrome P450 (heme thiolate) protein found in plants.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Also hydroxylates nerol and citronellol, cf. EC 1.14.14.84.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The recommended numbering of geraniol gives 8-hydroxygeraniol as the product rather than 10-hydroxygeraniol.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The cloned enzyme also catalyzed, but less efficiently, the 3'-hydroxylation of naringenin (cf. EC 1.14.14.82).</rdfs:comment>
