<rdfs:label>(2E)-geraniol + O2 + reduced [NADPH--hemoprotein reductase] = (6E)-8-hydroxygeraniol + H(+) + H2O + oxidized [NADPH--hemoprotein reductase].</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
