<activity rdf:resource="1.14.14.87#SIPCE37D2536A675E69"/>
<rdfs:comment>A cytochrome P450 (heme thiolate) protein found in plants.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The reaction involves the migration of the 2-phenyl group of the flavanone to the 3-position of the isoflavanone.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The 2-hydroxyl group is derived from the oxygen molecule.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>EC 4.2.1.105 acts on the products with loss of water and formation of genistein and daidzein, respectively.</rdfs:comment>
