<rdfs:comment>Acts on isoflavones with a 4'-methoxy group, such as formononetin and biochanin A.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Involved in the biosynthesis of the pterocarpin phytoalexins medicarpin and maackiain.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>EC 1.14.14.90 is less specific and acts on other isoflavones as well as 4'-methoxyisoflavones.</rdfs:comment>
