<skos:prefLabel>ent-kaurenoic acid monooxygenase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>CYP88A3</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>ent-kaurenoic acid oxidase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.14.107#SIP936F256AF282FB9B"/>
<rdfs:comment>A cytochrome P450 (heme-thiolate) protein from plants.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Catalyzes three sucessive oxidations of ent-kaurenoic acid.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The second step includes a ring-B contraction giving the gibbane skeleton.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>In pumpkin (Cucurbita maxima) ent-6alpha,7alpha-dihydroxykaur-16-en-19-oate is also formed.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/11172076"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="1.14.14.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="1.14.14.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.14.14.107#SIP936F256AF282FB9B">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>ent-kaur-16-en-19-oate + 3 O2 + 3 reduced [NADPH--hemoprotein reductase] = gibberellin A12 + 4 H(+) + 4 H2O + 3 oxidized [NADPH--hemoprotein reductase].</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
