<rdfs:comment>The enzyme from the plant Glycyrrhiza uralensis (licorice) is involved in the biosynthesis of the triterpenoid saponin glycyrrhizin.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme from the plant Medicago truncatula can also hydroxylate beta-amyrin.</rdfs:comment>
