<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, found in Lepidoptera (moths and butterflies), is specific for farnesoate (cf. EC 1.14.14.127).</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It is involved in the synthesis of juvenile hormone.</rdfs:comment>
