<rdfs:comment>A cytochrome P450 (heme-thiolate) protein characterized from the plant Sinopodophyllum hexandrum.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme is involved in the biosynthetic pathway of podophyllotoxin, a non-alkaloid toxin lignan whose derivatives are important anticancer drugs.</rdfs:comment>
