<rdfs:comment>A cytochrome P450 (heme-thiolate) protein characterized from the plant Sinopodophyllum hexandrum.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme produces the direct precursor to etoposide, a potent anticancer drug.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It can also act on (-)-deoxypodophyllotoxin with lower efficiency.</rdfs:comment>
