<activity rdf:resource="1.14.14.139#SIPDB4758A84A3486F3"/>
<rdfs:comment>A cytochrome P450 (heme-thiolate) protein found in mammals.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>This is the key enzyme in the biosynthesis of the bile acid cholate.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme can also hydroxylate 5beta-cholestane-3alpha,7alpha-diol at the 25 and 26 position, but to a lesser extent.</rdfs:comment>
