<skos:prefLabel>3,6-diketocamphane 1,2-monooxygenase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>3,6-diketocamphane lactonizing enzyme</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>3,6-DKCMO</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.14.155#SIP92B6BE76E7AE037B"/>
<rdfs:comment>A Baeyer-Villiger monooxygenase isolated from camphor-grown strains of Pseudomonas putida and encoded on the cam plasmid.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Involved in the degradation of (-)-camphor.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Requires a dedicated NADH--FMN reductase (cf. EC 1.5.1.42).</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The product spontaneously converts to [(1R)-2,2,3-trimethyl-5-oxocyclopent-3-enyl]acetate.</rdfs:comment>
