<rdfs:label>indolin-2-one + O2 + reduced [NADPH--hemoprotein reductase] = 3-hydroxyindolin-2-one + H(+) + H2O + oxidized [NADPH--hemoprotein reductase].</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
