<skos:prefLabel>nepetalactol monooxygenase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>CYP76A26</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>iridoid oxidase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.14.161#SIPC31BCAE13E23D0E1"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, characterized from the plant Catharanthus roseus, is a cytochrome P450 (heme thiolate) protein.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It catalyzes three successive reactions in the pathway leading to biosynthesis of monoterpenoid indole alkaloids.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/24710322"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="1.14.14.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="1.14.14.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
