<skos:altLabel>CYP93B1</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>CYP93G2</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>licodione synthase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.14.162#SIPB6D29F8F3BCC5584"/>
<rdfs:comment>A cytochrome P450 (heme thiolate) plant enzyme that catalyzes the 2-hydroxylation of multiple flavanones such as (2S)-naringenin, (2S)-eriodictyol, (2S)-pinocembrin, and (2S)-liquiritigenin.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The products are meta-stable and exist in an equilibrium with open forms such as 1-(4-hydroxyphenyl)-3-(2,4,6-trihydroxyphenyl)propane-1,3-dione.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/9708921"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/12232298"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/20647377"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="1.14.14.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="1.14.14.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
