<skos:prefLabel>8-epi-inunolide synthase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>CYP71BL1</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.14.170#SIP400BF5DFE9A69E41"/>
<rdfs:comment>A cytochrome P450 (heme-thiolate) protein from the plant Inula hupehensis.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme also produces 8beta-hydroxygermacra-1(10),4,11(13)-triene-12-oate (EC 1.14.14.168).</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/29086444"/>
