<skos:prefLabel>geranylhydroquinone 3''-hydroxylase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>CYP76B74</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>GHQ 3''-hydroxylase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.14.174#SIP319F9D5E3C35901D"/>
<rdfs:comment>A cytochrome P450 (heme-thiolate) protein found in plants, where it is part of the biosynthesis pathway of the red naphthoquinone pigment shikonin.</rdfs:comment>
