<replaces rdf:resource="1.14.13.190"/>
<skos:prefLabel>ferruginol synthase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>CYP76AH1</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>miltiradiene oxidase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.14.175#SIPF0DFF636072D2537"/>
<rdfs:comment>A cytochrome P450 (heme thiolate) enzyme found in some members of the Lamiaceae (mint family).</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme from Rosmarinus officinalis (rosemary) is involved in biosynthesis of carnosic acid, while the enzyme from the Chinese medicinal herb Salvia miltiorrhiza is involved in the biosynthesis of the tanshinones, abietane-type norditerpenoid naphthoquinones that are the main lipophilic bioactive components found in the plant.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/23812755"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/24108414"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/26020634"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="1.14.14.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="1.14.14.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.14.14.175#SIPF0DFF636072D2537">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>abieta-8,11,13-triene + O2 + reduced [NADPH--hemoprotein reductase] = ferruginol + H(+) + H2O + oxidized [NADPH--hemoprotein reductase].</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/23812755">
