<skos:altLabel>cytochrome p450scc</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>cytochrome P-450scc</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>steroid 20-22 desmolase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>steroid 20-22-lyase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.15.6#SIP36954766FE9D75CA"/>
<rdfs:comment>The reaction proceeds in three stages, with two hydroxylations at C-22 and C-20 preceding scission of the side-chain between carbons 20 and 22.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The initial source of the electrons is NADPH, which transfers the electrons to the adrenodoxin via EC 1.18.1.6.</rdfs:comment>
