<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.14.15.21">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<replaces rdf:resource="1.14.13.90"/>
<skos:prefLabel>zeaxanthin epoxidase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>zea-epoxidase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.15.21#SIPB074B95F0C48B3DE"/>
<rdfs:comment>Active under conditions of low light.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Along with EC 1.23.5.1, this enzyme forms part of the xanthophyll (or violaxanthin) cycle, which is involved in protecting the plant against damage by excess light.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It will also epoxidize lutein in some higher-plant species.</rdfs:comment>
