<rdfs:label>2 H(+) + O2 + p-xylene + 2 reduced [2Fe-2S]-[ferredoxin] = 4-methylbenzyl alcohol + H2O + 2 oxidized [2Fe-2S]-[ferredoxin].</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
