<skos:altLabel>glyceryl-ether monooxygenase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.16.5#SIP6175F0BB365C7D0F"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme cleaves alkylglycerols, but does not cleave alkenylglycerols (plasmalogens).</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Requires phospholipids for full activity.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The product spontaneously breaks down to form a fatty aldehyde and glycerol.</rdfs:comment>
