<rdfs:label>2 Fe(II)-[cytochrome b5] + 2 H(+) + O2 + octadecanoyl-CoA = (9Z)-octadecenoyl-CoA + 2 Fe(III)-[cytochrome b5] + 2 H2O.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
