<rdfs:label>(9Z)-hexadecenoyl-CoA + 2 Fe(II)-[cytochrome b5] + 2 H(+) + O2 = (9Z,12Z)-hexadecadienoyl-CoA + 2 Fe(III)-[cytochrome b5] + 2 H2O.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
