<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.14.19.26">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>acyl-[acyl-carrier-protein] 6-desaturase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.19.26#SIP924C27A9D30A55EB"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, characterized from the endosperm of the plant Thunbergia alata (black-eyed Susan vine), introduces a cis double bond at carbon 6 of several saturated acyl-[acyl-carrier protein]s.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It is most active with palmitoyl-[acyl-carrier protein] (16:0), but can also act on myristoyl-[acyl-carrier protein] (14:0) and stearoyl-[acyl-carrier protein] (18:0).</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The position of the double bond is determined by its distance from the carboxyl end of the fatty acid.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/7961667"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/9144157"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="1.14.19.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="1.14.19.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.14.19.26#SIP924C27A9D30A55EB">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>2 H(+) + hexadecanoyl-[ACP] + O2 + 2 reduced [2Fe-2S]-[ferredoxin] = (6Z)-hexadecenoyl-[ACP] + 2 H2O + 2 oxidized [2Fe-2S]-[ferredoxin].</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
