<skos:prefLabel>(S)-canadine synthase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>(S)-tetrahydroberberine synthase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>(S)-tetrahydrocolumbamine oxidase (methylenedioxy-bridge-forming)</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>CYP719A</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.19.68#SIP5AF8C9D6B94392B5"/>
<rdfs:comment>A cytochrome P450 (heme-thiolate) protein found in plants.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme catalyzes an oxidative reaction that does not incorporate oxygen into the product.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Oxidation of the methoxyphenol group of the alkaloid tetrahydrocolumbamine results in the formation of the methylenedioxy bridge of canadine.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/12732624"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/24316226"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="1.14.19.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="1.14.19.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
