<skos:prefLabel>fumitremorgin C synthase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.19.71#SIP623C5328F068BC43"/>
<rdfs:comment>A cytochrome P450 (heme-thiolate) protein.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The protein from the fungus Aspergillus fumigatus also has activity with tryprostatin B forming demethoxyfumitremorgin C.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Involved in the biosynthetic pathways of several indole alkaloids such as fumitremorgins and verruculogen.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/19226505"/>
