<skos:prefLabel>(-)-pluviatolide synthase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>CYP719A23</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.19.72#SIPB38840C8261FB342"/>
<rdfs:comment>A cytochrome P450 (heme-thiolate) protein.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme from the plants Sinopodophyllum hexandrum and Podophyllum peltatum catalyzes the formation of a methylenedioxy-bridge.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It is involved in the biosynthesis of podophyllotoxin, a non-alkaloid toxin lignan whose derivatives are important anticancer drugs.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/23161544"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="1.14.19.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="1.14.19.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
