<rdfs:label>(-)-matairesinol + O2 + reduced [NADPH--hemoprotein reductase] = (-)-pluviatolide + H(+) + 2 H2O + oxidized [NADPH--hemoprotein reductase].</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
