<replaces rdf:resource="1.14.21.12"/>
<skos:prefLabel>(S)-nandinine synthase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>CYP719A3</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.19.73#SIP928C8635763DF1F0"/>
<rdfs:comment>A cytochrome P450 (heme-thiolate) enzyme found in plants.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme catalyzes an oxidative reaction that does not incorporate oxygen into the product.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Forms the methylenedioxy bridge of the protoberberine alkaloid (S)-nandinine by the oxidative ring closure of adjacent phenolic and methoxy groups of (S)-scoulerine. cf. EC 1.14.19.65, which catalyzes a similar reaction at the other side of the (S)-scoulerine molecule, forming (S)-cheilanthifoline.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/17250743"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/21094631"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="1.14.19.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="1.14.19.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.14.19.73#SIP928C8635763DF1F0">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>(S)-scoulerine + O2 + reduced [NADPH--hemoprotein reductase] = (S)-nandinine + H(+) + 2 H2O + oxidized [NADPH--hemoprotein reductase].</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
