<rdfs:label>(2S)-3-(4-hydroxyphenyl)-2-isocyanopropanoate + 2-oxoglutarate + O2 = (2E)-3-(4-hydroxyphenyl)-2-isocyanoprop-2-enoate + CO2 + H2O + succinate.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
