<rdfs:label>(2S)-3-(4-hydroxyphenyl)-2-isocyanopropanoate + 2-oxoglutarate + H(+) + O2 = 4-[(E)-2-isocyanoethenyl]phenol + 2 CO2 + H2O + succinate.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
