<skos:altLabel>4-methoxybenzoate O-demethylase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.99.15#SIP0E2CF618C1DA6D98"/>
<rdfs:comment>The bacterial enzyme consists of a ferredoxin-type protein and an iron-sulfur flavoprotein (FMN).</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Also acts on 4-ethoxybenzoate, N-methyl-4-aminobenzoate and toluate.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The fungal enzyme acts best on veratrate.</rdfs:comment>
