<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.14.99.50">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>gamma-glutamyl hercynylcysteine S-oxide synthase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.99.50#SIPD4283A4F2B6A8CBD"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, found in bacteria, is specific for both hercynine and gamma-L-glutamyl-L-cysteine.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It is part of the biosynthesis pathway of ergothioneine.</rdfs:comment>
