<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.14.99.58">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>heme oxygenase (biliverdin-IX-beta and delta-forming)</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.99.58#SIPDEAE2233AC1D74A6"/>
<activity rdf:resource="1.14.99.58#SIP86B8C71E5AE3556D"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, characterized from the bacterium Pseudomonas aeruginosa, differs from EC 1.14.15.20 in that the heme substrate is rotated by approximately 110 degrees within the active site, resulting in cleavage at a different part of the ring.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It forms a mixture of about 70% biliverdin-IX-delta and 30% biliverdin-IX-beta.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/11591684"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/12475329"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/15122889"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="1.14.99.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="1.14.99.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.14.99.58#SIPDEAE2233AC1D74A6">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>3 AH2 + 3 H(+) + heme b + 3 O2 = 3 A + biliverdin IXdelta + CO + Fe(2+) + 3 H2O.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.14.99.58#SIP86B8C71E5AE3556D">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>3 AH2 + 2 H(+) + heme b + 3 O2 = 3 A + biliverdin IXbeta + CO + Fe(2+) + 3 H2O.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
