<activity rdf:resource="1.14.99.59#SIP941D043F951EF942"/>
<rdfs:comment>Isolated from the fungus Psilocybe cubensis.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Involved in the biosynthesis of the psychoactive compound psilocybin.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/28763571"/>
