<rdfs:label>2-methylsulfanyl-N(6)-dimethylallyladenosine(37) in tRNA + AH2 + O2 = A + H2O + N(6)-[(2E)-4-hydroxy-3-methylbut-2-en-1-yl]-2-(methylsulfanyl)adenosine(37) in tRNA.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
