<rdf:Description rdf:about="1.16.1.10">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>ferric-chelate reductase [NAD(P)H]</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>ferric reductase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.16.1.10#SIP248243E5CDF3DDF5"/>
<activity rdf:resource="1.16.1.10#SIP4572C48443E6630F"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme catalyzes the reduction of bound ferric iron in a variety of iron chelators (siderophores), resulting in the release of ferrous iron.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme from the hyperthermophilic archaeon Archaeoglobus fulgidus is not active with uncomplexed Fe(III). cf. EC 1.16.1.7 and EC 1.16.1.9.</rdfs:comment>
