<activity rdf:resource="1.17.1.10#SIP378694A41940576F"/>
<rdfs:comment>Characterized from the bacterium Moorella thermoacetica.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It is extremely sensitive to oxygen.</rdfs:comment>
