<skos:prefLabel>thyroxine 5-deiodinase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>diiodothyronine 5'-deiodinase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>iodothyronine 5-deiodinase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>iodothyronine inner ring monodeiodinase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>type III iodothyronine deiodinase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.21.99.3#SIPCD13973E66E4269C"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme activity has only been demonstrated in the direction of 5-deiodination.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>This removal of the 5-iodine, i.e. from the inner ring, largely inactivates the hormone thyroxine.</rdfs:comment>
