<skos:altLabel>Transhydroxylase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.97.1.2#SIP20A4430D9469FF5D"/>
<rdfs:comment>1,2,3,5-Tetrahydroxybenzene acts as a cosubstrate for the conversion of pyrogallol into phloroglucinol, and for a number of similar isomerizations.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme is provisionally listed here, but might be considered as the basis for a new class in the transferases, analogous to the aminotransferases.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/2298693"/>
