<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>photosystem I</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="1.97.1.12#SIPEDB6D1CDAC35913C"/>
<rdfs:comment>Contains chlorophyll, phylloquinones, carotenoids and [4Fe-4S] clusters.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Cytochrome c6 can act as an alternative electron donor, and flavodoxin as an alternative acceptor in some species.</rdfs:comment>
