<rdfs:comment>3,7-Dimethylquercetagetin can also act as acceptor.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Involved with EC 2.1.1.76 and EC 2.1.1.82 in the methylation of quercetin to 3,7,4'-trimethylquercetin in Chrysosplenium americanum.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Does not act on flavones, dihydroflavonols, or their glucosides.</rdfs:comment>
