<skos:altLabel>16-methoxy-2,3-dihydro-3-hydroxytabersonine methyltransferase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>16-methoxy-2,3-dihydro-3-hydroxytabersonine N-methyltransferase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>NMT</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>S-adenosyl-L-methionine:16-methoxy-2,3-dihydro-3-hydroxytabersonine N-methyltransferase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.1.1.99#SIP4525BB720BE836EC"/>
<rdfs:comment>Involved in the biosynthesis of vindoline from tabersonine in the Madagascar periwinkle Catharanthus roseus.</rdfs:comment>
