<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.1.1.113">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>site-specific DNA-methyltransferase (cytosine-N(4)-specific)</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>modification methylase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>N(4)-cytosine-specific DNA methylase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>restriction-modification system</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.1.1.113#SIPFF59E1B41CB89E04"/>
<rdfs:comment>This is a large group of enzymes, the majority of which, with enzymes of similar site specificity listed as EC 3.1.21.3, EC 3.1.21.4 and EC 3.1.21.5, form so-called restriction-modification systems.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>See the REBASE database for a complete list of these enzymes: http://rebase.neb.com/rebase/</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/2159140"/>
