<rdfs:label>a 2'-deoxycytidine in DNA + S-adenosyl-L-methionine = an N(4)-methyl-2'-deoxycytidine in DNA + H(+) + S-adenosyl-L-homocysteine.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
