<rdfs:label>3,4-dihydroxy-5-all-trans-heptaprenylbenzoate + S-adenosyl-L-methionine = 3-methoxy-4-hydroxy-5-all-trans-heptaprenylbenzoate + H(+) + S-adenosyl-L-homocysteine.</rdfs:label>
