<skos:prefLabel>isoflavone 7-O-methyltransferase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.1.1.150#SIPA0D5CDE1A351E582"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme from alfalfa can methylate daidzein, genistein and 6,7,4'-trihydroxyisoflavone but not flavones or flavanones.</rdfs:comment>
