<skos:altLabel>monomethylxanthine methyltransferase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>MXMT</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.1.1.159#SIP6933F8AB501F148B"/>
<rdfs:comment>Can also catalyze the conversion of paraxanthine into caffeine, although the paraxanthine pathway is considered to be a minor pathway for caffeine biosynthesis.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>This is the third enzyme in the caffeine biosynthesis pathway.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/11108716"/>
