<activity rdf:resource="2.1.1.169#SIP7EBEBD4DCA4367C9"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme from Triticum aestivum catalyzes the sequential O-methylation of tricetin via 3'-O-methyltricetin, 3',5'-O-methyltricetin to 3',4',5'-O-trimethyltricetin.</rdfs:comment>
