<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.1.1.203">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<replaces rdf:resource="2.1.1.29"/>
<skos:prefLabel>tRNA (cytosine(34)-C(5))-methyltransferase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.1.1.203#SIPE956A05DA7A728C7"/>
<rdfs:comment>The human enzyme is specific for C(5)-methylation of cytosine(34) in tRNA precursors.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The intron in the human pre-tRNA(Leu)(CAA) is indispensable for the C(5)-methylation of cytosine in the first position of the anticodon.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It is not able to form 5-methylcytosine at positions 48 and 49 of human and yeast tRNA precursors.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/17071714"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="2.1.1.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="2.1.1.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.1.1.203#SIPE956A05DA7A728C7">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>cytidine(34) in tRNA precursor + S-adenosyl-L-methionine = 5-methylcytidine(34) in tRNA precursor + H(+) + S-adenosyl-L-homocysteine.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/17071714">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Citation"/>
<skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/pubmed/17071714"/>
<foaf:primaryTopicOf rdf:resource="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/17071714"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.1.1.204">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<replaces rdf:resource="2.1.1.29"/>
<skos:prefLabel>tRNA (cytosine(38)-C(5))-methyltransferase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.1.1.204#SIP83D995D0EAE32428"/>
<rdfs:comment>The eukaryotic enzyme catalyzes methylation of cytosine(38) in the anti-codon loop of tRNA(Asp)(GTC), tRNA(Val)(AAC) and tRNA(Gly)(GCC).</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Methylation by Dnmt2 protects tRNAs against stress-induced cleavage by ribonuclease.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/16424344"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/18567810"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/20679393"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="2.1.1.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="2.1.1.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
