<rdfs:comment>In Rhodopseudomonas capsulata and Rubrivivax gelatinosus the enzyme is involved in biosynthesis of spheroidene.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>In Rubrivivax gelatinosus the enzyme also catalyzes the methylation of demethylspirilloxanthin to spirilloxanthin and the methylation of 3,4-didehydrorhodopin to anhydrorhodovibrin.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/7358679"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/12664193"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/12770713"/>
