<activity rdf:resource="2.1.1.211#SIP81EB1F32799BC8D4"/>
<rdfs:comment>The 2'-O-methylation of uridine(44) contributes to stability of tRNA(Ser)(CGA).</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/18025252"/>
