<rdfs:comment>In contrast to the archaeal enzyme EC 2.1.1.213, tRNA (guanine(10)-N(2))-methyltransferase from yeast does not catalyze the methylation from N(2)-methylguanine(10) to N(2)-dimethylguanine(10) in tRNA.</rdfs:comment>
