<skos:altLabel>tRNA m(1)A(9)-methyltransferase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.1.1.218#SIP63DC07052C65034A"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme from Sulfolobus acidocaldarius specifically methylates adenine(9) in tRNA.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The bifunctional enzyme from Thermococcus kodakaraensis also catalyzes the methylation of guanine(9) in tRNA (cf. EC 2.1.1.221).</rdfs:comment>
