<activity rdf:resource="2.1.1.229#SIPD64BDC6EA71AA524"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme catalyzes the post-translational modification of uridine residues at the wobble position 34 of the anticodon loop of tRNA.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/14645538"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/20123966"/>
