<activity rdf:resource="2.1.1.234#SIP0514F6D1A748CAC4"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme is involved in the biosynthesis of desosamine, a 3-(dimethylamino)-3,4,6-trideoxyhexose found in certain macrolide antibiotics such as erthyromycin, azithromycin, and clarithromycin.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/12119032"/>
