<rdfs:label>dTDP-3-amino-3,4,6-trideoxy-alpha-D-glucose + 2 S-adenosyl-L-methionine = dTDP-alpha-D-desosamine + 2 H(+) + 2 S-adenosyl-L-homocysteine.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
