<activity rdf:resource="2.1.1.235#SIPE77DA90A734270BB"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme is involved in the biosynthesis of mycaminose, an essential structural component of the macrolide antibiotic tylosin, which is produced by the bacterium Streptomyces fradiae.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/12119032"/>
