<rdfs:label>dTDP-3-amino-3,6-dideoxy-alpha-D-glucose + 2 S-adenosyl-L-methionine = dTDP-alpha-D-mycaminose + 2 H(+) + 2 S-adenosyl-L-homocysteine.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
