<activity rdf:resource="2.1.1.238#SIP9A045F31C0137186"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme is involved in the biosynthesis of mycinamicin macrolide antibiotics.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Requires Mg(2+) for optimal activity.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/19415708"/>
