<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.1.1.269">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>dimethylsulfoniopropionate demethylase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>dimethylsulfoniopropionate-dependent demethylase A</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.1.1.269#SIPC2370BE2151218AA"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme from the marine bacteria Pelagibacter ubique and Ruegeria pomeroyi are specific toward S,S-dimethyl-beta-propiothetin.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>They do not demethylate glycine-betaine.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/9396840"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/18849431"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/22162093"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="2.1.1.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="2.1.1.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.1.1.269#SIPC2370BE2151218AA">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>(6S)-5,6,7,8-tetrahydrofolate + S,S-dimethyl-beta-propiothetin = (6S)-5-methyl-5,6,7,8-tetrahydrofolate + 3-(methylsulfanyl)propanoate + H(+).</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
