<rdfs:label>adenosine(645) in 25S rRNA + S-adenosyl-L-methionine = H(+) + N(1)-methyladenosine(645) in 25S rRNA + S-adenosyl-L-homocysteine.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
