<activity rdf:resource="2.1.1.293#SIP5A91B3D5B35B1784"/>
<rdfs:comment>Involved in the biosynthetic pathways of several indole alkaloids such as tryprostatins, fumitremorgins and verruculogen.</rdfs:comment>
