<skos:prefLabel>peptide chain release factor N(5)-glutamine methyltransferase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>N(5)-glutamine MTase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>N(5)-glutamine S-adenosyl-L-methionine dependent methyltransferase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.1.1.297#SIP753AD4D7FCC026A4"/>
<rdfs:comment>Modifies the glutamine residue in the universally conserved glycylglycylglutamine (GGQ) motif of peptide chain release factor, resulting in almost complete loss of release activity.</rdfs:comment>
