<rdfs:label>N-terminal L-seryl-L-prolyl-L-lysyl-[protein] + S-adenosyl-L-methionine = H(+) + N-terminal N-methyl-L-seryl-L-prolyl-L-lysyl-[protein] + S-adenosyl-L-homocysteine.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
