<skos:altLabel>PavNMT</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.1.1.300#SIP7910137E98A3561A"/>
<activity rdf:resource="2.1.1.300#SIP1AB199A142C3FDC2"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, isolated from the plant Thalictrum flavum, also methylates (R,S)-stylopine and (S)-scoulerine (11%) with lower activity (14% and 11%, respectively).</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/18997344"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/19624470"/>
