<rdfs:label>dTDP-4-amino-2,3,4,6-tetradeoxy-alpha-D-erythro-hexopyranose + 2 S-adenosyl-L-methionine = dTDP-alpha-D-forosamine + 2 H(+) + 2 S-adenosyl-L-homocysteine.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
