<rdfs:label>L-lysyl(79)-[histone H3] + 3 S-adenosyl-L-methionine = 3 H(+) + N(6),N(6),N(6)-trimethyl-L-lysyl(79)-[histone H3] + 3 S-adenosyl-L-homocysteine.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
