<rdfs:label>L-lysyl(9)-[histone H3] + S-adenosyl-L-methionine = H(+) + N(6)-methyl-L-lysyl(9)-[histone H3] + S-adenosyl-L-homocysteine.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
