<rdfs:label>L-lysyl(27)-[histone H3] + 2 S-adenosyl-L-methionine = 2 H(+) + N(6),N(6)-dimethyl-L-lysyl(27)-[histone H3] + 2 S-adenosyl-L-homocysteine.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
