<skos:altLabel>glycinamide ribonucleotide transformylase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.1.2.2#SIP65EAB6B4403617E1"/>
<rdfs:comment>Two enzymes are known to catalyze the third step in de novo purine biosynthesis.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>This enzyme utilizes 10-formyltetrahydrofolate as the formyl donor, while the other enzyme, EC 6.3.1.21, utilizes formate.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>In vertebrates this activity is catalyzed by a trifunctional enzyme that also catalyzes the activities of EC 6.3.4.13 and EC 6.3.3.1.</rdfs:comment>
