<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.3.1.13">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>glycine N-acyltransferase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.3.1.13#SIPA6043480A48C7C6E"/>
<rdfs:comment>The CoA derivatives of a number of aliphatic and aromatic acids, but not phenylacetyl-CoA or (indol-3-yl)acetyl-CoA, can act as donor.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Not identical with EC 2.3.1.68 or EC 2.3.1.71.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/457678"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/931988"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/13174534"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="2.3.1.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="2.3.1.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.3.1.13#SIPA6043480A48C7C6E">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>an acyl-CoA + glycine = an N-acylglycine + CoA + H(+).</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
