<skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/pubmed/6825679"/>
<foaf:primaryTopicOf rdf:resource="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/6825679"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.3.1.16">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>acetyl-CoA C-acyltransferase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>3-ketoacyl-CoA thiolase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>beta-ketothiolase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.3.1.16#SIPBB221B91485D667A"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, found in both eukaryotes and in prokaryotes, is involved in degradation pathways such as fatty acid beta-oxidation.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme acts on 3-oxoacyl-CoAs to produce acetyl-CoA and an acyl-CoA shortened by two carbon atoms.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The reaction starts with the acylation of a nucleophilic cysteine at the active site by a 3-oxoacyl-CoA, with the concomitant release of acetyl-CoA.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>In the second step the acyl group is transferred to CoA.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Most enzymes have a broad substrate range for the 3-oxoacyl-CoA. cf. EC 2.3.1.9.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/13174544"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="2.3.1.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="2.3.1.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.3.1.16#SIPBB221B91485D667A">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>acetyl-CoA + an acyl-CoA = a 3-oxoacyl-CoA + CoA.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/13174544">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Citation"/>
<skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/pubmed/13174544"/>
<foaf:primaryTopicOf rdf:resource="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/13174544"/>
<dcterms:identifier>doi:10.1016/s0021-9258(18)65653-4</dcterms:identifier>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.3.1.17">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>aspartate N-acetyltransferase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.3.1.17#SIPFE9B32B4902DD616"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/6061408"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="2.3.1.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="2.3.1.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
