<skos:altLabel>aminoglycoside 3-N-acetyltransferase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.3.1.81#SIP4FC3084399365021"/>
<rdfs:comment>A wide range of antibiotics containing the 2-deoxystreptamine ring can act as acceptor, including gentamicin, kanamycin, tobramycin, neomycin and apramycin.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Different from EC 2.3.1.60.</rdfs:comment>
