<skos:prefLabel>beta-glucogallin O-galloyltransferase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.3.1.90#SIP10C3005657B7C8C7"/>
<rdfs:comment>beta-Glucogallin can act as donor and as acceptor.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Digalloylglucose can also act as acceptor, with the formation of 1-O,2-O,6-O-trigalloylglucose.</rdfs:comment>
