<activity rdf:resource="2.3.1.98#SIP3DE57FA41BC6A649"/>
<rdfs:comment>Galactarate can act as acceptor, more slowly.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Involved with EC 2.3.1.99 in the formation of caffeoylglucarate in tomato.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="2.3.1.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="2.3.1.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
