<skos:altLabel>tartronate sinapoyltransferase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.3.1.106#SIPDBB52B5EC514A224"/>
<rdfs:comment>4-Coumaroyl-CoA (4-hydroxycinnamoyl-CoA), caffeoyl-CoA (3,4-dihydroxycinnamoyl-CoA) and feruloyl-CoA (4-hydroxy-3-methoxycinnamoyl-CoA) can also act as donors for the enzyme from the mung bean (Vigna radiata).</rdfs:comment>
