<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.3.1.166">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>2alpha-hydroxytaxane 2-O-benzoyltransferase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>2-debenzoyl-7,13-diacetylbaccatin III-2-O-benzoyl transferase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>benzoyl-CoA:taxane 2alpha-O-benzoyltransferase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.3.1.166#SIPFC6EBFFA8BB33A4F"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme was studied using the semisynthetic substrate 2-debenzoyl-7,13-diacetylbaccatin III.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It will not acylate the hydroxy group at 1beta, 7beta, 10beta or 13alpha of 10-deacetylbaccatin III, or at 2alpha or 5alpha of taxa-4(20),11-diene-2alpha,5alpha-diol.</rdfs:comment>
