<rdfs:label>(9Z)-hexadecenoyl-[ACP] + H(+) + malonyl-[ACP] = 3-oxo-(11Z)-octadecenoyl-[ACP] + CO2 + holo-[ACP].</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
