<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.3.1.186">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>pseudotropine acyltransferase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>PAT</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>pseudotropine acetyltransferase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>pseudotropine tigloyltransferase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.3.1.186#SIPD6D965DB7E7C91EE"/>
<rdfs:comment>Exhibits absolute specificity for the exo/3beta configuration found in pseudotropine as tropine (tropan-3alpha-ol; see EC 2.3.1.185) and nortropine are not substrates.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Acts on a wide range of aliphatic acyl-CoA derivatives, including acetyl-CoA, beta-methylcrotonyl-CoA and tigloyl-CoA.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/1959620"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/10626376"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="2.3.1.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="2.3.1.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
