<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.3.1.190">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>acetoin dehydrogenase system</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>acetoin dehydrogenase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.3.1.190#SIPC7E7E997742375B0"/>
<rdfs:comment>Requires thiamine diphosphate.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It belongs to the 2-oxoacid dehydrogenase system family, which also includes EC 1.2.1.104, EC 1.2.1.105, EC 1.2.1.25 and EC 1.4.1.27.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>With the exception of the glycine cleavage system, which contains 4 components, the 2-oxoacid dehydrogenase systems share a common structure, consisting of three main components, namely a 2-oxoacid dehydrogenase (E1), a dihydrolipoamide acyltransferase (E2), and dihydrolipoamide dehydrogenase (E3).</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/2061286"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/7813883"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/8110297"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/8206840"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/10368162"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="2.3.1.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="2.3.1.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.3.1.190#SIPC7E7E997742375B0">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>acetoin + CoA + NAD(+) = acetaldehyde + acetyl-CoA + H(+) + NADH.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
