<activity rdf:resource="2.3.1.238#SIP5C4CBDB02B62D9A1"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme catalyzes the ultimate reaction in the lovastatin biosynthesis pathway of the filamentous fungus Aspergillus terreus.</rdfs:comment>
