<rdfs:label>(S)-2-methylbutanoyl-[2-methylbutanoate polyketide synthase] + monacolin J carboxylate = holo-[2-methylbutanoate polyketide synthase] + lovastatin carboxylate.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
