<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.3.1.276">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>galactosamine-1-phosphate N-acetyltransferase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.3.1.276#SIP89F46DB78EE09C90"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, characterized from the archaeon Sulfolobus tokodaii, is also active toward alpha-D-glucosamine 1-phosphate (cf. EC 2.3.1.157).</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>In addition, that enzyme contains a second domain that catalyzes the activities of EC 2.7.7.23, EC 2.7.7.24, and EC 2.7.7.83.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/15598657"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/20400541"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/29507091"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="2.3.1.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="2.3.1.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
