<rdfs:label>a medium-chain 3-oxoacyl-[ACP] + dihydroxyacetone phosphate = a 2-oxo-3-(phosphooxy)propyl medium-chain 3-oxoalkanoate + holo-[ACP].</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
