<skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/pubmed/28451186"/>
<foaf:primaryTopicOf rdf:resource="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/28451186"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.3.1.282">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>phenolphthiocerol/phthiocerol/phthiodiolone dimycocerosyl transferase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.3.1.282#SIPF0959EF643F1A467"/>
<activity rdf:resource="2.3.1.282#SIP6C39165DD0C4F5DF"/>
<activity rdf:resource="2.3.1.282#SIP868F3098013DBF6B"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, present in certain pathogenic species of mycobacteria, catalyzes the transfer of mycocerosic acids to the two hydroxyl groups at the common lipid core of phthiocerol, phthiodiolone, and phenolphthiocerol, forming dimycocerosate esters.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The fatty acid precursors of mycocerosic acids are activated by EC 6.2.1.49, which loads them onto EC 2.3.1.111.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>That enzyme extends the precursors to form mycocerosic acids that remain attached until transferred by EC 2.3.1.282.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/15070765"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/15123643"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/22361940"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/26271001"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="2.3.1.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="2.3.1.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.3.1.282#SIPF0959EF643F1A467">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>2 a mycocerosyl-[mycocerosic acid synthase] + a phthiocerol = a dimycocerosyl phthiocerol + 2 holo-[mycocerosic acid synthase].</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.3.1.282#SIP6C39165DD0C4F5DF">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>2 a mycocerosyl-[mycocerosic acid synthase] + a phthiodiolone = a dimycocerosyl phthiodiolone + 2 holo-[mycocerosic acid synthase].</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.3.1.282#SIP868F3098013DBF6B">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>2 a mycocerosyl-[mycocerosic acid synthase] + a phenolphthiocerol = a dimycocerosyl phenolphthiocerol + 2 holo-[mycocerosic acid synthase].</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
