<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.3.1.302">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>hydroxycinnamoyl-CoA:5-hydroxyanthranilate N-hydroxycinnamoyltransferase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.3.1.302#SIPE5E0B96D504AE277"/>
<activity rdf:resource="2.3.1.302#SIPA3869B219B06FB7C"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme participates in the biosynthesis of avenanthramides, phenolic alkaloids found mainly in oats (Avena sativa).</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It is related to EC 2.3.1.133.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme from oat does not accept feruloyl-CoA as a substrate.</rdfs:comment>
