<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.3.1.306">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>acetyl-CoA:lysine N(6)-acetyltransferase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>lysine N(6)-acetyltransferase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.3.1.306#SIP06D9DE0A19EFEC32"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme catalyzes the first step of an L-lysine degradation pathway found in many fungal species.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme is specific for acetyl-CoA as the acetyl donor. cf. EC 2.3.1.32.</rdfs:comment>
