<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.3.1.308">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>tubulin N-terminal N-acetyltransferase NAT9</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>microtubule-associated N-acetyltransferase NAT9</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.3.1.308#SIP84DD4F3D1967E694"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, characterized from the fruit fly (Drosophila melanogaster), acetylates the N-terminal of both alpha- and beta-tubulin.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme acts cotranslationally, and can't act on a preformed tubulin alpha/beta heterodimer.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/33479178"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="2.3.1.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="2.3.1.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.3.1.308#SIP84DD4F3D1967E694">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>acetyl-CoA + N-terminal L-methionyl-[tubulin] = CoA + H(+) + N-terminal N(alpha)-acetyl-L-methionyl-[tubulin].</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/33479178">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Citation"/>
<skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/pubmed/33479178"/>
<foaf:primaryTopicOf rdf:resource="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/33479178"/>
<dcterms:identifier>doi:10.1073/pnas.2010140118</dcterms:identifier>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.3.1.309">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>[beta-tubulin]-L-lysine N-acetyltransferase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.3.1.309#SIP57D0D4E98A7E1DB9"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme acetylates L-lysine at position 252 of beta-tubulin, which is located at the interface of alpha/beta-tubulin heterodimers and interacts with the phosphate group of the alpha-tubulin-bound GTP.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The acetylation is thought to attenuate tubulin incorporation into microtubules.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme catalyzing this activity (NAA50) also catalyzes the acetylation of certain N-terminal methionyl residues. That activity is classified as EC 2.3.1.258. cf. EC 2.3.1.108.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/21177827"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="2.3.1.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="2.3.1.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.3.1.309#SIP57D0D4E98A7E1DB9">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>acetyl-CoA + L-lysyl-[beta-tubulin] = CoA + H(+) + N(6)-acetyl-L-lysyl-[beta-tubulin].</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/21177827">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Citation"/>
<skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/pubmed/21177827"/>
<foaf:primaryTopicOf rdf:resource="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/21177827"/>
<dcterms:identifier>doi:10.1091/mbc.e10-03-0203</dcterms:identifier>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.3.1.310">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>benzoylsuccinyl-CoA thiolase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.3.1.310#SIPB2E3354699FFCA51"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, characterized from the bacteria Thauera aromatica and Geobacter metallireducens, participates in an anaerobic toluene degradation pathway.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/10629170"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/35313080"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="2.3.1.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="2.3.1.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.3.1.310#SIPB2E3354699FFCA51">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>(S)-2-benzoylsuccinyl-CoA + CoA = benzoyl-CoA + succinyl-CoA.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/10629170">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Citation"/>
<skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/pubmed/10629170"/>
<foaf:primaryTopicOf rdf:resource="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/10629170"/>
<dcterms:identifier>doi:10.1128/jb.182.2.272-277.2000</dcterms:identifier>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/35313080">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Citation"/>
<skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/pubmed/35313080"/>
<foaf:primaryTopicOf rdf:resource="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/35313080"/>
