<skos:altLabel>lysophosphatidylserine acyltransferase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.3.1.n6#SIP133AB91A8D887184"/>
<rdfs:comment>Acyltransferase which mediates the conversion of lysophosphatidylserine into phosphatidylserine.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme also catalyzes the acylation of lysophosphatidylethanolamine into phosphatidylethanolamine (cf. EC 2.3.1.n7).</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Prefers oleoyl-CoA as the acyl donor.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/18287005"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/18772128"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="2.3.1.-"/>
