<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.3.2.12">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>peptidyltransferase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.3.2.12#SIPF8660729ED5CABED"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme is a ribozyme.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Two non-equivlant ribonucleoprotein subunits operate in non-concerted fashion in peptide elongation.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The small subunit forms the mRNA-binding machinery and decoding center, the large subunit performs the main ribosomal catalytic function in the peptidyl-transferase center.</rdfs:comment>
