<activity rdf:resource="2.3.2.28#SIPB01314A7E653EA38"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, characterized from the bacterium Pseudomonas syringae, is involved in the biosynthesis of the toxin coronatine.</rdfs:comment>
