<activity rdf:resource="2.3.3.1#SIP89D514F0F480848F"/>
<rdfs:comment>The stereospecificity of this enzyme is opposite to that of EC 2.3.3.3, which is found in some anaerobes.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Citrate synthase for which the stereospecificity with respect to C2 of oxaloacetate has not been established are included in EC 2.3.3.16.</rdfs:comment>
