<skos:altLabel>methylcitrate synthetase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.3.3.5#SIPCB9FAA25DABE5253"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme acts on acetyl-CoA, propanoyl-CoA, butanoyl-CoA and pentanoyl-CoA.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The relative rate of condensation of acetyl-CoA and oxaloacetate is 140% of that of propanoyl-CoA and oxaloacetate, but the enzyme is distinct from EC 2.3.3.1.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Oxaloacetate cannot be replaced by glyoxylate, pyruvate or 2-oxoglutarate.</rdfs:comment>
