<activity rdf:resource="2.3.3.9#SIP84C4CB18B5848031"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme catalyzes the irreversible condensation of acetyl-CoA with glyoxylate to form (S)-malate.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Among other functions, the enzyme participates in the glyoxylate cycle, a modified version of the TCA cycle that bypasses steps that lead to a loss of CO2.</rdfs:comment>
