<skos:prefLabel>2-phosphonomethylmalate synthase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>2-phosphinomethylmalic acid synthase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>PMM synthase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.3.3.19#SIP0285C5E658CE0EC9"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, isolated from several Streptomyces species, participates in the biosynthesis of certain phosphonate antibiotics.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme is analogous to EC 2.3.3.1.</rdfs:comment>
