</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.4.1.13">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>sucrose synthase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>sucrose synthetase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>sucrose-UDP glucosyltransferase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>sucrose-uridine diphosphate glucosyltransferase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>UDP-glucose-fructose glucosyltransferase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>uridine diphosphoglucose-fructose glucosyltransferase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.4.1.13#SIPBE8E8B5C25F74606"/>
<activity rdf:resource="2.4.1.13#SIP9FA0A5E9248F40E1"/>
<activity rdf:resource="2.4.1.13#SIP85585D7FBF74E368"/>
<rdfs:comment>Although UDP is generally considered to be the preferred nucleoside diphosphate for sucrose synthase, numerous studies have shown that ADP serves as an effective acceptor molecule to produce ADP-glucose.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Sucrose synthase has a dual role in producing both UDP-glucose (necessary for cell wall and glycoprotein biosynthesis) and ADP-glucose (necessary for starch biosynthesis).</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/4624446"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/5941994"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/10050318"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/10592030"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/10845453"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/12773636"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/14367373"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="2.4.1.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="2.4.1.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.4.1.13#SIPBE8E8B5C25F74606">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>an NDP-alpha-D-glucose + D-fructose = a ribonucleoside 5'-diphosphate + H(+) + sucrose.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.4.1.13#SIP9FA0A5E9248F40E1">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>D-fructose + UDP-alpha-D-glucose = H(+) + sucrose + UDP.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.4.1.13#SIP85585D7FBF74E368">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>ADP-alpha-D-glucose + D-fructose = ADP + H(+) + sucrose.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
