<activity rdf:resource="2.4.1.25#SIP86C9165516B597AA"/>
<rdfs:comment>An enzymic activity of this nature forms part of the mammalian and Saccharomyces cerevisiae glycogen branching system (see EC 3.2.1.33).</rdfs:comment>
