<activity rdf:resource="2.4.1.47#SIP83FE7A8C9DF589C6"/>
<activity rdf:resource="2.4.1.47#SIP5CA34BEACF6BF3F6"/>
<rdfs:comment>This membrane-bound, endoplasmic reticulum-located enzyme catalyzes the last step in the synthesis of galactocerebrosides, which are abundant sphingolipids of the myelin membrane of the central nervous system and peripheral nervous system.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It has a strong preference for ceramides that contain hydroxylated fatty acids.</rdfs:comment>
