<skos:altLabel>UDP-D-glucose polyribitol phosphate glucosyl transferase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.4.1.53#SIP96B30E83269E1C2F"/>
<rdfs:comment>Involved in the biosynthesis of poly ribitol phosphate teichoic acids in the cell wall of the bacterium Bacillus subtilis W23.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>This enzyme adds a beta-D-glucose to the hydroxyl group at the 2 position of the ribitol phosphate units.</rdfs:comment>
