<rdfs:label>a globoside Gb3Cer (d18:1(4E)) + UDP-N-acetyl-alpha-D-galactosamine = a globoside Gb4Cer (d18:1(4E)) + H(+) + UDP.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
