<activity rdf:resource="2.4.1.87#SIPDAEEF8000A31F2DD"/>
<rdfs:comment>Acts on beta-galactosyl-1,4-N-acetylglucosaminyl termini on asialo-alpha1-acid glycoprotein and N-acetyllactosamine (beta-D-galactosyl-1,4-N-acetyl-beta-D-glucosamine), but not on 2'-fucosylated-N-acetyllactosamine.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The non-reducing terminal N-acetyllactosamine residues of glycoproteins can also act as acceptor.</rdfs:comment>
