<rdfs:label>an N-acetyl-alpha-D-galactosaminyl derivative + UDP-alpha-D-galactose = a beta-D-galactosyl-(1->3)-N-acetyl-alpha-D-galactosaminyl derivative + H(+) + UDP.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
