<replaces rdf:resource="2.4.1.51"/>
<skos:prefLabel>alpha-1,3-mannosyl-glycoprotein 4-beta-N-acetylglucosaminyltransferase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>alpha-1,3-mannosylglycoprotein beta-1,4-N-acetylglucosaminyltransferase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>beta-acetylglucosaminyltransferase IV</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>GnTIV</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>N-acetylglucosaminyltransferase IV</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>N-glycosyl-oligosaccharide-glycoprotein N-acetylglucosaminyltransferase IV</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>uridine diphosphoacetylglucosamine-glycopeptide beta4-acetylglucosaminyltransferase IV</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.4.1.145#SIP4CE236FCD6CC2436"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, found in vertebrates, participates in the processing of N-glycans in the Golgi apparatus.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>By adding a glucosaminyl residue to biantennary N-linked glycans, it enables the synthesis of tri- and tetra-antennary complexes.</rdfs:comment>
