<skos:prefLabel>isoflavone 7-O-glucosyltransferase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.4.1.170#SIP56D0FFDF1518DE60"/>
<activity rdf:resource="2.4.1.170#SIPDE9A2A528BB29659"/>
<activity rdf:resource="2.4.1.170#SIP22D7D1EB5E212F17"/>
<activity rdf:resource="2.4.1.170#SIPE6545565092B96A6"/>
<activity rdf:resource="2.4.1.170#SIP57B65073D08408D5"/>
<rdfs:comment>The 4'-methoxy isoflavones biochanin A and formononetin and, more slowly, the 4'-hydroxy isoflavones genistein and daidzein, can act as acceptors.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme does not act on isoflavanones, flavones, flavanones, flavanols or coumarins.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/6458246"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="2.4.1.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="2.4.1.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
