<skos:altLabel>cycasin synthase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.4.1.171#SIP2D738CB3FB6984A2"/>
<rdfs:comment>Brings about the biosynthesis of the toxic substance cycasin in the leaves of Japanese cycad, Cycas revoluta.</rdfs:comment>
