<activity rdf:resource="2.4.1.177#SIPC95EBCD223F4F556"/>
<rdfs:comment>4-coumarate, 2-coumarate, benzoate, feruloate and caffeate can also act as acceptors, more slowly.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Involved in the biosynthesis of chlorogenic acid in the root of the sweet potato.</rdfs:comment>
