<activity rdf:resource="2.4.1.182#SIPD91DB38564007A51"/>
<rdfs:comment>Involved with EC 2.3.1.129 and EC 2.7.1.130 in the biosynthesis of the phosphorylated glycolipid, lipid A, in the outer membrane of Gram negative bacteria.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/2824445"/>
