<rdfs:comment>Involved in the biosynthesis of plant saponins.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Not identical with EC 2.4.1.173 or EC 2.4.1.192.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="2.4.1.-"/>
