<rdfs:label>(25S)-5beta-spirostan-3beta-ol + UDP-alpha-D-glucose = (25S)-5beta-spirostan-3beta-yl beta-D-glucoside + H(+) + UDP.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
