<skos:altLabel>desulfoglucosinolate-uridine diphosphate glucosyltransferase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>thiohydroximate beta-D-glucosyltransferase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>thiohydroximate glucosyltransferase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>thiohydroximate S-glucosyltransferase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>UGT74B1</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>uridine diphosphoglucose-thiohydroximate glucosyltransferase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.4.1.195#SIP7B2404D4A31F6C5A"/>
<activity rdf:resource="2.4.1.195#SIP7CE00B5A09282226"/>
<activity rdf:resource="2.4.1.195#SIP8B077EBC45CBD500"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme specifically glucosylates the thiohydroximate functional group.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It is involved in the biosynthesis of glucosinolates in cruciferous plants, and acts on aliphatic, aromatic, and indolic substrates.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/2524977"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/8373190"/>
