<rdfs:label>a beta-D-Gal-(1->4)-beta-D-Glc-(1&lt;->1)-Cer(d18:1(4E)) + UDP-N-acetyl-alpha-D-glucosamine = a beta-D-GlcNAc-(1->3)-beta-D-Gal-(1->4)-beta-D-Glc-(1&lt;->1)-Cer(d18:1(4E)) + H(+) + UDP.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
