<rdfs:label>a 1,2-diacyl-3-O-(alpha-D-glucopyranosyl)-sn-glycerol + UDP-alpha-D-glucose = 1,2-diacyl-3-O-[alpha-D-glucosyl-(1-> 2)-alpha-D-glucosyl]-sn-glycerol + H(+) + UDP.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
