<activity rdf:resource="2.4.1.221#SIP8D77C039F3B862D5"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, found in animals and plants, is involved in the biosynthesis of O-fucosylated proteins.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>In EGF domains, the attachment of fucose to serine or threonine occurs within the sequence Cys-Xaa-Xaa-Gly-Gly-Ser/Thr-Cys.</rdfs:comment>
