<skos:prefLabel>kaempferol 3-O-galactosyltransferase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>F3GalTase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.4.1.234#SIPB316B32898CE2E61"/>
<rdfs:comment>Acts on the endogenous flavonols kaempferol and quercetin, to a lesser extent on myricetin and fisetin, and weakly on galangin and isorhamnetin.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The reaction can occur equally well in both directions.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/10567367"/>
