<rdfs:label>flavanone 7-O-beta-D-glucoside + UDP-beta-L-rhamnose = flavanone 7-O-[alpha-L-rhamnosyl-(1->2)-beta-D-glucoside] + H(+) + UDP.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
