<activity rdf:resource="2.4.1.237#SIP816DA7E9D6D07054"/>
<rdfs:comment>Acts on the flavonols gossypetin (8-hydroxyquercetin) and to a lesser extent on quercetin, kaempferol and myricetin.</rdfs:comment>
