</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.4.1.269">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>mannosylglycerate synthase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.4.1.269#SIPD99D1802E34231D6"/>
<rdfs:comment>Rhodothermus marinus can also form mannosylglycerate via a two-step pathway catalyzed by EC 2.4.1.217 and EC 3.1.3.70.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Depending on experimental conditions mannosylglycerate synthase is more or less specific for the GDP-mannose and D-glycerate.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/10585410"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/15951819"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="2.4.1.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="2.4.1.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
