<rdfs:comment>It will also act on anthocyanidin 3-O-(6-O-malonylglucoside) and is much less active with hydroxycinnamoylglucose derivatives.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>There is no activity in the absence of the 3-O-glucoside group.</rdfs:comment>
