</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.4.1.349">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>mannosyl-N-acetyl-alpha-D-glucosaminyl-diphospho-ditrans,octacis-undecaprenol 3-alpha-mannosyltransferase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.4.1.349#SIP4880860A5EF571E3"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme is involved in the biosynthesis of the linker region of the polymannose O-polysaccharide in the outer leaflet of the membrane of Escherichia coli serotypes O8, O9 and O9a.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It has no activity with N-acetyl-alpha-D-glucosaminyl-diphospho-ditrans,octacis-undecaprenol (Cf. EC 2.4.1.348).</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/22875852"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="2.4.1.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="2.4.1.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
