<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.4.2.37">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>NAD(+)--dinitrogen-reductase ADP-D-ribosyltransferase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>NAD-azoferredoxin (ADPribose)transferase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>NAD-dinitrogen-reductase ADP-D-ribosyltransferase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.4.2.37#SIP86D717F3D6F9AF0A"/>
<rdfs:comment>The combined action of this enzyme and EC 3.2.2.24 controls the activity level of nitrogenase (EC 1.18.6.1).</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>In the presence of ammonium, the product of nitrogenase, this enzyme covalently links an ADP-ribose moiety to a specific arginine residue of the dinitrogenase reductase component of nitrogenase, blocking its activity.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/2506427"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/3141411"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/24934999"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="2.4.2.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="2.4.2.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
