<activity rdf:resource="2.4.2.47#SIPBCB4778D2F478839"/>
<rdfs:comment>Isolated from Mycobacterium smegmatis.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Involved in the formation of the cell wall in mycobacteria.</rdfs:comment>
