<skos:prefLabel>alpha-dystroglycan beta1,4-xylosyltransferase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.4.2.61#SIP1AF400A5CDD7A156"/>
<activity rdf:resource="2.4.2.61#SIP9B15EE2307CE5FA6"/>
<rdfs:comment>This eukaryotic enzyme catalyzes a step in the biosynthesis of the glycan moiety of the membrane protein alpha-dystroglycan.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It is specific for the second ribitol 5-phosphate in the nascent glycan chain as acceptor.</rdfs:comment>
