<activity rdf:resource="2.4.3.6#SIPA2E9C2A65897D32A"/>
<activity rdf:resource="2.4.3.6#SIP76DAC7CEF8A9926C"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme recognizes the sequence beta-D-galactosyl-(1->4)-N-acetyl-D-glucosaminyl (known as type 2 histo-blood group precursor disaccharide) in non-reducing termini of glycan moieties in glycoproteins and glycolipids.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme from chicken brain was shown to act on neolactotetraosylceramide, producing ganglioside LM1.</rdfs:comment>
