<rdfs:label>alpha-Kdo-(2->4)-alpha-Kdo-(2->6)-lipid IVA (E. coli) + CMP-3-deoxy-beta-D-manno-octulosonate = alpha-Kdo-(2->4)-alpha-Kdo-(2->4)-alpha-Kdo-(2->6)-lipid IVA + CMP + H(+).</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
