<rdfs:label>ADP-L-glycero-beta-D-manno-heptose + alpha-Kdo-(2->4)-alpha-Kdo-(2->6)-lipid A (E. coli) = ADP + H(+) + L-alpha-D-Hep-(1->5)-[alpha-Kdo-(2->4)]-alpha-Kdo-(2->6)-lipid A (E. coli).</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
