<skos:altLabel>alkyldihydroxyacetonephosphate synthase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.5.1.26#SIP806AA6F9FA4F9AA2"/>
<rdfs:comment>The ester-linked fatty acid of the substrate is cleaved and replaced by a long-chain alcohol in an ether linkage.</rdfs:comment>
