<skos:altLabel>cytokinin synthase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>isopentenyltransferase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.5.1.27#SIP09DD3EDA940E1FAD"/>
<rdfs:comment>Involved in the biosynthesis of cytokinins in plants.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Some isoforms from the plant Arabidopsis thaliana are specific for AMP while others also have the activity of EC 2.5.1.112.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/499537"/>
