<skos:prefLabel>trihydroxypterocarpan dimethylallyltransferase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>dimethylallyl-diphosphate:(6aS,11aS)-3,6a,9-trihydroxypterocarpan dimethyltransferase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>dimethylallylpyrophosphate:3,6a,9-trihydroxypterocarpan dimethylallyltransferase</skos:altLabel>
