<rdfs:comment>The name methionine synthase is more commonly applied to EC 2.1.1.13.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme from Saccharomyces cerevisiae also catalyzes the reaction of EC 2.5.1.47, but more slowly.</rdfs:comment>
