<skos:prefLabel>hydroxymethylbilane synthase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>(4-[2-carboxyethyl]-3-[carboxymethyl]pyrrol-2-yl)methyltransferase (hydrolyzing)</skos:altLabel>
