<skos:prefLabel>cysteate synthase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.5.1.76#SIP686CD0E5EA3AE97D"/>
<rdfs:comment>It is highly specific for O-phospho-L-serine and sulfite.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The reaction proceeds through a dehydroalanine (2-aminoacrylic acid) intermediate.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme from Methanosarcina acetivorans is evolutionarily related to EC 4.2.3.1, but the reaction is more similar to that of EC 2.5.1.65.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/19761441"/>
