<skos:prefLabel>7-dimethylallyltryptophan synthase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>7-DMATS</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.5.1.80#SIPD31285F061576A2F"/>
<rdfs:comment>This enzyme is more flexible toward the aromatic substrate than EC 2.5.1.34, but similar to that enzyme, accepts only dimethylallyl diphosphate as the prenyl donor.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/17906140"/>
