<skos:prefLabel>all-trans-nonaprenyl-diphosphate synthase [geranyl-diphosphate specific]</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>nonaprenyl diphosphate synthase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>solanesyl-diphosphate synthase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.5.1.84#SIPFB24F681AB2D84C1"/>
<rdfs:comment>(2E,6E)-Farnesyl diphosphate and geranylgeranyl diphosphate are less effective as substrates than geranyl diphosphate.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme is involved in the synthesis of the side chain of menaquinone-9.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>In Oryza sativa the enzyme SPS2 is involved in providing solanesyl diphosphate for plastoquinone-9 formation.</rdfs:comment>
