<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.5.1.136">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>2-acylphloroglucinol 4-prenyltransferase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>aromatic prenyltransferase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.5.1.136#SIP30BF59E922BABCD1"/>
<activity rdf:resource="2.5.1.136#SIP41F31B41AAB3C382"/>
<activity rdf:resource="2.5.1.136#SIPBEDFDA9A9C5CA560"/>
<activity rdf:resource="2.5.1.136#SIPB265E1D5E8A96180"/>
<activity rdf:resource="2.5.1.136#SIP4E0BDA077A114B76"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, characterized from hop (Humulus lupulus), acts on phlorisovalerophenone, phlormethylbutanophenone, and phlorisobutanophenone during the synthesis of bitter acids.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It also acts with much lower activity on naringenin chalcone.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Forms a complex with EC 2.5.1.137 which catalyzes additional prenylation reactions.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/22166201"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/25564559"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="2.5.1.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="2.5.1.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.5.1.136#SIP30BF59E922BABCD1">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>a 2-acylphloroglucinol + dimethylallyl diphosphate = a 2-acyl-4-prenylphloroglucinol + diphosphate.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.5.1.136#SIP41F31B41AAB3C382">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>dimethylallyl diphosphate + phlorisovalerophenone = 4-prenylphlorisovalerophenone + diphosphate.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.5.1.136#SIPBEDFDA9A9C5CA560">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>2-methyl-1-(2,4,6-trihydroxyphenyl)butan-1-one + dimethylallyl diphosphate = 4-prenylphlormethylbutanophenone + diphosphate.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.5.1.136#SIPB265E1D5E8A96180">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>dimethylallyl diphosphate + phlorisobutanophenone = 4-prenylphlorisobutanophenone + diphosphate.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.5.1.136#SIP4E0BDA077A114B76">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>2',4,4',6'-tetrahydroxychalcone + dimethylallyl diphosphate = desmethylxanthohumol + diphosphate.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/22166201">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Citation"/>
<skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/pubmed/22166201"/>
