<foaf:primaryTopicOf rdf:resource="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/25564559"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.5.1.137">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>2-acyl-4-prenylphloroglucinol 6-prenyltransferase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>aromatic prenyltransferase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.5.1.137#SIPA4F8D70E2914AE69"/>
<activity rdf:resource="2.5.1.137#SIP5333E68A005FB4F2"/>
<activity rdf:resource="2.5.1.137#SIPC18B177481E2FFD4"/>
<activity rdf:resource="2.5.1.137#SIPFC1B22519D1169AF"/>
<activity rdf:resource="2.5.1.137#SIPC6EB63F2556CDF54"/>
<activity rdf:resource="2.5.1.137#SIP395946B78D76CDC7"/>
<activity rdf:resource="2.5.1.137#SIP31B94BD3A112B399"/>
<activity rdf:resource="2.5.1.137#SIPF7BED1997F3E78F0"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, characterized from hop (Humulus lupulus), catalyzes two successive prenylations of a 2-acyl-4-prenylphloroglucinol during the synthesis of bitter acids.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Forms a complex with EC 2.5.1.136 which catalyzes the initial prenylation of the substrates.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/25564559"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="2.5.1.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="2.5.1.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.5.1.137#SIPA4F8D70E2914AE69">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>a 2-acyl-4-prenylphloroglucinol + dimethylallyl diphosphate = a 2-acyl-4,6-diprenylphloroglucinol + diphosphate.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.5.1.137#SIP5333E68A005FB4F2">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>a 2-acyl-4,6-diprenylphloroglucinol + dimethylallyl diphosphate = a 2-acyl-4,6,6-triprenylphloroglucinol + diphosphate.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.5.1.137#SIPC18B177481E2FFD4">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>4-prenylphlorisobutanophenone + dimethylallyl diphosphate = deoxycohumulone + diphosphate.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.5.1.137#SIPFC1B22519D1169AF">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>4-prenylphlormethylbutanophenone + dimethylallyl diphosphate = deoxyadlupulone + diphosphate.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.5.1.137#SIPC6EB63F2556CDF54">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>4-prenylphlorisovalerophenone + dimethylallyl diphosphate = deoxyhumulone + diphosphate.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.5.1.137#SIP395946B78D76CDC7">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>deoxycohumulone + dimethylallyl diphosphate = colupulone + diphosphate + H(+).</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.5.1.137#SIP31B94BD3A112B399">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>deoxyadlupulone + dimethylallyl diphosphate = adlupulone + diphosphate + H(+).</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.5.1.137#SIPF7BED1997F3E78F0">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>deoxyhumulone + dimethylallyl diphosphate = diphosphate + H(+) + lupulone.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/25564559">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Citation"/>
<skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/pubmed/25564559"/>
<foaf:primaryTopicOf rdf:resource="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/25564559"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.5.1.138">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>coumarin 8-geranyltransferase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.5.1.138#SIP2750CD4208B23DAD"/>
<activity rdf:resource="2.5.1.138#SIPF1F03755748C08F3"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, characterized from the plant Citrus limon, is specific for geranyl diphosphate as a prenyl donor.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It also has low activity with the coumarins 5,7-dihydroxycoumarin and 5-methoxy-7-hydroxycoumarin.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/25077796"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="2.5.1.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="2.5.1.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.5.1.138#SIP2750CD4208B23DAD">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>(2E)-geranyl diphosphate + umbelliferone = 8-geranylumbelliferone + diphosphate.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.5.1.138#SIPF1F03755748C08F3">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>(2E)-geranyl diphosphate + esculetin = 8-geranylesculetin + diphosphate.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/25077796">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Citation"/>
<skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/pubmed/25077796"/>
<foaf:primaryTopicOf rdf:resource="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/25077796"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.5.1.139">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>umbelliferone 6-dimethylallyltransferase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.5.1.139#SIP7474789A91C3D9F8"/>
<activity rdf:resource="2.5.1.139#SIP7BC195C8A62CFB78"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme from parsley (Petroselinum crispum) is specific for umbelliferone and dimethylallyl diphosphate.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>A minor product is osthenol, which is produced by transfer of the dimethylallyl group to C-8 of umbelliferone.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/1366425"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/24354545"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="2.5.1.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="2.5.1.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.5.1.139#SIP7474789A91C3D9F8">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>dimethylallyl diphosphate + umbelliferone = demethylsuberosin + diphosphate.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.5.1.139#SIP7BC195C8A62CFB78">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>dimethylallyl diphosphate + umbelliferone = diphosphate + osthenol.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
