</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.5.1.151">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>alkylcobalamin dealkylase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>alkylcobalamin reductase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.5.1.151#SIP565621823D9FCF4A"/>
<activity rdf:resource="2.5.1.151#SIPCD5A2E7B549D53EA"/>
<activity rdf:resource="2.5.1.151#SIP81BF837E8D70176B"/>
<rdfs:comment>This mammalian enzyme, which is cytosolic, can bind internalized alkylcobalamins and process them to cob(I)alamin using the thiolate of glutathione for nucleophilic displacement.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The product remains bound to the protein, and, following its oxidation to cob(II)alamin, is transferred by the enzyme, together with its interacting partner MMADHC, directly to downstream enzymes involved in adenosylcobalamin and methylcobalamin biosynthesis.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>In addition to its dealkylase function, the enzyme also catalyze an entirely different decyanase reaction with cyanocobalamin (cf. EC 1.16.1.6).</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/19447654"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/19801555"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/21697092"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="2.5.1.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="2.5.1.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.5.1.151#SIP565621823D9FCF4A">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>an R-cob(III)alamin + apo-[alkylcobalamin reductase] + glutathione = an S-substituted glutathione + cob(I)alamin-[alkylcobalamin reductase] + H(+).</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.5.1.151#SIPCD5A2E7B549D53EA">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>apo-[alkylcobalamin reductase] + glutathione + methylcob(III)alamin = cob(I)alamin-[alkylcobalamin reductase] + H(+) + S-methyl glutathione.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.5.1.151#SIP81BF837E8D70176B">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>adenosylcob(III)alamin + apo-[alkylcobalamin reductase] + glutathione = cob(I)alamin-[alkylcobalamin reductase] + H(+) + S-adenosylglutathione.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
