<activity rdf:resource="2.6.1.19#SIP7DA3F9609BA1C928"/>
<rdfs:comment>Requires pyridoxal 5'-phosphate.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Some preparations also act on beta-alanine, 5-aminopentanoate and (R,S)-3-amino-2-methylpropanoate. cf. EC 2.6.1.120.</rdfs:comment>
