<skos:altLabel>3,5-dinitrotyrosine aminotransferase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>thyroid-hormone aminotransferase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.6.1.26#SIPA351567FD1BE5FDB"/>
<rdfs:comment>Acts on monoiodotyrosine, diiodotyrosine, triiodothyronine, thyroxine and dinitrotyrosine (unlike EC 2.6.1.24, which does not act on dinitrotyrosine).</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Pyruvate or oxaloacetate can act as acceptor.</rdfs:comment>
