<activity rdf:resource="2.6.1.34#SIP9970E3CFDF8D6816"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme is involved in biosynthesis of UDP-N,N'-diacetylbacillosamine, an intermediate in protein glycosylation pathways in several bacterial species, including N-linked glycosylation of certain L-asparagine residues in Campylobacter species and O-linked glycosylation of certain L-serine residues in Neisseria species.</rdfs:comment>
