<skos:prefLabel>phenylalanine(histidine) transaminase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>phenylalanine(histidine) aminotransferase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.6.1.58#SIP344E08669E1F2C3E"/>
<rdfs:comment>L-Histidine and L-tyrosine can act instead of L-phenylalanine; in the reverse reaction, L-methionine, L-serine and L-glutamine can replace L-alanine.</rdfs:comment>
