<rdfs:comment>The phosphoramidate donor can be replaced by N-phosphoglycine and by an N-phosphohistidine.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>May be identical with EC 3.1.3.9.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="2.7.1.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="2.7.1.-"/>
