<activity rdf:resource="2.7.1.91#SIP99B0B9A7AF49EF99"/>
<activity rdf:resource="2.7.1.91#SIP9A56CB231A29BB26"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme is involved in the production of sphingolipid metabolites.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It phosphorylates various sphingoid long-chain bases, such as sphingosine, D-erythro-dihydrosphingosine (sphinganine), phytosphingosine (4-hydroxysphinganine), 4-hydroxy-8-sphingenine, 4,8-sphingadienine and D-threo-dihydrosphingosine and L-threo-dihydrosphingosine.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The exact substrate range depends on the species.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/4372149"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/4373374"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/9677363"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/9726979"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/10751414"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/18557834"/>
