<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, characterized from a number of hyperthermophilic archaeal species, is highly specific for ADP.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>No activity is detected when ADP is replaced by ATP, GDP, phosphoenolpyruvate, diphosphate or polyphosphate.</rdfs:comment>
