<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.7.1.165">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>glycerate 2-kinase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>D-glycerate-2-kinase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.7.1.165#SIP6C7362930493278D"/>
<rdfs:comment>A key enzyme in the nonphosphorylative Entner-Doudoroff pathway in archaea.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>In Hyphomicrobium methylovorum GM2 the enzyme is involved in formaldehyde assaimilation I (serine pathway).</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>In Escherichia coli the enzyme is involved in D-glucarate/D-galactarate degradation.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/1336459"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/9772162"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/16684110"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/17563835"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/19690808"/>
