</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.7.1.167">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>D-glycero-beta-D-manno-heptose-7-phosphate kinase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>D-beta-D-heptose-7-phosphate kinase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>D-beta-D-heptose 7-phosphate kinase/D-beta-D-heptose 1-phosphate adenylyltransferase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>D-beta-D-heptose 7-phosphotransferase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>glycero-manno-heptose 7-phosphate kinase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>heptose 7-phosphate kinase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>HldE1 heptokinase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.7.1.167#SIPC2922FEF4CD15B7F"/>
<rdfs:comment>The bifunctional protein hldE includes D-glycero-beta-D-manno-heptose-7-phosphate kinase and D-glycero-beta-D-manno-heptose 1-phosphate adenylyltransferase activity (cf. EC 2.7.7.70).</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme is involved in biosynthesis of ADP-L-glycero-beta-D-manno-heptose, which is utilized for assembly of the lipopolysaccharide inner core in Gram-negative bacteria.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme selectively produces D-glycero-beta-D-manno-heptose 1,7-bisphosphate.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/11751812"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/12101286"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/12441667"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/16030223"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/20050615"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="2.7.1.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="2.7.1.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.7.1.167#SIPC2922FEF4CD15B7F">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>ATP + D-glycero-beta-D-manno-heptose 7-phosphate = ADP + D-glycero-beta-D-manno-heptose 1,7-bisphosphate + H(+).</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
