<skos:prefLabel>farnesol kinase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.7.1.216#SIP88B2E88C3324858A"/>
<activity rdf:resource="2.7.1.216#SIP10CFC907FAAC183D"/>
<activity rdf:resource="2.7.1.216#SIP4278046EF8FEBF3C"/>
<activity rdf:resource="2.7.1.216#SIP855DEB204F4486D1"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, found in plants and animals, can also use other nucleotide triphosphates as phosphate donor, albeit less efficiently.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The plant enzyme can also use geraniol and geranylgeraniol as substrates with lower activity, but not farnesyl phosphate (cf. EC 2.7.4.32).</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/9606952"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/21395888"/>
