<activity rdf:resource="2.7.1.224#SIP9701348B0189A2F8"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, characterized from the bacterium Campylobacter jejuni, is involved in formation of a unique O-methyl phosphoramidate modification on specific sugar residues within the bacterium&amp;#8217;s capsular polysaccharides.</rdfs:comment>
