<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.7.1.239">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>alpha-D-ribose-1-phosphate 5-kinase (ATP)</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.7.1.239#SIP986D1AD71D1EB086"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, characterized from the halophilic archaeon Halopiger xanaduensis, participates in a non-carboxylating pentose bisphosphate pathway for nucleoside degradation, which is found in some halophilic archaea. cf. EC 2.7.1.212.</rdfs:comment>
