<skos:altLabel>PP-InsP5 kinase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>PP-IP5 kinase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.7.4.24#SIPEAC57833D4005484"/>
<activity rdf:resource="2.7.4.24#SIPB3FDA4B0862C8AC3"/>
<rdfs:comment>This enzyme is activated by osmotic shock.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Ins(1,3,4,5,6)P5, 1D-myo-inositol diphosphate tetrakisphosphate and 1D-myo-inositol bisdiphosphate triphosphate are not substrates.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme specifically phosphorylates the 1-position of the substrates.</rdfs:comment>
