<skos:prefLabel>([Pyruvate, phosphate dikinase] phosphate) phosphotransferase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>bifunctional dikinase regulatory protein</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>PPDK regulatory protein</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>pyruvate, phosphate dikinase regulatory protein</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.7.4.27#SIP5C8037F5BDA8CA5F"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme from the plants maize and Arabidopsis is bifunctional and also catalyzes the phosphorylation of pyruvate, phosphate dikinase (EC 2.7.9.1), cf. EC 2.7.11.32.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/2983615"/>
