<skos:altLabel>PSRP</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.7.4.28#SIP3AE91D709E4C515D"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme from the bacterium Escherichia coli is bifunctional and catalyzes both the phosphorylation and dephosphorylation of pyruvate, water dikinase (EC 2.7.9.2), cf. EC 2.7.11.33.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/20044937"/>
