<activity rdf:resource="2.7.7.42#SIPBA3A4D3AF5437F0E"/>
<rdfs:comment>This bacterial enzyme adenylates a tyrosine residue of EC 6.3.1.2.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme is bifunctional, and also catalyzes a reaction that removes the adenyl group from the modified tyrosine residue (cf. EC 2.7.7.89).</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The two activities are present on separate domains.</rdfs:comment>
