</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.7.7.61">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>citrate lyase holo-[acyl-carrier protein] synthase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>2'-(5''-phosphoribosyl)-3'-dephospho-CoA transferase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>holo-ACP synthase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>holo-citrate lyase synthase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.7.7.61#SIPC2A27959719AF6AC"/>
<rdfs:comment>The gamma-subunit of EC 4.1.3.6 serves as an acyl-carrier protein (ACP) and contains the cofactor 2'-(5-triphosphoribosyl)-3'-dephospho-CoA.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Synthesis and attachment of the cofactor requires the concerted action of this enzyme and EC 2.4.2.52.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>In the enzyme from Escherichia coli, the cofactor is attached to serine-14 of the ACP via a phosphodiester bond.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/10924139"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/11042274"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/11948157"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="2.7.7.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="2.7.7.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.7.7.61#SIPC2A27959719AF6AC">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>2'-(5''-triphospho-alpha-D-ribosyl)-3'-dephospho-CoA + apo-[citrate lyase ACP] = diphosphate + holo-[citrate lyase ACP].</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
