<skos:prefLabel>D-glycero-alpha-D-manno-heptose 1-phosphate guanylyltransferase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.7.7.71#SIP28FD71DDF1355D2A"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme is involved in biosynthesis of GDP-D-glycero-alpha-D-manno-heptose, which is required for assembly of S-layer glycoprotein in some Gram-positive bacteria.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/11279237"/>
