<rdfs:label>[sulfur-carrier protein ThiS]-C-terminal Gly-Gly + ATP + H(+) = [sulfur-carrier protein ThiS]-C-terminal Gly-Gly-AMP + diphosphate.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
