<skos:altLabel>MoCo cytidylyltransferase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>Mo-MPT cytidyltransferase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.7.7.76#SIPD2D5384B2DE84891"/>
<rdfs:comment>Catalyzes the cytidylation of the molybdenum cofactor.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>This modification occurs only in prokaryotes.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>ATP or GTP cannot replace CTP.</rdfs:comment>
