<rdfs:label>[molybdopterin-synthase sulfur-carrier protein]-C-terminal Gly-Gly + ATP + H(+) = [molybdopterin-synthase sulfur-carrier protein]-C-terminal Gly-Gly-AMP + diphosphate.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
