<activity rdf:resource="2.7.7.87#SIP0225D3EB15FBB4F0"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme is involved in the synthesis of N(6)-threonylcarbamoyladenosine(37) in tRNAs with the anticodon NNU, i.e. tRNA(Ile), tRNA(Thr), tRNA(Asn), tRNA(Lys), tRNA(Ser) and tRNA(Arg).</rdfs:comment>
