<activity rdf:resource="2.7.7.89#SIP2E7F7EFD4496F16C"/>
<rdfs:comment>This bacterial enzyme removes an adenylyl group from a modified tyrosine residue of EC 6.3.1.2.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme is bifunctional, and also performs the adenylation of this residue (cf. EC 2.7.7.42).</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The two activities are present on separate domains.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/4920873"/>
