<skos:altLabel>PrimPol</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.7.7.102#SIP54FF01CBB7A7C918"/>
<activity rdf:resource="2.7.7.102#SIP76C0E199A5DB8BA5"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, which is found in eukaryota and archaea, catalyzes the synthesis of short RNA or DNA sequences which are used as primers for EC 2.7.7.7.</rdfs:comment>
