<skos:altLabel>teichoic acid glycerol transferase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>teichoic-acid synthase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.7.8.12#SIPCA07058DABC7E3C0"/>
<rdfs:comment>Involved in the biosynthesis of poly glycerol phosphate teichoic acids in bacterial cell walls.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>This enzyme adds 30-50 glycerol units to the linker molecule, but only after it has been primed with the first glycerol unit by EC 2.7.8.44. cf. EC 2.7.8.45.</rdfs:comment>
