<rdfs:comment>beta-linked glucose residues in simple glucosides, such as gentiobiose, can act as acceptors.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>In the presence of low concentrations of acceptor, free cyclic 1,2-phosphoglycerol is formed.</rdfs:comment>
