<activity rdf:resource="2.7.8.28#SIP7A0CC552C88DEEF4"/>
<rdfs:comment>This enzyme is involved in the biosynthesis of factor 420, a redox-active cofactor, in methanogenic archaea and certain bacteria.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The specific reaction catalyzed in vivo is determined by the availability of substrate, which in turn is determined by the enzyme present in the organism - EC 2.7.7.68, EC 2.7.7.105, or EC 2.7.7.106.</rdfs:comment>
