<activity rdf:resource="2.7.11.20#SIP6ABCF6DF5D482CB5"/>
<rdfs:comment>Requires calmodulin for activity.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Can also be phosphorylated by the catalytic subunit of EC 2.7.11.11.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Elongation factor 2 is phosphorylated in several cell types in response to various growth factors, hormones and other stimuli that raise intracellular Ca(2+).</rdfs:comment>
