<rdfs:label>(4R,5S)-dethiobiotin + [sulfur carrier]-SH + 2 reduced [2Fe-2S]-[ferredoxin] + 2 S-adenosyl-L-methionine = 2 5'-deoxyadenosine + [sulfur carrier]-H + biotin + 2 L-methionine + 2 oxidized [2Fe-2S]-[ferredoxin].</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
