<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>tRNA-5-methyluridine(54) 2-sulfurtransferase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.8.1.15#SIP04D6D431DBEA14FF"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, found in thermophilic bacteria such as Thermus thermophilus and archaea such as Pyrococcus horikoshii, modifies the ribothymidine (5-methyluridine) residue at position 54 of tRNAs.</rdfs:comment>
