<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.8.4.5">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>tRNA (N(6)-L-threonylcarbamoyladenosine(37)-C(2))-methylthiotransferase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>methylthio-threonylcarbamoyl-adenosine transferase B</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="2.8.4.5#SIPA9A194080429124D"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, which is a member of the S-adenosyl-L-methionine-dependent radical (radical AdoMet) enzymes superfamily, binds two [4Fe-4S] clusters as well as the transferred sulfur.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The sulfur donor is believed to be one of the [4Fe-4S] clusters, which is sacrificed in the process, so that in vitro the reaction is a single turnover.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The identity of the electron donor is not known.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/20584901"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="2.8.4.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="2.8.4.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="2.8.4.5#SIPA9A194080429124D">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>[sulfur carrier]-SH + AH2 + N(6)-L-threonylcarbamoyladenosine(37) in tRNA + 2 S-adenosyl-L-methionine = 2-methylsulfanyl-N(6)-L-threonylcarbamoyladenosine(37) in tRNA + 5'-deoxyadenosine + [sulfur carrier]-H + A + 2 H(+) + L-methionine + S-adenosyl-L-homocysteine.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
