<activity rdf:resource="3.1.1.53#SIP1ECD6F591F13BDF2"/>
<activity rdf:resource="3.1.1.53#SIPB29C04DAB7E6B5E4"/>
<rdfs:comment>Acts on free and glycosidically-bound N-acetyl- or N-glycoloylneuraminic acid.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Acts mainly on 4-O- and 9-O-acetyl groups.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Also acts on some other O-acetyl esters, both cyclic and acyclic compounds, which are not sialic acids.</rdfs:comment>
