</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="3.1.1.78">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>polyneuridine-aldehyde esterase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>PNAE</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>polyneuridine aldehyde esterase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="3.1.1.78#SIP5069F693414758AA"/>
<rdfs:comment>Following hydrolysis of this indole alkaloid ester, the carboxylic acid decarboxylates spontaneously giving the sarpagan skeleton.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Also acts on akuammidine aldehyde (the 16-epimer of polyneuridine aldehyde).</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/10691977"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/12071952"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="3.1.1.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="3.1.1.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="3.1.1.78#SIP5069F693414758AA">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>H2O + polyneuridine aldehyde = 16-epivellosimine + CO2 + methanol.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
