<skos:prefLabel>protein phosphatase methylesterase-1</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="3.1.1.89#SIP73DEF9FF3FAE57C4"/>
<rdfs:comment>A key regulator of protein phosphatase 2A.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The methyl ester is formed by EC 2.1.1.233.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Occurs mainly in the nucleus.</rdfs:comment>
