<activity rdf:resource="3.1.3.58#SIPA7C6112E43C0F7EE"/>
<rdfs:comment>Acts on sugars and polyols phosphorylated on the terminal carbon, with a preference for sugars with a D-erythro-configuration, e.g. good substrates are glucose 6-phosphate, mannose 6-phosphate, 6-phosphogluconate, erythrose 4-phosphate and xylitol 5-phosphate.</rdfs:comment>
