<rdfs:comment>Magnesium-independent.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>This enzyme still works when the 2,3-bis(acyloxy)propyl group is removed, i.e., it hydrolyzes Ins(1,3,4)P3 to Ins(1,3)P2.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It also converts Ins(3,4)P2 into Ins-3-P.</rdfs:comment>
