<rdfs:comment>Does not dephosphorylate inositol 4,5-bisphosphate.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>This enzyme still works when the 2,3-bis(acyloxy)propyl group is removed, i.e., it hydrolyzes Ins(1,3,4,5)P4 to Ins(1,4,5)P3.</rdfs:comment>
