<activity rdf:resource="3.1.3.70#SIPD52225CB45951731"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme from Pyrococcus horikoshii is specific for alpha-D-mannosyl-3-phosphoglycerate and forms part of the pathway for the synthesis of mannosylglycerate.</rdfs:comment>
