<replaces rdf:resource="3.1.3.n4"/>
<skos:prefLabel>2-hydroxy-3-keto-5-methylthiopentenyl-1-phosphate phosphatase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>HK-MTPenyl-1-P phosphatase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="3.1.3.87#SIP120608E46FBFA443"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme participates in the methionine salvage pathway in Bacillus subtilis.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>In some species a single bifunctional enzyme, EC 3.1.3.77, catalyzes both this reaction and that of EC 5.3.2.5.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/8227039"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/14551435"/>
