<skos:altLabel>maltose 6'-P phosphatase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="3.1.3.90#SIP5278D1A36BD32E05"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme from the bacterium Enterococcus faecalis also has activity with the sucrose isomer turanose 6'-phosphate (alpha-D-glucopyranosyl-(1->3)-D-fructose 6-phosphate).</rdfs:comment>
