<rdfs:comment>The enzyme has very low activity with L-galactose 1-phosphate (cf. EC 3.1.3.93).</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/9462881"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="3.1.3.-"/>
