<activity rdf:resource="3.1.3.104#SIP92D780C062A826A4"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, which is found in plants and bacteria, is part of a pathway for riboflavin biosynthesis.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Most forms of the enzyme has a broad substrate specificity.</rdfs:comment>
