<rdf:Description rdf:about="3.1.3.108">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>nocturnin</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>nocturnin (curled)</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="3.1.3.108#SIP3BFFD4D4BE5395DA"/>
<activity rdf:resource="3.1.3.108#SIP83C5FB0629341DBB"/>
<rdfs:comment>The mammalian mitochondrial enzyme is a rhythmically expressed protein that regulates metabolism under the control of circadian clock.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It has a slight preference for NADPH over NADP(+).</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The archaeal enzyme, identified in Methanocaldococcus jannaschii, is bifunctional acting as NAD kinase (EC 2.7.1.23) and NADP phosphatase with a slight preference for NADP(+) over NADPH.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/18391451"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/29860338"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/30389976"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/31147539"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="3.1.3.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="3.1.3.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
