<skos:prefLabel>N-acetylphosphatidylethanolamine-hydrolyzing phospholipase D</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>anandamide-generating phospholipase D</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>N-acyl phosphatidylethanolamine phospholipase D</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="3.1.4.54#SIP0080E512637A7799"/>
<rdfs:comment>This enzyme is involved in the biosynthesis of anandamide.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It does not hydrolyze phosphatidylcholine and phosphatidylethanolamine.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>No transphosphatidation.</rdfs:comment>
