<rdf:Description rdf:about="3.1.4.58">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>RNA 2',3'-cyclic 3'-phosphodiesterase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="3.1.4.58#SIP1BCA63DE5867FD9D"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme hydrolyzes RNA 2',3'-cyclic phosphodiester to an RNA 2'-phosphomonoester.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>In vitro the enzyme can also ligate tRNA molecules with 2',3'-cyclic phosphate to tRNA with 5'-hydroxyl termini, forming a 2'-5' phosphodiester linkage.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>However, the ligase activity is unlikely to be relevant in vivo.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/19155324"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/25239919"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="3.1.4.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="3.1.4.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="3.1.4.58#SIP1BCA63DE5867FD9D">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>a 3'-end 2',3'-cyclophospho-ribonucleotide-RNA + H2O = a 3'-end 2'-phospho-ribonucleotide-RNA + H(+).</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
