<rdf:Description rdf:about="3.1.4.61">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>cyclic 2,3-diphosphoglycerate hydrolase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="3.1.4.61#SIP84A5BCC535E5F55C"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme degrades cyclic 2,3-bisphosphoglycerate, a thermoprotectant that is produced by certain archaeal genera.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Two different enzymes that catalyze this activity, one soluble and one membrane-bound, have been characterized from the archaeon Methanothermobacter thermautotrophicus.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/1550819"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="3.1.4.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="3.1.4.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
