<rdf:Description rdf:about="3.1.21.6">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>CC-preferring endodeoxyribonuclease</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>5'-CC-3'-preferring endodeoxyribonuclease</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>Streptomyces glaucescens exocytoplasmic endodeoxyribonuclease</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>Streptomyces glaucescens exocytoplasmic endonuclease</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="3.1.21.6#SIP023422CB6C4FC5B1"/>
<rdfs:comment>Prefers CC sites in double-stranded circular and linear DNA.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Greater affinity for double-stranded than single-stranded DNA.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Produces nicks, generating double-stranded fragments with 5'- and/or 3'-protruding single-stranded tails.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/1533367"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/3186439"/>
