<skos:altLabel>polygalacturonase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="3.2.1.15#SIP669A2367FA67ABB6"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme catalyzes the random hydrolysis of (1->4)-alpha-D-galactosiduronic linkages in pectate and other galacturonans.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Different forms of the enzyme have different tolerances to methyl esterification of the substrate.</rdfs:comment>
