<skos:altLabel>xylan endo-1,3-beta-xylosidase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="3.2.1.32#SIPA566C17B436B378E"/>
<rdfs:comment>This enzyme is found mostly in marine bacteria, which break down the beta(1,3)-xylan found in the cell wall of some green and red algae.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme produces mainly xylobiose, xylotriose and xylotetraose.</rdfs:comment>
