<skos:altLabel>poly(galacturonate) hydrolase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="3.2.1.67#SIP3116B2551D1D406C"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme hydrolyzes the first glycosidic bond from the non-reducing end of the substrate.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It is specific for saturated oligomers of D-homogalacturonan, and is unable to degrade unsaturated substrates or methyl-esterified substrates.</rdfs:comment>
