<skos:altLabel>maltohexaose-producing amylase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="3.2.1.98#SIPDEDB1DBB3D19C7EA"/>
<rdfs:comment>cf. EC 3.2.1.2, which removes successive maltose residues; EC 3.2.1.3, which removes successive glucose residues; EC 3.2.1.60, which removes successive maltotetraose residues and EC 3.2.1.116, which removes successive maltotriose residues.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The products have the alpha-configuration.</rdfs:comment>
