<rdf:Description rdf:about="3.2.1.179">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>gellan tetrasaccharide unsaturated glucuronosyl hydrolase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>gellan tetrasaccharide unsaturated glucuronyl hydrolase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>unsaturated glucuronyl hydrolase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="3.2.1.179#SIP789A192FCF010F98"/>
<activity rdf:resource="3.2.1.179#SIPB3C9BDA4D90D43D6"/>
<activity rdf:resource="3.2.1.179#SIP825FEA1C95E870A3"/>
<activity rdf:resource="3.2.1.179#SIP8396115248B8407D"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme releases 4-deoxy-4(5)-unsaturated D-glucuronic acid from oligosaccharides produced by polysaccharide lyases, e.g. the tetrasaccharide beta-D-4-deoxy-Delta(4)-GlcAp-(1->4)-beta-D-Glcp-(1->4)-alpha-L-Rhap-(1->3)-D-Glcp produced by EC 4.2.2.25.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme can also hydrolyze unsaturated chondroitin and hyaluronate disaccharides (beta-D-4-deoxy-Delta(4)-GlcAp-(1->3)-beta-D-GalNAc, beta-D-4-deoxy-Delta(4)-GlcAp-(1->3)-beta-D-GalNAc6S, beta-D-4-deoxy-Delta(4)-GlcAp2S-(1->3)-beta-D-GalNAc, beta-D-4-deoxy-Delta(4)-GlcAp-(1->3)-beta-D-GlcNAc), preferring the unsulfated disaccharides to the sulfated disaccharides.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/10441389"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/15148314"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/16630576"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="3.2.1.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="3.2.1.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="3.2.1.179#SIP789A192FCF010F98">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>beta-D-Delta(4)-GlcA-(1->4)-beta-D-Glc-(1->4)-alpha-L-Rha-(1->3)-D-Glc + H2O = 5-dehydro-4-deoxy-D-glucuronate + beta-D-Glc-(1->4)-alpha-L-Rha-(1->3)-D-Glc.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="3.2.1.179#SIPB3C9BDA4D90D43D6">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>beta-D-4-deoxy-Delta(4)-GlcpA-(1->3)-beta-D-GalpNAc + H2O = 5-dehydro-4-deoxy-D-glucuronate + N-acetyl-beta-D-galactosamine.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="3.2.1.179#SIP825FEA1C95E870A3">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>4-deoxy-Delta(4)-beta-D-GlcpA2S-(1->3)-beta-D-GalpNAc + H2O = 5-dehydro-4-deoxy-2-O-sulfo-D-glucuronate + N-acetyl-beta-D-galactosamine.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="3.2.1.179#SIP8396115248B8407D">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>beta-D-4-deoxy-Delta(4)-GlcpA-(1->3)-beta-D-GlcpNAc + H2O = 5-dehydro-4-deoxy-D-glucuronate + N-acetyl-beta-D-galactosamine.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
