<rdf:Description rdf:about="3.2.1.203">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>carboxymethylcellulase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>CMCase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="3.2.1.203#SIPB96028D1C02F6AD7"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme from the acidophilic bacterium Alicyclobacillus acidocaldarius is an endo-cleaving hydrolase that cleaves beta(1->4)-linked residues.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>However, it is specific for (carboxymethyl)cellulose and does not act on cellulosic substrates such as avicel.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/18991780"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="3.2.1.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="3.2.1.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="3.2.1.203#SIPB96028D1C02F6AD7">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>Endohydrolysis of (1->4)-beta-D-glucosidic linkages in (carboxymethyl)cellulose.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/18991780">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Citation"/>
<skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/pubmed/18991780"/>
<foaf:primaryTopicOf rdf:resource="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/18991780"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="3.2.1.204">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>1,3-alpha-isomaltosidase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="3.2.1.204#SIP386287302CDD833C"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, characterized from the bacteria Bacillus sp.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>NRRL B-21195 and Kribbella flavida, participates in the degradation of starch.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The cyclic tetrasaccharide cyclobis-(1->6)-alpha-nigerosyl is formed from starch extracellularly and imported into the cell, where it is degraded to glucose.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/15063208"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/27302067"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="3.2.1.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="3.2.1.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="3.2.1.204#SIP386287302CDD833C">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>cyclobis-(1->3)-alpha-D-isomaltosyl + 2 H2O = 2 isomaltose.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/15063208">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Citation"/>
<skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/pubmed/15063208"/>
<foaf:primaryTopicOf rdf:resource="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/15063208"/>
</rdf:Description>
