</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="3.2.1.206">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>oleuropein beta-glucosidase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="3.2.1.206#SIP5592A38546A15B8A"/>
<rdfs:comment>Oleuropein is a glycosylated secoiridoid exclusively biosynthesized by members of the Oleaceae plant family where it is part of a defense system againt herbivores.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme also hydrolyzes ligstroside and demethyloleuropein.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/16349442"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/19689134"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/22475562"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/25697790"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/28483880"/>
