<activity rdf:resource="3.2.2.1#SIP248CB635FC74F827"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme from the bacterium Ochrobactrum anthropi specifically catalyzes the irreversible N-riboside hydrolysis of purine nucleosides.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Pyrimidine nucleosides, purine and pyrimidine nucleotides, NAD(+), NADP(+) and nicotinaminde mononucleotide are not substrates.</rdfs:comment>
