<activity rdf:resource="3.2.2.22#SIP1922DCBC2748FCC8"/>
<rdfs:comment>Ricin A-chain and related toxins show this activity.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Naked rRNA is attacked more slowly than rRNA in intact ribosomes.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Naked rRNA from Escherichia coli is cleaved at a corresponding position.</rdfs:comment>
