<rdf:Description rdf:about="3.2.2.24">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>ADP-ribosyl-[dinitrogen reductase] hydrolase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>ADP-ribosyl glycohydrolase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>dinitrogenase reductase activating glycohydrolase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="3.2.2.24#SIPB744A1BD78A1BA82"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme restores the activity of EC 1.18.6.1 by catalyzing the removal of ADP-ribose from an arginine residue of the dinitrogenase reductase component of nitrogenase.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>This activity occurs only when the nitrogenase product, ammonium, is not available.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The combined activity of this enzyme and EC 2.4.2.37 controls the level of activity of nitrogenase.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/2506427"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/19477184"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/19706507"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="3.2.2.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="3.2.2.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
