<replaces rdf:resource="3.4.11.n1"/>
<skos:prefLabel>aminopeptidase S</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>double-zinc aminopeptidase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>SGAP</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="3.4.11.24#SIP7DB24B835D252DE7"/>
<rdfs:comment>Activated by Ca(2+).</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>In the presence of Ca(2+), the best substrates are Leu-Phe, Leu-Ser, Leu-pNA (aminoacyl-p-nitroanilide), Phe-Phe-Phe and Phe-Phe.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Peptides with proline in the P1' position are not substrates.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Belongs to peptidase family M28.</rdfs:comment>
