<rdf:Description rdf:about="3.4.11.25">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>beta-peptidyl aminopeptidase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="3.4.11.25#SIP1499F1C9CFE2BAA5"/>
<rdfs:comment>Sphingosinicella xenopeptidilytica strain 3-2W4 is able to utilize the beta-peptides beta-homoVal-beta-homoAla-beta-homoLeu and beta-homoAla-beta-homoLeu as sole carbon and energy sources.</rdfs:comment>
