<activity rdf:resource="3.4.14.4#SIP3139F4096C406605"/>
<rdfs:comment>A cytosolic peptidase that is active at neutral pH.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It has broad activity on peptides, although it is highly selective for Arg-Arg-2-naphthylamide, at pH 9.2.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Active in the hydrolysis of enkephalins.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Belongs to peptidase family M49.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/10387075"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="3.4.14.-"/>
