<activity rdf:resource="3.4.14.13#SIP5632EE19CAF351D3"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, characterized from the bacterium Bacillus subtilis, is involved in the recycling of the murein peptide.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/11747447"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/20944232"/>
