<rdfs:label>[mycofactocin precursor peptide]-C-terminal glycyl-N-{5-[(4-hydroxyphenyl)methyl]-4,4-dimethyl-2-oxopyrrolidin-3-yl}acetamide + H2O = 3-amino-5-[(4-hydroxyphenyl)methyl]-4,4-dimethyl-2-pyrrolidin-2-one + [mycofactocin precursor peptide]-C-terminal glycine.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
