<rdfs:comment>Its ability to hydrolyze pteroyl-L-glutamate (folic acid) has led to its use as a folate-depleting, antitumor agent.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Belongs to peptidase family M20A.</rdfs:comment>
