<rdf:Description rdf:about="3.4.17.25">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>glutathione-S-conjugate glycine hydrolase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="3.4.17.25#SIPF27866791C87A06D"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme participates in a glutathione-mediated detoxification pathway found in plants, algae, fungi, and some bacteria.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzymes from the plant Arabidopsis thaliana and the yeast Saccharomyces cerevisiae also catalyze the activity of EC 2.3.2.15.</rdfs:comment>
