<skos:altLabel>pyrrolidone carboxyl peptidase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="3.4.19.3#SIPBCF79F6EDE23C250"/>
<rdfs:comment>Removes 5-oxoproline from various penultimate amino acid residues except L-proline.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Inhibited by thiol-blocking reagents.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Belongs to peptidase family C15.</rdfs:comment>
