<skos:altLabel>Aspergillus alkaline proteinase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="3.4.21.63#SIPF4D07BF75DA229F3"/>
<rdfs:comment>Predominant extracellular alkaline endopeptidase of the mold Aspergillus oryzae.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Identical or closely related enzymes are produced by A.flavus and A.sojae.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Belongs to peptidase family S8.</rdfs:comment>
