<rdfs:label>Rather non-specific hydrolysis of proteins. Preferential cleavage: -Ala-|-Xaa-, -Tyr-|-Xaa-, -Phe-|-Xaa- in small molecular substrates.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/1012007">
