<skos:altLabel>tPA</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="3.4.21.68#SIPBD6933513B3D7DFD"/>
<rdfs:comment>From a wide variety of mammalian tissues, especially endothelial cells.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Secreted as a single chain precursor which is cleaved to a two-chain form by plasmin.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Activity is considerably enhanced by fibrin.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Belongs to peptidase family S1.</rdfs:comment>
