<skos:altLabel>elastase III</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="3.4.21.70#SIP62AC86EDB3D6AFBE"/>
<rdfs:comment>From pancreatic juice.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Unlike elastases, has an acidic pI.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Binds cholesterol.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Belongs to peptidase family S1.</rdfs:comment>
