<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>pancreatic elastase II</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="3.4.21.71#SIP82AF5E6B4F8C915D"/>
<rdfs:comment>Formed by activation of proelastase II from mammalian pancreas by trypsin.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Usually, only one of the pancreatic elastases (see also EC 3.4.21.36) is expressed in a given species; human pancreatic elastase is of type II.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Belongs to peptidase family S1.</rdfs:comment>
