<skos:altLabel>immunoglobulin A1 protease</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="3.4.21.72#SIPC8AB46FA1A9C22AC"/>
<rdfs:comment>Species variants differing slightly in specificity are secreted by Gram-negative bacteria Neisseria gonorrhoeae and Haemophilus influenzae.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Some other bacterial endopeptidases with similar specificity are of metallotype (see EC 3.4.24.13).</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Belongs to peptidase family S6.</rdfs:comment>
