<replaces rdf:resource="3.4.23.37"/>
<skos:prefLabel>sedolisin</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>pseudomonalisin</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>pseudomonapepsin</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>Pseudomonas sp. pepstatin-insensitive carboxyl proteinase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>sedolysin</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="3.4.21.100#SIPC40EA7A3F72EDB05"/>
<rdfs:comment>An enzyme secreted by Pseudomonas sp. No. 101.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Optimum pH 4.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It is distinguished from EC 3.4.21.101 by its insensitivity to EPNP and from EC 3.4.23.31 by this property and by its unrelated amino-acid sequence.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Inhibited by tyrostatin, a peptide aldehyde.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Belongs to peptidase family S53.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/1562589"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/3548827"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/11323721"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/12673349"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="3.4.21.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="3.4.21.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="3.4.21.100#SIPC40EA7A3F72EDB05">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>Hydrolysis of the B chain of insulin at 13-Glu-|-Ala-14, 15-Leu-|-Tyr-16 and 25-Phe-|-Tyr-26 and angiotensin I at 4-Tyr-|-Ile-5. A good synthetic substrate is Lys-Pro-Ile-Glu-Phe-|-Phe(NO2)-Arg-Leu.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
