<rdfs:comment>Cytosolic in animal cells.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The active enzyme molecule is a heterodimer in which the large subunit contains the peptidase unit, and the small subunit is also a component of EC 3.4.22.52.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Belongs to peptidase family C2.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/10639123"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/12014988"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="3.4.22.-"/>
