<skos:altLabel>zingibain</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="3.4.22.67#SIP0806527F096AA301"/>
<rdfs:comment>Found in ginger (Zingiber officinale) rhizome and is a member of the papain family.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme is inhibited by some divalent metal ions, such as Hg(2+), Cu(2+), Cd(2+) and Zn(2+).</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Belongs to peptidase family C1.</rdfs:comment>
