<activity rdf:resource="3.4.22.69#SIP60D501791FA0108D"/>
<rdfs:comment>SARS coronavirus main protease is the key enzyme in SARS coronavirus replicase polyprotein processing.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Belongs to peptidase family C30.</rdfs:comment>
