<rdf:Description rdf:about="3.4.23.4">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<replaces rdf:resource="3.4.4.3"/>
<skos:prefLabel>chymosin</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>rennin</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="3.4.23.4#SIP19FC7BFB87CC5E5F"/>
<rdfs:comment>Neonatal gastric enzyme with high milk clotting and weak general proteolytic activity, formed from prochymosin.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Found among mammals with postnatal uptake of immunoglobins.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Belongs to peptidase family A1.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/3128264"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/5330666"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/6283469"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="3.4.23.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="3.4.23.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="3.4.23.4#SIP19FC7BFB87CC5E5F">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>Broad specificity similar to that of pepsin A. Clots milk by cleavage of a single 104-Ser-Phe-|-Met-Ala-107 bond in kappa-chain of casein.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
