<rdfs:label>Processing at the authentic HIV-1 PR recognition site and release of the mature p17 matrix and the p24 capsid protein, as a result of the cleavage of the -SQNY-|-PIVQ- cleavage site.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
