<skos:altLabel>Bacillus thermoproteolyticus neutral proteinase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="3.4.24.27#SIPFF95ADBF2CB43FD1"/>
<rdfs:comment>A thermostable extracellular metalloendopeptidase containing four calcium ions.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Enzymes that may be species variants of thermolysin are reported from Micrococcus caseolyticus and Aspergillus oryzae.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Closely related but distinct enzymes are aeromonolysin, pseudolysin, bacillolysin, aureolysin and mycolysin.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Belongs to peptidase family M4.</rdfs:comment>
