<rdfs:comment>There is broad specificity in cleavage of the insulin B chain, with some species variations.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The pH optimum for digesting various proteins is about 9-10.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Belongs to peptidase family M10A.</rdfs:comment>
