<rdfs:comment>Exist as two forms, c and d.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Digests type IV collagen.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Phosphoramidon inhibits in the 0.1 mM range.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Hemorrhagic toxin-2 of C.ruber ruber has the same molecular weight and specificity.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Belongs to peptidase family M12B.</rdfs:comment>
