<skos:altLabel>insulin protease</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="3.4.24.56#SIPD828F43EB2931A80"/>
<rdfs:comment>Cytosolic enzyme, known from mammals and Drosophila melanogaster.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Inhibited by bacitracin, chelating agents EDTA and 1,10-phenanthroline, and by thiol-blocking reagents such as N-ethylmaleimide, but not by phosphoramidon.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Belongs to peptidase family M16.</rdfs:comment>
