<skos:altLabel>Bacteroides fragilis enterotoxin</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="3.4.24.74#SIPF0FE21CC9729741A"/>
<rdfs:comment>Thought to be a cause of diarrhea.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Hydrolyzes extracellular matrix proteins, and disrupts tight junctions of intstinal cells.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Also degrades intracellular, cytoskeletal proteins actin, myosin and others.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Belongs to peptidase family M10.</rdfs:comment>
