<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>peptide deformylase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>PDF</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>polypeptide deformylase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="3.5.1.88#SIPE2C9C6182D540744"/>
<rdfs:comment>Requires Fe(II).</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Also requires at least a dipeptide for an efficient rate of reaction.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>N-terminal L-methionine is a prerequisite for activity but the enzyme has broad specificity at other positions.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Differs in substrate specificity from EC 3.5.1.31.</rdfs:comment>
