<rdf:Description rdf:about="3.5.1.137">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>N-methylcarbamate hydrolase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>carbaryl hydrolase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>carbofuran hydrolase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="3.5.1.137#SIP1506B672E7F2CA89"/>
<activity rdf:resource="3.5.1.137#SIP78836E911BC43503"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme catalyzes the first step in the degradation of several carbamate insecticides such as carbaryl, carbofuran, isoprocarb, propoxur, aldicarb and oxamyl.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It catalyzes the cleavage of the ester bond to release N-methylcarbamate, which spontaneously hydrolyzes to methylamine and CO2.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzymes from several Gram-negative bacteria were shown to be located in the periplasm.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/1785941"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/8407847"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/11445174"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/11872471"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/14612234"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/16348989"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/27312345"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/29079626"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/29884759"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/31759739"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="3.5.1.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="3.5.1.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="3.5.1.137#SIP1506B672E7F2CA89">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>an N-methyl carbamate ester + H(+) + H2O = an alcohol + CO2 + methylamine.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="3.5.1.137#SIP78836E911BC43503">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>carbofuran + H(+) + H2O = 2,2-dimethyl-2,3-dihydro-1-benzofuran-7-ol + CO2 + methylamine.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
