<rdf:Description rdf:about="3.5.2.1">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>barbiturase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="3.5.2.1#SIP3CF60535E44DB84E"/>
<rdfs:comment>Specific for barbiturate as substrate.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Forms part of the oxidative pyrimidine-degrading pathway in some microorganisms, along with EC 1.17.99.4 and EC 3.5.1.95.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It was previously thought that the end-products of the reaction were malonate and urea.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>May be involved in the regulation of pyrimidine metabolism, along with EC 2.4.2.9.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/11485332"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/11748240"/>
