<skos:prefLabel>enamidase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="3.5.2.18#SIP15659694DD731EF2"/>
<rdfs:comment>Forms part of the nicotinate-fermentation catabolism pathway in Eubacterium barkeri.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Other enzymes involved in this pathway are EC 1.17.1.5, EC 1.3.7.1, EC 1.1.1.291, EC 5.4.99.4, EC 5.3.3.6, EC 4.2.1.85 and EC 4.1.3.32.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/16894175"/>
