<activity rdf:resource="3.5.2.19#SIP993C69D8DAB3E5AA"/>
<activity rdf:resource="3.5.2.19#SIP68E91D092F5DFFE2"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme also catalyzes the hydrolysis of streptothricin-D to streptothricin-D acid.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme is responsible for streptothricin resistance in Streptomyces albulus and Streptomyces noursei.</rdfs:comment>
