<activity rdf:resource="3.5.3.12#SIPEF69536CE4E0764E"/>
<rdfs:comment>The plant enzyme also catalyzes the reactions of EC 2.1.3.3, EC 2.1.3.6 and EC 2.7.2.2, thus functioning as a putrescine synthase, converting agmatine and ornithine into putrescine and citrulline, respectively.</rdfs:comment>
