<skos:altLabel>nucleoside triphosphate phosphohydrolase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="3.6.1.15#SIP1DF151BB8B540652"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme is found in eukaryotes and thermophilic bacteria, but appears to be absent from mesophilic bacteria.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Also hydrolyzes nucleoside diphosphates, thiamine diphosphate and FAD.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme from the plant Pisum sativum (garden pea) is regulated by calmodulin.</rdfs:comment>
