<rdfs:label>a dolichyl diphosphooligosaccharide + H2O = a dolichyl phosphate + an oligosaccharide-(1->4)-N-acetyl-beta-D-glucosamine-(1->4)-N-acetyl-alpha-D-glucosamine 1-phosphate + 2 H(+).</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
