<skos:altLabel>DIPP</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="3.6.1.52#SIP9C4966011BF303C7"/>
<activity rdf:resource="3.6.1.52#SIPC2CD3383E9F3EFDD"/>
<activity rdf:resource="3.6.1.52#SIP7C3BE5D10890FC7A"/>
<activity rdf:resource="3.6.1.52#SIPE056606A542A6838"/>
<rdfs:comment>This enzyme hydrolyzes the diphosphate bond, leaving a phospho group where a diphospho group had been.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It can also act on bis(adenosine) diphosphate.</rdfs:comment>
