<rdfs:label>H2O + UDP-2,4-diacetamido-2,4,6-trideoxy-beta-L-altrose = 2,4-diacetamido-2,4,6-trideoxy-beta-L-altrose + H(+) + UDP.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
