<activity rdf:resource="3.6.1.62#SIP6984D97E94E362F2"/>
<rdfs:comment>Decapping of mRNA is a critical step in eukaryotic mRNA turnover.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme is unable to cleave a free cap structure (m(7)GpppG).</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme from Vaccinia virus is synergistically activated in the presence of Mg(2+) and Mn(2+).</rdfs:comment>
