<skos:altLabel>hypoxanthine/xanthine dNTP pyrophosphatase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="3.6.1.66#SIP98D1C84C712EE191"/>
<activity rdf:resource="3.6.1.66#SIP3DB663B61DED2E1E"/>
<activity rdf:resource="3.6.1.66#SIP2E8BAD90533E41CC"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzymes from the bacterium Escherichia coli and the archaea Methanococcus jannaschii and Archaeoglobus fulgidus are highly specific for XTP, dITP and ITP.</rdfs:comment>
