<activity rdf:resource="3.6.1.67#SIP80D2EA463B833547"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme participates in a folate biosynthesis pathway, which is found in bacteria, fungi, and plants.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/4362677"/>
