<activity rdf:resource="3.6.1.76#SIP34669C6066CD046D"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, characterized from the methanogenic archaeon Methanosarcina mazei, belongs to the Nudix hydrolase family (a superfamily of hydrolytic enzymes capable of cleaving nucleoside diphosphates linked to a moiety).</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Its main purpose is to provide the substrate for EC 2.5.1.129.</rdfs:comment>
