</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="3.6.4.7">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>peroxisome-assembly ATPase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>peroxisome assembly factor-2</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="3.6.4.7#SIP05AEEC61C40E23D7"/>
<rdfs:comment>An extremely diversified group of enzymes that use the energy of ATP hydrolysis to import and assemble peroxisome components into the organelle.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Their molecular masses range from 25 to 600 kDa.</rdfs:comment>
