<activity rdf:resource="3.6.4.10#SIP05AEEC61C40E23D7"/>
<rdfs:comment>This is a highly diverse group of enzymes that perform many functions that are similar to those of chaperonins.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>They comprise a number of heat-shock-cognate proteins.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>They are also active in clathrin uncoating and in the oligomerization of actin.</rdfs:comment>
