<skos:prefLabel>DNA helicase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="3.6.4.12#SIP05AEEC61C40E23D7"/>
<rdfs:comment>DNA helicases utilize the energy from ATP hydrolysis to unwind double-stranded DNA.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Some of them unwind duplex DNA with a 3' to 5' polarity, other show 5' to 3' polarity or unwind DNA in both directions.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Some helicases unwind DNA as well as RNA.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>May be identical with EC 3.6.4.13.</rdfs:comment>
