<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<replaces rdf:resource="3.6.1.47"/>
<skos:prefLabel>small monomeric GTPase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="3.6.5.2#SIP43FF428D8047AFDF"/>
<rdfs:comment>A family of about 50 enzymes with a molecular mass of 21 kDa that are distantly related to the alpha-subunit of EC 3.6.1.46.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Involved in cell-growth regulation (Ras subfamily), membrane vesicle traffic and uncoating (Rab and ARF subfamilies), nuclear protein import (Ran subfamily) and organization of the cytoskeleton (Rho and Rac subfamilies).</rdfs:comment>
