<skos:prefLabel>2,4-diacetylphloroglucinol hydrolase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="3.7.1.24#SIPA401D0DEAA439551"/>
<rdfs:comment>Requires Zn(2+).</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Isolated from the bacteria Pseudomonas fluorescens, Pseudomonas sp. YGJ3 and Mycobacterium abscessus 103.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It reduces the antibiotic activity of 2,4-diacetylphloroglucinol.</rdfs:comment>
