<rdf:Description rdf:about="3.9.1.2">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>protein arginine phosphatase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="3.9.1.2#SIPDAF2F74A1E2EBF5F"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, characterized from Gram-positive bacteria, hydrolyzes the phosphoramidate (P-N) bond of N(omega)-phospho-L-arginine residues in proteins and peptides that were phosphorylated by EC 2.7.14.1.</rdfs:comment>
