<rdf:Description rdf:about="3.13.1.9">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>S-inosyl-L-homocysteine hydrolase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="3.13.1.9#SIPC073C8623C8820D5"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, characterized from the methanogenic archaeon Methanocaldococcus jannaschii, binds an NAD(+) cofactor.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It participates in an alternative pathway for the regeneration of S-adenosyl-L-methionine from S-adenosyl-L-homocysteine that involves the deamination of the latter to S-inosyl-L-homocysteine.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/25917907"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="3.13.1.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="3.13.1.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="3.13.1.9#SIPC073C8623C8820D5">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>H2O + S-inosyl-L-homocysteine = inosine + L-homocysteine.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/25917907">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Citation"/>
<skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/pubmed/25917907"/>
