<activity rdf:resource="4.1.1.99#SIPEDD8A1DED5020068"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme participates in a mevalonate pathway that occurs in halophilic archaea.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The activity is also present in eubacteria of the Chloroflexi phylum. cf. EC 4.1.1.33 and EC 4.1.1.110.</rdfs:comment>
