<activity rdf:resource="4.1.1.103#SIPD0BD65DD52096F8C"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, characterized from several bacterial strains, is involved in the degradation of gamma-resorcylate.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The reaction is reversible, but equilibrium greatly favors the decarboxylation reaction.</rdfs:comment>
