</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="4.1.1.122">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>L-cysteate decarboxylase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="4.1.1.122#SIP0FAFF7E7BBF139D0"/>
<rdfs:comment>Requires pyridoxal 5'-phosphate.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, characterized from chicken, is specific for L-cysteate and has poor activity with 3-sulfino-L-alanine. cf. EC 4.1.1.29.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/32601391"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="4.1.1.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="4.1.1.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="4.1.1.122#SIP0FAFF7E7BBF139D0">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>H(+) + L-cysteate = CO2 + taurine.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/32601391">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Citation"/>
<skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/pubmed/32601391"/>
<foaf:primaryTopicOf rdf:resource="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/32601391"/>
<dcterms:identifier>doi:10.1038/s41559-020-1232-4</dcterms:identifier>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="4.1.1.123">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>phenyl-phosphate phosphatase/carboxylase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>phenyl phosphate carboxylase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="4.1.1.123#SIP1A684E2D3D18CF99"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, characterized from the bacterium Thauera aromatica, participates in an anaerobic phenol degradation pathway.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It catalyzes the para dephosphorylation and carboxylation of phenylphosphate to 4-hydroxybenzoate.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme from Thauera aromatica consists of four different subunits and requires K(+) and a divalent metal cation (Mg(2+) or Mn(2+)) for activity.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It is strongly inhibited by oxygen.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/15231788"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="4.1.1.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="4.1.1.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="4.1.1.123#SIP1A684E2D3D18CF99">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>4-hydroxybenzoate + H(+) + phosphate = CO2 + H2O + phenyl phosphate.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/15231788">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Citation"/>
<skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/pubmed/15231788"/>
<foaf:primaryTopicOf rdf:resource="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/15231788"/>
<dcterms:identifier>doi:10.1128/jb.186.14.4556-4567.2004</dcterms:identifier>
</rdf:Description>
