<skos:altLabel>L-threonine acetaldehyde-lyase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="4.1.2.5#SIP1971652FD4007D06"/>
<rdfs:comment>This enzyme is specific for L-threonine and can not utilize L-allo-threonine.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Different from EC 4.1.2.49 and EC 4.1.2.48.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/13449064"/>
