<rdf:Description rdf:about="4.1.2.45">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>trans-o-hydroxybenzylidenepyruvate hydratase-aldolase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>2'-hydroxybenzalpyruvate aldolase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="4.1.2.45#SIPC73A9C09EF010AC3"/>
<rdfs:comment>This enzyme is involved in naphthalene degradation.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme catalyzes a retro-aldol reaction in vitro, and it accepts a broad range of aldehydes and 4-substituted 2-oxobut-3-enoates as substrates.</rdfs:comment>
