<skos:altLabel>L-2-keto-3-deoxyfuconate aldolase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="4.1.2.64#SIP6EE594522CE4E79D"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, characterized from the bacteria Veillonella ratti and Campylobacter jejuni, participates in an L-fucose degradation pathway.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It also has significant activity with 2-dehydro-3-deoxy-D-pentonate (cf. EC 4.1.2.28).</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/31914410"/>
