<rdfs:comment>Other enzymes involved in this pathway are EC 1.17.5.1, EC 1.3.7.1, EC 3.5.2.18, EC 1.1.1.291, EC 5.4.99.4, EC 5.3.3.6 and EC 4.2.1.85.</rdfs:comment>
