<skos:altLabel>enzyme X</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="4.1.3.38#SIPBB8D72C22FDFE030"/>
<rdfs:comment>Forms part of the folate biosynthesis pathway.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Acts on 4-amino-4-deoxychorismate, the product of EC 2.6.1.85, to form p-aminobenzoate.</rdfs:comment>
