<skos:prefLabel>4-hydroxy-2-oxohexanoate aldolase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="4.1.3.43#SIP8CDC094E4BADA4CE"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme from the bacteria Burkholderia xenovorans and Thermus thermophilus also perform the reaction of EC 4.1.3.39.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzymes form a bifunctional complex with EC 1.2.1.89 with a tight channel connecting the two subunits.</rdfs:comment>
