<skos:altLabel>chorismatase/3-hydroxybenzoate synthase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="4.1.3.45#SIP04CB12974D26AB14"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, found in several bacterial species is involved in biosynthesis of secondary products.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme from the bacterium Xanthomonas campestris pv. campestris also has the activity of EC 4.1.3.40.</rdfs:comment>
