<skos:prefLabel>GTP 3',8-cyclase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="4.1.99.22#SIPB646A7AD3A2943A6"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme catalyzes an early step in the biosynthesis of the molybdenum cofactor (MoCo).</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme belongs to the superfamily of radical S-adenosyl-L-methionine (radical SAM) enzymes.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/15180982"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/15317939"/>
