<skos:altLabel>serine sulfhydrase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="4.2.1.22#SIP115C3D7040C724E8"/>
<rdfs:comment>A multifunctional enzyme: catalyzes beta-replacement reaction between L-serine, L-cysteine, cysteine thioethers or some other beta-substituted alpha-L-amino acids and a variety of mercaptans.</rdfs:comment>
