<activity rdf:resource="4.2.1.74#SIPDBCC6BB009AF5901"/>
<rdfs:comment>Acts in the reverse direction.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The best substrate for the porcine enzyme is oct-2-enoyl-CoA.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Unlike EC 4.2.1.17 does not act on crotonoyl-CoA.</rdfs:comment>
