<skos:altLabel>4-carboxy-2-oxohexenedioate hydratase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="4.2.1.83#SIP51899A020E50908A"/>
<rdfs:comment>This enzyme participates in the degradation of protocatechuate (via the meta-cleavage pathway), syringate and gallate, catalyzing the reaction in the opposite direction.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It accepts the enol-form of 4-oxalomesaconate, 2-hydroxy-4-carboxy-hexa-2,4-dienedioate.</rdfs:comment>
