<rdf:Description rdf:about="4.2.1.92">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>hydroperoxide dehydratase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>allene oxide synthase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>AOS</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>hydroperoxide isomerase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="4.2.1.92#SIPAFDFE107BABCA959"/>
<rdfs:comment>Acts on a number of unsaturated fatty-acid hydroperoxides, forming the corresponding allene oxides.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The product of the above reaction is unstable and is acted upon by EC 5.3.99.6 to form the cyclopentenone derivative (15Z)-12-oxophyto-10,15-dienoate (OPDA), which is the first cyclic and biologically active metabolite in the jasmonate biosynthesis pathway.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/3178850"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/4208994"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/8756596"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="4.2.1.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="4.2.1.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="4.2.1.92#SIPAFDFE107BABCA959">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>(13S)-hydroperoxy-(9Z,11E,15Z)-octadecatrienoate = (9Z,13S,15Z)-12,13-epoxyoctadeca-9,11,15-trienoate + H2O.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
