<activity rdf:resource="4.2.1.97#SIP73F71A8C0CAB4641"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme from Fusarium solani, which is distinct from EC 4.2.1.95, hydrates the methylbutenyl side-chain of the isoflavonoid phytoalexin, phaseollidin.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/1521768"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="4.2.1.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="4.2.1.-"/>
