<skos:altLabel>BA7 alpha dehydratase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="4.2.1.106#SIP5F6C55A009E08F88"/>
<rdfs:comment>This enzyme, characterized from the gut bacterium Clostridium scindens (previously known as Eubacterium sp. strain VPI 12708), participates in the 7-dehydroxylation process associated with bile acid degradation.</rdfs:comment>
