<activity rdf:resource="4.2.1.108#SIP029CA2E663F09CFF"/>
<rdfs:comment>Ectoine is an osmoprotectant that is found in halophilic eubacteria.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>This enzyme is part of the ectoine biosynthesis pathway and only acts in the direction of ectoine formation. cf. EC 3.5.4.44.</rdfs:comment>
