<skos:altLabel>AHy</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="4.2.1.112#SIP3DBA4E7ED151B66C"/>
<rdfs:comment>The tungsten center binds a water molecule that is activated by an adjacent aspartate residue, enabling it to attack acetylene bound in a distinct hydrophobic pocket.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Ethylene cannot act as a substrate.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/7592321"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/17360611"/>
