<rdf:Description rdf:about="4.2.1.127">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>linalool dehydratase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="4.2.1.127#SIP960FC3F57803D365"/>
<rdfs:comment>In absence of oxygen the bifunctional linalool dehydratase-isomerase can catalyze in vitro two reactions, the dehydration of linalool to myrcene and the isomerization of geraniol to linalool (the latter activity is classified as EC 5.4.4.4).</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/20663876"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="4.2.1.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="4.2.1.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
