<rdf:Description rdf:about="4.2.1.128">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>lupan-3beta,20-diol synthase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="4.2.1.128#SIPB0E25E7770E87D20"/>
<rdfs:comment>The reaction occurs in the reverse direction.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The recombinant enzyme from Arabidopsis thaliana gives a 1:1 mixture of lupeol and lupan-3beta,20-diol with small amounts of beta-amyrin, germanicol, taraxasterol and psi-taraxasterol.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>See EC 5.4.99.41.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/10930257"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/17107079"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="4.2.1.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="4.2.1.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
