<skos:altLabel>crotonase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="4.2.1.150#SIPAB15CF194CB52040"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme from the bacterium Clostridium acetobutylicum is part of the central fermentation pathway and plays a key role in the production of both acids and solvents.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It is specific for short, C4-C6, chain length substrates and exhibits an extremely high turnover number for crotonyl-CoA. cf. EC 4.2.1.17 and EC 4.2.1.74.</rdfs:comment>
