<activity rdf:resource="4.2.1.155#SIP2D7B8BA5CA7B976E"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme is involved in the degradation of 3-(dimethylsulfonio)propanoate, an osmolyte produced by marine phytoplankton.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Isolated from the bacterium Ruegeria pomeroyi.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/23704947"/>
