<skos:altLabel>L-talarate hydro-lyase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="4.2.1.156#SIPB522FE9C607783B9"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, isolated from the bacteria Salmonella typhimurium and Polaromonas sp. JS666, also has activity with galactarate (cf. EC 4.2.1.42).</rdfs:comment>
