<skos:prefLabel>dTDP-4-dehydro-6-deoxy-alpha-D-glucopyranose 2,3-dehydratase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="4.2.1.159#SIP6E504DBE05FE28A5"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme participates in the biosynthesis of several deoxysugars, including beta-L-4-epi-vancosamine, alpha-L-megosamine, L- and D-olivose, D-oliose, D-mycarose, forosamine and beta-L-digitoxose.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>In vitro the intermediate can undergo a spontaneous decomposition to maltol.</rdfs:comment>
