<skos:prefLabel>2-oxo-hept-4-ene-1,7-dioate hydratase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="4.2.1.163#SIP41C12DC9EE399488"/>
<rdfs:comment>Part of a 4-hydroxyphenylacetate degradation pathway in Escherichia coli C.</rdfs:comment>
