<skos:prefLabel>dTDP-4-dehydro-2,6-dideoxy-D-glucose 3-dehydratase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>TDP-4-keto-2,6-dideoxy-D-glucose 3-dehydrase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="4.2.1.164#SIPEEFBF3B12CD87589"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, isolated from the bacterium Saccharopolyspora spinosa, participates in the biosynthesis of forosamine.</rdfs:comment>
