<rdfs:label>dTDP-4-dehydro-2,6-dideoxy-alpha-D-glucose + 2 H(+) + 2 reduced [2Fe-2S]-[ferredoxin] = dTDP-4-dehydro-2,3,6-trideoxy-alpha-D-hexopyranose + H2O + 2 oxidized [2Fe-2S]-[ferredoxin].</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
