<skos:altLabel>inulobiose hydrolase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="4.2.1.179#SIP971B644A72872243"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, studied in the fungus Aspergillus fumigatus, may participate in an inulin degradation pathway in which it converts the product of EC 4.2.2.17 to inulobiose, though in vitro activity was higher in the direction of DFA-I formation.</rdfs:comment>
