<skos:altLabel>PPase-N</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="4.2.2.2#SIP2C907CFBA0A017F6"/>
<rdfs:comment>Favors pectate, the anion, over pectin, the methyl ester (which is the preferred substrate of EC 4.2.2.10).</rdfs:comment>
