<activity rdf:resource="4.2.2.9#SIP0014C5A8962C9D05"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme catalyzes the eliminative cleavage of an unsaturated disaccharide from the reducing end of homogalacturonan (the backbone of smooth regions of pectate, also known as de-esterified pectin).</rdfs:comment>
