<activity rdf:resource="4.2.2.22#SIP6FB8876971900AB4"/>
<rdfs:comment>Differs in specificity from EC 4.2.2.9 as the predominant action is removal of a trisaccharide rather than a disaccharide from the reducing end.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Disaccharides and tetrasaccharides may also be removed.</rdfs:comment>
