</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="4.2.2.26">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>oligo-alginate lyase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>exo-oligoalginate lyase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>oligoalginate lyase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="4.2.2.26#SIP5FB3A2EEE0D4D07A"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme degrades unsaturated oligosaccharides produced by the action of alginate lyases (EC 4.2.2.3 and EC 4.2.2.11) on alginate, by repeatedly removing the unsaturated residue from the non-reducing end until only unsaturated monosaccharides are left.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme catalyzes a beta-elimination reaction, generating a new unsaturated non-reducing end after removal of the pre-existing one.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/10913091"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/22281843"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/24795372"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/25335746"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="4.2.2.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="4.2.2.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="4.2.2.26#SIP5FB3A2EEE0D4D07A">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>Cleavage of 4-deoxy-alpha-L-erythro-hex-4-enopyranuronoside oligosaccharides into 4-deoxy-alpha-L-erythro-hex-4-enopyranuronate monosaccharides.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/10913091">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Citation"/>
<skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/pubmed/10913091"/>
<foaf:primaryTopicOf rdf:resource="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/10913091"/>
</rdf:Description>
