<replaces rdf:resource="4.6.1.5"/>
<skos:prefLabel>pentalenene synthase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>pentalenene synthetase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="4.2.3.7#SIPBB221F7E7F63AAE0"/>
<rdfs:comment>Isolated from Streptomyces avermitilis.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme is involved in the biosynthesis of pentalenolactone and related antibiotics.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The 9si hydrogen of farnesyl diphosphate undergoes a 1,2-hydride shift where it becomes the 1alpha hydrogen of pentalenene.</rdfs:comment>
