<skos:altLabel>germacrene A synthase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="4.2.3.23#SIPA2E7B9DC041821FA"/>
<rdfs:comment>While germacrene A is an enzyme-bound intermediate in the biosynthesis of a number of phytoalexins, e.g. EC 4.2.3.9 from some species and EC 4.2.3.21, it is the sole sesquiterpenoid product formed in chicory.</rdfs:comment>
