<skos:altLabel>LIS</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="4.2.3.25#SIPF5B8BD5E5FE7F16A"/>
<rdfs:comment>Neither (S)- nor (R)-linalyl diphosphate can act as substrate for the enzyme from Clarkia breweri.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Unlike many other monoterpene synthases, only a single product, (3S)-linalool, is formed.</rdfs:comment>
