<rdf:Description rdf:about="4.2.3.26">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>R-linalool synthase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>(-)-3R-linalool synthase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>(3R)-linalool synthase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="4.2.3.26#SIPD700A2083A9EC258"/>
<rdfs:comment>Geranyl diphosphate cannot be replaced by isopentenyl diphosphate, prenyl diphosphate, farnesyl diphosphate or geranylgeranyl diphosphate as substrate.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Unlike many other monoterpene synthases, only a single product, (3R)-linalool, is formed.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/10562427"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/12176064"/>
