<skos:prefLabel>isoprene synthase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>ISPC</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>ISPS</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="4.2.3.27#SIP006FED55D73638EB"/>
<rdfs:comment>Located in the chloroplast of isoprene-emitting plants, such as poplar and aspen, and may be activitated by light-dependent changes in chloroplast pH and Mg(2+) concentration.</rdfs:comment>
