</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="4.2.3.30">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>ent-pimara-8(14),15-diene synthase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="4.2.3.30#SIP60ED696A31B5C3DC"/>
<rdfs:comment>Unlike EC 4.2.3.29 which can produce both ent-sandaracopimaradiene and ent-pimara-8(14),15-diene, this diterpene cyclase produces only ent-pimara-8(14),15-diene.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Ent-pimara-8(14),15-diene is not a precursor in the biosynthesis of either gibberellins or phytoalexins.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/16861806"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="4.2.3.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="4.2.3.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="4.2.3.30#SIP60ED696A31B5C3DC">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>ent-copalyl diphosphate = diphosphate + ent-pimara-8(14),15-diene.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/16861806">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Citation"/>
