<rdf:Description rdf:about="4.2.3.48">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>(3S,6E)-nerolidol synthase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>(3S)-(E)-nerolidol synthase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>(E)-nerolidol synthase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>nerolidol synthase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="4.2.3.48#SIP5B317FEDFC208A80"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme catalyzes a step in the formation of 4,8-dimethyl-1,3(E),7-nonatriene, a key signal molecule in induced plant defense mediated by the attraction of enemies of herbivores.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Nerolidol is a naturally occurring sesquiterpene found in the essential oils of many types of plants.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/10482672"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/10805454"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/15522848"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/17924138"/>
