<activity rdf:resource="4.2.3.74#SIPD7034C1D3D94FE29"/>
<rdfs:comment>Presilphiperfolan-8beta-ol is the precursor of botrydial, a phytotoxic sesquiterpene metabolite secreted by the fungus Botryotinia fuckeliana (Botrytis cinerea), the causal agent of gray mold disease in plants.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/19035644"/>
