<activity rdf:resource="4.2.3.80#SIP674BE4AC9F5A3AC5"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme from Norway spruce produces longifolene as the main product (cf. EC 4.2.3.58).</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>alpha-longipinene constitutes about 15% of the total products.</rdfs:comment>
