<rdf:Description rdf:about="4.2.3.82">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>alpha-santalene synthase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="4.2.3.82#SIP0ABBB90C0E0462F0"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme synthesizes a mixture of sesquiterpenoids from (2E,6E)-farnesyl diphosphate.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>As well as (+)-alpha-santalene, (-)-beta-santalene and (-)-exo-alpha-bergamotene are formed with traces of (+)-epi-beta-santalene.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>See EC 4.2.3.81 and EC 4.2.3.83. cf. EC 4.2.3.50.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/21454632"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="4.2.3.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="4.2.3.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
