<activity rdf:resource="4.2.3.83#SIPE1640A750ABAAAF4"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme synthesizes a mixture of sesquiterpenoids from (2E,6E)-farnesyl diphosphate.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>As well as (-)-beta-santalene (+)-alpha-santalene and (-)-exo-alpha-bergamotene are formed with traces of (+)-epi-beta-santalene.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>See EC 4.2.3.82 and EC 4.2.3.81.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/21454632"/>
