<skos:prefLabel>10-epi-gamma-eudesmol synthase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="4.2.3.84#SIP5DCE6A55030B0817"/>
<rdfs:comment>The recombinant enzyme from ginger (Zingiber zerumbet) gives 62.6% beta-eudesmol, 16.8% 10-epi-gamma-eudesmol, 10% alpha-eudesmol, and 5.6% aristolene. cf. EC 4.2.3.68 and EC 4.2.3.85.</rdfs:comment>
