<skos:altLabel>beta-ocimene synthase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="4.2.3.106#SIP3D63269B6E892CDB"/>
<rdfs:comment>Widely distributed in plants, which release beta-ocimene when attacked by herbivorous insects.</rdfs:comment>
