<rdf:Description rdf:about="4.2.3.127">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>beta-copaene synthase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>Cop4</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="4.2.3.127#SIP0DB7D07EDD5951B7"/>
<rdfs:comment>Isolated from the fungus Coprinus cinereus.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme also forms (+)-delta-cadinene, beta-cubebene, (+)-sativene and traces of several other sequiterpenoids.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>beta-copaene is formed in the presence of Mg(2+) but not Mn(2+).</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>See EC 4.2.3.13 EC 4.2.3.128 and EC 4.2.3.129.</rdfs:comment>
