<skos:prefLabel>beta-cubebene synthase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="4.2.3.128#SIP23C491DA16F2D6FA"/>
<rdfs:comment>Isolated from the fungus Coprinus cinereus.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme also forms (+)-delta-cadinene, beta-copaene, (+)-sativene and traces of several other sequiterpenoids.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It is found in many higher plants such as Magnolia grandiflora (Southern Magnolia) together with germacrene A.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>See EC 4.2.3.13 EC 4.2.3.127 EC 4.2.3.129 and EC 4.2.3.23.</rdfs:comment>
