<rdf:Description rdf:about="4.2.3.144">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>geranyllinalool synthase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="4.2.3.144#SIP4CB5290CC8833BF6"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme is a component of the herbivore-induced indirect defense system.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The product, (E,E)-geranyllinalool, is a precursor to the volatile compound 4,8,12-trimethyl-1,3,7,11-tridecatetraene (TMTT), which is released by many plants in response to damage.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/18398052"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/18842097"/>
