<rdf:Description rdf:about="4.2.3.160">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>(2S,3R,6S,9S)-(-)-protoillud-7-ene synthase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="4.2.3.160#SIP9DC11D48D3577A73"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme has been described from the slime-mold Dictyostelium discoideum.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It is specific for (2E,6E)-farnesyl diphosphate.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>While the major product is the sequiterpene (2S,3R,6S,9S)-(-)-protoillud-7-ene, traces of pentalenene are also formed.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/27790999"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/27862766"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="4.2.3.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="4.2.3.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
