<activity rdf:resource="4.2.3.161#SIPE1F36E746C40707F"/>
<rdfs:comment>The sequiterpene (3S)-(+)-asterisca-2(9),6-diene has been shown to be synthezised in the slime-mold Dictyostelium discoideum.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme is specific for (2E,6E)-farnesyl diphosphate.</rdfs:comment>
