<skos:prefLabel>(-)-alpha-amorphene synthase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="4.2.3.162#SIPC2911FF774578E25"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, found in the bacterium Streptomyces viridochromogenes, is specific for (2E,6E)-farnesyl diphosphate and produces only (-)-alpha-amorphene.</rdfs:comment>
