<rdfs:comment>The enzyme does not act on farnesol or drimenol diphosphate.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Using 18-oxygen labeled water 18-oxygen was incorporated suggesting involvement of a stabilized carbocation or an equivalent species.</rdfs:comment>
