<rdfs:comment>The product is a semivolatile diterpene that acts as a local antifeedant in belowground direct defense against root-feeding insects.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/23512856"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="4.2.3.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="4.2.3.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
