<activity rdf:resource="4.2.3.198#SIPFC8EF5F8914895AF"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme from the plant Ocimum basilicum (sweet basil) also produces beta-selinene while that from Liquidambar formosana (Formosan sweet gum) also produces traces of aromadendrene.</rdfs:comment>
