<skos:prefLabel>hydropyrene synthase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="4.2.3.201#SIP4644EA5BB7AB25C3"/>
<rdfs:comment>Isolated from the bacterium Streptomyces clavuligerus.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The 1-proR hydrogen atom of geranylgeranyl diphosphate is lost in the reaction.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme also produces hydropyrenol, isoelisabethatriene and traces of other diterpenoids. cf. EC 4.2.3.202 and EC 4.2.3.203.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/28696553"/>
