<rdfs:comment>The 1-proR hydrogen atom of geranylgeranyl diphosphate is lost in the reaction.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme also produces hydropyrene, isoelisabethatriene and traces of other diterpenoids. cf. EC 4.2.3.201 and EC 4.2.3.203.</rdfs:comment>
