<skos:prefLabel>isoelisabethatriene synthase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="4.2.3.203#SIP9EF916DC99902CEB"/>
<rdfs:comment>Isolated from the bacterium Streptomyces clavuligerus.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The 1-proR hydrogen atom of geranylgeranyl diphosphate is involved in a 1,3-hydride shift to the side-chain.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme also produces hydropyrene, hydropyrenol, and traces of other diterpenoids. cf. EC 4.2.3.201 and EC 4.2.3.202.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/28696553"/>
