<activity rdf:resource="4.3.1.3#SIPFF3DD7C0650B88FD"/>
<rdfs:comment>Member of the aromatic amino acid lyase family, other members of which are EC 4.3.1.23, EC 4.3.1.24 and EC 4.3.1.25.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Catalyzes the first step in the degradation of histidine and the product, urocanic acid, is further metabolized to glutamate.</rdfs:comment>
