<skos:prefLabel>ornithine cyclodeaminase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>OCD</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>ornithine cyclase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>ornithine cyclase (deaminating)</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="4.3.1.12#SIP55575CD04B6C90A7"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme is a member of the mu-crystallin protein family.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The reaction is stimulated by the presence of ADP or ATP and is inhibited by O2.</rdfs:comment>
