<skos:altLabel>DOPA-reductive deaminase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>reductive deaminase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="4.3.1.22#SIP790F778D2F5ED8F1"/>
<rdfs:comment>Forms part of the L-phenylalanine-catabolism pathway in the anoxygenic phototrophic bacterium Rhodobacter sphaeroides OU5.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>NADPH is oxidized more slowly than NADH.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/17616348"/>
