<skos:altLabel>tyrase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="4.3.1.23#SIPB63B588AC8C0C973"/>
<rdfs:comment>Member of the aromatic amino acid lyase family, other members of which are EC 4.3.1.3, EC 4.3.1.24 and EC 4.3.1.25.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Far more active with tyrosine than with phenylalanine as substrate, but the substrate specificity can be switched by mutation of a single amino acid (H89F) in the enzyme from the bacterium Rhodobacter sphaeroides.</rdfs:comment>
