<rdf:Description rdf:about="4.3.3.2">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>strictosidine synthase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>STR</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>strictosidine synthetase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="4.3.3.2#SIP1E5557DC148E9221"/>
<rdfs:comment>Catalyzes a a Pictet-Spengler reaction between the aldehyde group of secologanin and the amino group of tryptamine.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Involved in the biosynthesis of the monoterpenoid indole alkaloids.</rdfs:comment>
