<activity rdf:resource="4.3.3.4#SIPD0BD9F1A3382BCE9"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme from the leaves of Alangium lamarckii differs in enantiomeric specificity from EC 4.3.3.3.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The product is rapidly converted to demethylalangiside.</rdfs:comment>
