<rdf:Description rdf:about="4.3.99.3">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>7-carboxy-7-deazaguanine synthase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>7-carboxy-7-carbaguanine synthase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="4.3.99.3#SIP8FC3BD67A34878AB"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme is a member of the superfamily of S-adenosyl-L-methionine-dependent radical (radical AdoMet) enzymes.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Binds a [4Fe-4S] cluster that is coordinated by 3 cysteines and an exchangeable S-adenosyl-L-methionine molecule.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The S-adenosyl-L-methionine is catalytic as it is regenerated at the end of the reaction.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The reaction is part of the biosynthesis pathway of queuosine.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/19354300"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="4.3.99.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="4.3.99.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="4.3.99.3#SIP8FC3BD67A34878AB">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>6-carboxy-5,6,7,8-tetrahydropterin + H(+) = 7-carboxy-7-deazaguanine + NH4(+).</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
