<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, found in cyanobacteria and red algae, catalyzes the attachment of the phycobilin chromophore phycocyanobilin to cysteine 155 of the beta subunits of the phycobiliproteins C-phycocyanin and phycoerythrocyanin.</rdfs:comment>
