<skos:prefLabel>Bacillus subtilis ribonuclease</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>bacterial RNA lyase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="4.6.1.22#SIPA3E2BEBE7409C99F"/>
<rdfs:comment>This enzyme catalyzes endonucleolytic cleavage to 2',3'-cyclic nucleotides.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The cyclic products may be hydrolyzed to the corresponding 3'-phosphates by EC 3.1.4.16.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme from Bacillus subtilis is inhibited by ATP.</rdfs:comment>
