<activity rdf:resource="5.1.3.21#SIP9D27B22034932D2C"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme catalyzes the interconversion of alpha and beta anomers of maltose more effectively than those of disaccharides such as lactose and cellobiose.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/7796915"/>
