<activity rdf:resource="5.1.3.35#SIPC4759625DE14BD56"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, isolated from the bacterium Actinoplanes sp. SE 50/110, is involved in the biosynthesis of the alpha-glucosidase inhibitor acarbose.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/12681481"/>
