<rdf:Description rdf:about="5.1.3.36">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>heparosan-glucuronate 5-epimerase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="5.1.3.36#SIPE09D5452A43501EF"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, characterized from the giant African snail Achatina fulica, participates in the biosynthetic pathway of acharan sulfate.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Unlike EC 5.1.3.17, it shows no activity with D-glucuronate residues in heparosan-N-sulfate.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/25677302"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="5.1.3.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="5.1.3.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
