<skos:prefLabel>D-sedoheptulose-7-phosphate isomerase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>phosphoheptose isomerase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>sedoheptulose-7-phosphate isomerase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="5.3.1.28#SIP9B70098BB88A9F26"/>
<rdfs:comment>In Gram-negative bacteria the enzyme is involved in biosynthesis of ADP-L-glycero-beta-D-manno-heptose, which is utilized for assembly of the lipopolysaccharide inner core.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>In Gram-positive bacteria the enzyme is involved in biosynthesis of GDP-D-glycero-alpha-D-manno-heptose, which is required for assembly of S-layer glycoprotein.</rdfs:comment>
