<rdfs:comment>Four moieties of alpha-D-rhamnose and two moities of 3-acetamido-3,6-dideoxy-alpha-D-galactose form the repeating unit of the glycan chain in the S-layer of the bacterium Aneurinibacillus thermoaerophilus.</rdfs:comment>
