<activity rdf:resource="5.3.2.8#SIPA37A6449B6935CF0"/>
<rdfs:comment>This enzyme has been characterized from the bacterium Pseudomonas putida KT2440 and is involved in the degradation pathway of syringate and gallate.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It catalyzes the interconversion of two of the tautomers of 4-oxalomesaconate, a reaction that can also occur spontaneously.</rdfs:comment>
