<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>trans-2,3-dihydro-3-hydroxyanthranilate isomerase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="5.3.3.17#SIPC6705A65116F52A1"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme is involved in phenazine biosynthesis.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The product probably spontaneously dimerises to 1,4,5a,6,9,10a-hexahydrophenazine-1,6-dicarboxylate.</rdfs:comment>
