<activity rdf:resource="5.4.1.3#SIP6326B93CF7F3721F"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, purified from the bacterium Chloroflexus aurantiacus, acts as an intramolecular CoA transferase and does not transfer CoA to free mesaconate.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It is part of the 3-hydroxypropanoate cycle for carbon assimilation.</rdfs:comment>
