<rdf:Description rdf:about="5.4.4.6">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<replaces rdf:resource="1.13.11.44"/>
<skos:prefLabel>9,12-octadecadienoate 8-hydroperoxide 8S-isomerase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>(8R,9Z,12Z)-8-hydroperoxy-9,12-octadecadienoate mutase ((7S,8S,9Z,12Z)-5,8-dihydroxy-9,12-octadecadienoate-forming)</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="5.4.4.6#SIP51AD965F2B95B79C"/>
<rdfs:comment>The bifunctional enzyme from Gaeumannomyces graminis catalyzes the oxidation of linoleic acid to (8R,9Z,12Z)-8-hydroperoxyoctadeca-9,12-dienoate (cf. EC 1.13.11.60), which is then isomerized to (7S,8S,9Z,12Z)-5,8-dihydroxyoctadeca-9,12-dienoate.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/8117115"/>
