<activity rdf:resource="5.4.4.8#SIP2CFC2F39F5C5F6CC"/>
<rdfs:comment>Isolated from the bacterium Thauera linaloolentis grown on (RS)-linalool as the sole source of carbon.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Unlike EC 5.4.4.4, which only acts on (S)-linalool, this enzyme acts equally well on both enantiomers.</rdfs:comment>
