<skos:altLabel>tRNA pseudouridylate synthase I</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="5.4.99.12#SIP5089B1B1A1E8DE44"/>
<rdfs:comment>The uridylate residues at positions 38, 39 and 40 of nearly all tRNAs are isomerized to pseudouridine.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>TruA specifically modifies uridines at positions 38, 39, and/or 40 in the anticodon stem loop of tRNAs with highly divergent sequences and structures.</rdfs:comment>
