<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>pre-alpha-onocerin synthase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="5.4.99.65#SIPB1012486D6B977E1"/>
<rdfs:comment>Isolated from the plant Lycopodium clavatum.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme does not act on (3S)-2,3-epoxy-2,3-dihydrosqualene and does not form any alpha-onocerin.</rdfs:comment>
