<skos:prefLabel>ent-copalyl diphosphate synthase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>ent-CDP synthase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>ent-kaurene synthase A</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>ent-kaurene synthetase A</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="5.5.1.13#SIP219507FD74BA3A59"/>
<rdfs:comment>Part of a bifunctional enzyme involved in the biosynthesis of kaurene.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>See also EC 4.2.3.19.</rdfs:comment>
