<rdf:Description rdf:about="5.5.1.16">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>halimadienyl-diphosphate synthase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>tuberculosinol diphosphate synthase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="5.5.1.16#SIP43E03B6A22E3E70B"/>
<rdfs:comment>Found in pathogenic prokaryotes such as Mycobacterium tuberculosis but not in non-pathogens such as Mycobacterium smegmatis so may play a role in pathogenicity.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The product of the reaction is subsequently dephosphorylated yielding tuberculosinol (halima-5,13-dien-15-ol).</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/15719101"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="5.5.1.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="5.5.1.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
