<activity rdf:resource="5.5.1.19#SIP6083717AB85182AC"/>
<activity rdf:resource="5.5.1.19#SIP5EC60CD45BB1F47E"/>
<activity rdf:resource="5.5.1.19#SIPB5A5938924BECAD2"/>
<rdfs:comment>Lycopene has a psi-end group at both ends.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>When acting on one end, this enzyme forms gamma-carotene.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>When acting on both ends it forms beta-carotene.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It also acts on neurosporene to give beta-zeacarotene.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/7550379"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/7919981"/>
