<rdf:Description rdf:about="5.5.1.20">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>prosolanapyrone-III cycloisomerase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>prosolanapyrone II oxidase/prosolanapyrone III cyclosiomerase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="5.5.1.20#SIPA02AFA66391FC5D0"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme is involved in the biosynthesis of the phytotoxin solanapyrone in some fungi.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The bifunctional enzyme catalyzes the oxidation of prosolanapyrone II and the subsequent Diels Alder cycloisomerization of the product prosolanapyrone III to (-)-solanapyrone A (cf. EC 1.1.3.42).</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/9659400"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/18256508"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/20486243"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="5.5.1.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="5.5.1.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
