<skos:altLabel>tobramycin carbamoyltransferase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="6.1.2.2#SIPB39E5A01670CF944"/>
<activity rdf:resource="6.1.2.2#SIPBA15849946DFAD42"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme from the bacterium Streptoalloteichus tenebrarius catalyzes the activation of carbamoyl phosphate to O-carbamoyladenylate and the subsequent carbamoylation of kanamycin and tobramycin.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/22383337"/>
