<activity rdf:resource="6.1.3.1#SIPFDBC803AF86F26AB"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, found in certain bacterial species, participates in a pathway for the production of olefins.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It forms a beta-lactone.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The alkyl group at C(2) of the substrate ends up as the 3-alkyl group of the product.</rdfs:comment>
