<skos:altLabel>3-hydroxybenzoyl-CoA synthetase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="6.2.1.37#SIPCC7D78DC48891DB6"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme works equally well with 4-hydroxybenzoate but shows low activity toward benzoate, 4-aminobenzoate, 3-aminobenzoate, 3-fluorobenzoate, 4-fluorobenzoate, 3-chlorobenzoate, and 4-chlorobenzoate.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>There is no activity with 3,4-dihydroxybenzoate, 2,3-dihydroxybenzoate, and 2-hydroxybenzoate as substrates.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/11208796"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="6.2.1.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="6.2.1.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
