<skos:prefLabel>[butirosin acyl-carrier protein]--L-glutamate ligase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>[BtrI acyl-carrier protein]--L-glutamate ligase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="6.2.1.39#SIPAC6D49389627C8A8"/>
<activity rdf:resource="6.2.1.39#SIPFF1282C51BA90EC4"/>
<rdfs:comment>Catalyzes two steps in the biosynthesis of the side chain of the aminoglycoside antibiotics of the butirosin family.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme adds one molecule of L-glutamate to a dedicated acyl-carrier protein, and following decarboxylation of the product by EC 4.1.1.95, adds a second L-glutamate molecule.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/15975512"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="6.2.1.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="6.2.1.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="6.2.1.39#SIPAC6D49389627C8A8">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>ATP + holo-[BtrI ACP] + L-glutamate = ADP + gamma-L-glutamyl-[BtrI ACP] + phosphate.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="6.2.1.39#SIPFF1282C51BA90EC4">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>4-aminobutanoyl-[BtrI ACP] + ATP + L-glutamate = 4-(gamma-L-glutamylamino)butanoy-[BtrI ACP] + ADP + H(+) + phosphate.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
