<rdf:Description rdf:about="6.2.1.54">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>D-alanine--[D-alanyl-carrier protein] ligase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="6.2.1.54#SIPDB72E62A16B513C6"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme is involved in the modification of wall teichoic acids, as well as type I and IV lipoteichoic acids, with D-alanine residues.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It activates D-alanine using ATP to form a high-energy (D-alanyl)adenylate intermediate and subsequently transfers the alanyl moiety to the phosphopantheinyl tightly-bound cofactor of a D-alanyl-carrier protein (DltC).</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/7797557"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/18784082"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/18847223"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/19324056"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="6.2.1.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="6.2.1.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
