<rdf:Description rdf:about="6.2.1.56">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>4-hydroxybutyrate--CoA ligase (ADP-forming)</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="6.2.1.56#SIPC79F32F5B09AF645"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, characterized from the marine ammonia-oxidizing archaeon Nitrosopumilus maritimus, participates in a variant of the 3-hydroxypropanoate/4-hydroxybutanate CO2 fixation cycle. cf. EC 6.2.1.40.</rdfs:comment>
