<skos:prefLabel>isophthalate--CoA ligase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>IPCL</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="6.2.1.58#SIP6B40701BFFF8ABF6"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, characterized from the bacterium Syntrophorhabdus aromaticivorans, catalyzes the first step in an anaerobic isophthalate degradation pathway.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/30647456"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="6.2.1.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="6.2.1.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="6.2.1.58#SIP6B40701BFFF8ABF6">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>ATP + CoA + isophthalate = AMP + diphosphate + isophthalyl-CoA.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/30647456">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Citation"/>
<skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/pubmed/30647456"/>
<foaf:primaryTopicOf rdf:resource="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/30647456"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="6.2.1.59">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>long-chain fatty acid adenylase/transferase FadD26</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>FadD26</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="6.2.1.59#SIPF1AAEB6DD774048B"/>
<activity rdf:resource="6.2.1.59#SIP5653EA4F3C63B37F"/>
<activity rdf:resource="6.2.1.59#SIPBEE51BCFDBF55E23"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, present in pathogenic species of mycobacteria, participates in the pathway for biosynthesis of phthiocerols.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It catalyzes the adenylation of the long-chain fatty acids arachidate (C20) or behenate (C22) and potentially the very-long-chain fatty acid lignocerate (C24).</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The activated fatty acids are then loaded to EC 2.3.1.292.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/9201977"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/20553505"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/25561717"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="6.2.1.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="6.2.1.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="6.2.1.59#SIPF1AAEB6DD774048B">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>a long-chain fatty acid + ATP + holo-[(phenol)carboxyphthiodiolenone synthase] = a long-chain fatty acyl-[(phenol)carboxyphthiodiolenone synthase] + AMP + diphosphate.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="6.2.1.59#SIP5653EA4F3C63B37F">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>ATP + eicosanoate + holo-[(phenol)carboxyphthiodiolenone synthase] = AMP + diphosphate + icosanoyl-[(phenol)carboxyphthiodiolenone synthase].</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="6.2.1.59#SIPBEE51BCFDBF55E23">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>ATP + docosanoate + holo-[(phenol)carboxyphthiodiolenone synthase] = AMP + diphosphate + docosanoyl-[(phenol)carboxyphthiodiolenone synthase].</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
