<activity rdf:resource="6.2.1.68#SIP10EACA439141A970"/>
<rdfs:comment>The adenylation domain of the enzyme catalyzes the activation of L-glutamate to (L-glutamyl)adenylate, followed by the transfer of the activated compound to the free thiol of a phosphopantetheine arm of a peptidyl-carrier protein domain.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The peptidyl-carrier protein domain may be part of the same protein, or of a different protein.</rdfs:comment>
