<rdfs:label>3-amino-5-hydroxybenzoate + ATP + holo-[aryl-carrier protein] = 3-amino-5-hydroxybenzoyl-[aryl-carrier protein] + AMP + diphosphate.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
