<skos:altLabel>8-demethylnovobiocic acid synthetase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>novobiocin ligase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="6.3.1.15#SIP500DC7BCF8548102"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme is involved in the biosynthesis of the aminocoumarin antibiotic novobiocin.</rdfs:comment>
