<rdfs:label>ATP + C-terminal L-alpha-aminoacyl-L-glutamyl-L-glutamyl-[tubulin] + L-tyrosine = ADP + C-terminal L-alpha-aminoacyl-L-glutamyl-L-glutamyl-L-tyrosyl-[tubulin] + H(+) + phosphate.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
