<rdf:Description rdf:about="6.3.2.33">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>tetrahydrosarcinapterin synthase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="6.3.2.33#SIPA53AEE197EAFA24A"/>
<rdfs:comment>This enzyme catalyzes the biosynthesis of 5,6,7,8-tetrahydrosarcinapterin, a modified form of tetrahydromethanopterin found in the Methanosarcinales.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>It does not require K(+), and does not discriminate between ATP and GTP.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/12909715"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="6.3.2.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="6.3.2.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="6.3.2.33#SIPA53AEE197EAFA24A">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>5,6,7,8-tetrahydromethanopterin + ATP + L-glutamate = 5,6,7,8-tetrahydrosarcinapterin + ADP + H(+) + phosphate.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/12909715">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Citation"/>
<skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/pubmed/12909715"/>
<foaf:primaryTopicOf rdf:resource="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/12909715"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="6.3.2.34">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>coenzyme F420-1:gamma-L-glutamate ligase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="6.3.2.34#SIP7D688A5E98ECCC03"/>
<rdfs:comment>This protein catalyzes the successive addition of two glutamate residues to factor F420 (coenzyme F420) by two distinct and independent reactions.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>In the first reaction (EC 6.3.2.31) the enzyme attaches a glutamate via its alpha-amine group to F420-0.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>In the second reaction, which is described here, the enzyme catalyzes the addition of a second L-glutamate residue to the gamma-carboxyl of the first glutamate.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/12911320"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/17669425"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="6.3.2.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="6.3.2.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="6.3.2.34#SIP7D688A5E98ECCC03">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>GTP + L-glutamate + oxidized coenzyme F420-1 = GDP + H(+) + oxidized coenzyme F420-2 + phosphate.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/12911320">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Citation"/>
<skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/pubmed/12911320"/>
<foaf:primaryTopicOf rdf:resource="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/12911320"/>
<dcterms:identifier>doi:10.1021/bi034779b</dcterms:identifier>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/17669425">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Citation"/>
<skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/pubmed/17669425"/>
<foaf:primaryTopicOf rdf:resource="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/17669425"/>
<dcterms:identifier>doi:10.1016/j.jmb.2007.06.063</dcterms:identifier>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="6.3.2.35">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>D-alanine--D-serine ligase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="6.3.2.35#SIPB13338F61690EF24"/>
<rdfs:comment>The product of this enzyme, D-alanyl-D-serine, can be incorporated into the peptidoglycan pentapeptide instead of the usual D-alanyl-D-alanine dipeptide, which is formed by EC 6.3.2.4, D-alanine--D-alanine ligase.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The resulting peptidoglycan does not bind the glycopeptide antibiotics vancomycin and teicoplanin, conferring resistance on the bacteria.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/1551598"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/9294159"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/10471558"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/14617152"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/19216682"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="6.3.2.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="6.3.2.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="6.3.2.35#SIPB13338F61690EF24">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Catalytic_Activity"/>
<rdfs:label>ATP + D-alanine + D-serine = ADP + D-alanyl-D-serine + H(+) + phosphate.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
