<rdfs:label>2 ATP + 2 L-glutamate + N-acetyl-L-aspartate = 2 ADP + 2 H(+) + N-acetyl-L-aspartyl-L-glutamyl-L-glutamate + 2 phosphate.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
