<rdfs:label>[amino-group carrier protein]-C-terminal-L-glutamate + ATP + L-2-aminoadipate = [amino-group carrier protein]-C-terminal-N-(1,4-dicarboxybutan-1-yl)-L-glutamine + ADP + H(+) + phosphate.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
