<rdfs:label>2-[(L-alanin-3-ylcarbamoyl)methyl]-3-(2-aminoethylcarbamoyl)-2-hydroxypropanoate + 2-oxoglutarate + ATP = AMP + diphosphate + H(+) + staphyloferrin B.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
