<skos:prefLabel>glutamate--[amino group carrier protein] ligase</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="6.3.2.60#SIP5C074023635F083A"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, originally characterized from the archaeon Sulfolobus acidocaldarius, is involved in L-arginine biosynthesis.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme from the archaeon Thermococcus kodakarensis is bifunctional and also catalyzes the activity of EC 6.3.2.43.</rdfs:comment>
