<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>5-(carboxyamino)imidazole ribonucleotide synthase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>N(5)-CAIR synthetase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>N(5)-carboxyaminoimidazole ribonucleotide synthetase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="6.3.4.18#SIPFAA15F833A31D0BC"/>
<rdfs:comment>In Escherichia coli, this enzyme, along with EC 5.4.99.18, is required to carry out the single reaction catalyzed by EC 4.1.1.21 in vertebrates.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Carboxyphosphate is the putative acyl phosphate intermediate.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Involved in the late stages of purine biosynthesis.</rdfs:comment>
