<rdfs:label>5-amino-1-(5-phospho-beta-D-ribosyl)imidazole + ATP + hydrogencarbonate = 5-carboxyamino-1-(5-phospho-D-ribosyl)imidazole + ADP + 2 H(+) + phosphate.</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
