<rdf:Description rdf:about="6.3.4.19">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>tRNA(Ile)-lysidine synthetase</skos:prefLabel>
<skos:altLabel>isoleucine-specific transfer ribonucleate lysidine synthetase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="6.3.4.19#SIP8D24451F8EA8AE71"/>
<rdfs:comment>The bacterial enzyme modifies the wobble base of the CAU anticodon of tRNA(Ile) at the oxo group in position 2 of cytidine(34).</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>This modification determines both codon and amino acid specificities of tRNA(Ile).</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/14527414"/>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/15894617"/>
