<skos:altLabel>aa3-type quinol oxidase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>cytochrome aa3</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>cytochrome aa3-type oxidase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>terminal quinol oxidase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="7.1.1.4#SIPCF215CF0EB0920EF"/>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme from thermophilic archaea is part of the terminal oxidase and catalyzes the reduction of O2 to water, accompanied by the extrusion of protons across the cytoplasmic membrane.</rdfs:comment>
