<rdfs:label>a plastoquinone + 6 H(+)(in) + 2 reduced [2Fe-2S]-[ferredoxin] = a plastoquinol + 4 H(+)(out) + 2 oxidized [2Fe-2S]-[ferredoxin].</rdfs:label>
</rdf:Description>
