<activity rdf:resource="7.2.2.1#SIP22E72BF977741591"/>
<rdfs:comment>A multisubunit ATPase transporter found in some halophilic or alkalophilic bacteria that functions in maintaining sodium homeostasis.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme is similar to EC 7.1.2.2 but pumps Na(+) rather than H(+). cf. EC 7.2.2.3 and EC 7.2.2.4.</rdfs:comment>
