<activity rdf:resource="7.2.2.3#SIP0E3D44FD582C48C8"/>
<rdfs:comment>A P-type ATPase that undergoes covalent phosphorylation during the transport cycle.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>This enzyme from yeast is involved in the efflux of Na(+), with one ion being exported per ATP hydrolyzed.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Some forms can also export Li(+) ions. cf. EC 7.2.2.1 and EC 7.2.2.4.</rdfs:comment>
