<activity rdf:resource="7.2.2.9#SIPAD271DCBF7A9196F"/>
<rdfs:comment>A P-type ATPase that undergoes covalent phosphorylation during the transport cycle.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme from the termophilic bacterium Archaeoglobus fulgidus is involved in copper extrusion from the cell.</rdfs:comment>
