<rdfs:comment>A P-type ATPase that undergoes covalent phosphorylation during the transport cycle.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, present in prokaryotes and photosynthetic eukaryotes, exports Zn(2+) and the related cations Cd(2+) and Pb(2+).</rdfs:comment>
