<skos:altLabel>Mg(2+)-importing ATPase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>Mg(2+)-transporting ATPase</skos:altLabel>
<skos:altLabel>Mg(2+)-transporting P-type ATPase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="7.2.2.14#SIP5ED0AC4ABBE9C63A"/>
<rdfs:comment>A P-type ATPase that undergoes covalent phosphorylation during the transport cycle.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>A bacterial enzyme that imports Mg(2+) with, rather than against, the Mg(2+) electrochemical gradient.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme is also involved in Ni(2+) import.</rdfs:comment>
