<rdf:Description rdf:about="7.4.2.13">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/core/Enzyme"/>
<skos:prefLabel>ABC-type tyrosine transporter</skos:prefLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="7.4.2.13#SIP95A61B462BE0198F"/>
<rdfs:comment>An ATP-binding cassette (ABC) type transporter, characterized by the presence of two similar ATP-binding domains/proteins and two integral membrane domains/proteins.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme, found in Clostridioides, interacts with an extracytoplasmic substrate binding lipoprotein and mediates the import of L-tyrosine.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>L-phenylalanine is also tranported however with lower efficiency.</rdfs:comment>
<citation rdf:resource="http://purl.uniprot.org/citations/29867812"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="7.4.2.-"/>
<skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="7.4.2.-"/>
</rdf:Description>
