<activity rdf:resource="7.5.2.9#SIP6BA465B0C0E9509C"/>
<rdfs:comment>ATP-binding cassette (ABC) type transporter, characterized by the presence of two similar ATP-binding domains/proteins and two integral membrane domains/proteins.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme from Escherichai coli interacts with a periplasmic substrate binding protein and mediates the high affinity uptake of D-galactofuranose.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The periplasmic binding protein exhibits selective binding of D-galactofuranose over D-galactopyranose.</rdfs:comment>
