<rdfs:comment>ATP-binding cassette (ABC) type transporter, characterized by the presence of two similar ATP-binding domains.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Does not undergo phosphorylation during the transport process.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>An enzyme that exports capsular polysaccharide in Gram-negative bacteria.</rdfs:comment>
