<skos:altLabel>LsrACDB (gene names)</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="7.6.2.13#SIP7E30686B59603921"/>
<rdfs:comment>ATP-binding cassette (ABC) type transporter, characterized by the presence of two similar ATP-binding domains/proteins and two integral membrane domains/proteins.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>A bacterial enzyme that interacts with an extracytoplasmic substrate binding protein and mediates the uptake of the signaling molecule (2R,4S)-2-methyl-2,3,3,4-tetrahydoxytetrahydrofuran (also known as autoinducer-2).</rdfs:comment>
