<skos:altLabel>putrescine transporting ATPase</skos:altLabel>
<activity rdf:resource="7.6.2.16#SIP05D63840111B4A44"/>
<rdfs:comment>ATP-binding cassette (ABC) type transporter, characterized by the presence of two similar ATP-binding domains/proteins and two integral membrane domains/proteins.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>The enzyme from the bacterium Escherichia coli interacts with an extracytoplasmic substrate binding protein and mediates the high affinity uptake of putrescine.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:comment>Differs in specificity from EC 7.6.2.11, ABC-type polyamine transporter.</rdfs:comment>
